1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
﻿*My body feels light, like I'm drifting through the ocean; my weight even more insubstantial than a jellyfish's.*

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
*I glance about me, my eyelids fluttering, but I can't see much of anything. It's pitch black.*

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
*It feels a bit like I'm falling through a void.*

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:26,000
*I reach out, trying to grab hold of something, and as I do, I hear a voice calling to me from somewhere within this darkened abyss.*

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worried voice: "Hiroki! That is you, isn't it, Hiroki?"

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Worried voice: "I've missed you so much!"

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Grumpy voice: "I-It's... not like I care about you or anything, dummy, but... Well... I-It has been a while, I-I suppose..."

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
*Make that, two voices.*

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
*I blink. My eyes widen.*

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
*The darkness about me dissipates, and then...*

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
*I see them standing in front of me: two women that I know very well.*

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000
*One of the women has short cyan hair, while the other sports long (ostentatiously long, or so I've often thought) pigtails.*

14
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:13,000
*Both these women are wearing skimpy outfits, which come complete with fluttering, bat-like wings and twitchy tails, and they both have horns sprouting from their scalps.*

15
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:21,000
*They're very pretty - downright adorable, in fact - but it's obvious, at a glance, that they're not ordinary women.*

16
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
*They aren't even humans.*

17
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
*They're both succubi - not that anybody else knows about this.*

18
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:36,000
*To the world at large, these women are Ikue Ayu and Cosmos Moretti: Ayu, a famous idol, and Cosmos, a popular RapidPound star.*

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:47,000
*They're both well-known; Ayu for releasing cutesy songs which sell like hotcakes, and Cosmos for posting photos of herself online wearing... well, not very much.*

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:02:01,000
*Though these girls have legions of adoring fans (I know Cosmos has even more RapidPound followers than Ayu does: a fact which has caused Ayu no end of irritation), none of their fans know about their real natures.*

21
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:07,000
*I think I might be the only guy in Japan - no, the world - who knows what they really are.*

22
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:14,000
*Ayu and Cosmos were born as succubi, and they both answer to the ruler of the succubus realm, Yue.*

23
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:21,000
*They both possess magical power, but they can only use their powers if enough humans adore them.*

24
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:34,000
*While succubi can maintain their forms in the human realm by being intimate with other humans, they can also sustain themselves by being loved: which, in other words, requires them to be popular.*

25
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:42,000
*Most succubi, therefore, have positions of importance: be it as singers, models, actresses, sports stars, or successful CEOs.*

26
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:47,000
*I know a lot of succubi, and each of them falls into one of these categories...*

27
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
*But I'm getting ahead of myself.*

28
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
*I'm with Ayu and Cosmos now, so I'd better focus on them.*

29
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:02,000
*Is it just my imagination (since this is a dream, I suppose this is all a figment of my imagination), or do they look a little sad?*

30
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:10,000
*Ayu's mood changes all the time, so seeing her frowning isn't too unusual, but it's rare for Cosmos to look so dispirited.*

31
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,000
*The pair of them are holding my hands: Ayu taking the right, Cosmos, the left.*

32
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:20,000
*They stare at me, their jewel-like eyes fringed with long lashes, and say...*

33
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:28,000
Ayu: "D-Don't get the wrong idea, a-alright? It's not like I came to check up on you because I've been missing you!"

34
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:34,000
Ayu: "I really couldn't care less; not at all! I-I was just wondering how you've been."

35
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Ayu: "You're so useless, I can't imagine you know how to get along without me!"

36
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Cosmos: "Now, now, Ayu, don't be like that."

37
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Cosmos: "I know you wanted to see Hiroki, too. You told me yourself!"

38
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Cosmos: "You don't have to lie about your feelings all of the time. Doesn't that make you sad?"

39
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Ayu: "Hmph..."

40
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,000
*Ayu pouts, then turns her nose up in the air.*

41
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Ayu: "L-Like you care about my feelings..."

42
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Cosmos: "But I do care about them! You know I do! We're best friends for a reason!"

43
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Ayu: "B-Best friends"?"

44
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,000
*Ayu scowls.*

45
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Ayu: "Since when were we friends, full stop, let alone "best" ones?! You're getting way too ahead of yourself!"

46
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Hiroki: "Hey, you two..."

47
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:22,000
*I look between Ayu and Cosmos, perplexed by their disagreement.*

48
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,000
*This is a dream, right?*

49
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:31,000
*I was certain this was a dream, at least, but Ayu and Cosmos's interactions feel way too realistic for that.*

50
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:40,000
*I might be a photographer, but my imagination's not this good. I can't conjure up arguments as inane and Ayu and Cosmos's on a dime!*

51
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,000
Hiroki: "What's going on? I'm asleep, aren't I...?"

52
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Cosmos: "Oh, yes! That's right. You are asleep, indeed."

53
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Hiroki: "Then, this is a dream?"

54
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Cosmos: "Not necessarily."

55
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Hiroki: "I beg your pardon?"

56
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,000
*I blink.*

57
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:58,000
Hiroki: "If I'm asleep, then this must be a dream, mustn't it?"

58
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:08,000
Ayu: "It's a dream, yeah, but that doesn't mean this isn't real. Cosmos and I are here, and we're talking to you: just not with our physical bodies."

59
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Ayu: "Still..."

60
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:12,000
*Ayu gives my captive hand a squeeze.*

61
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Ayu: "It feels realistic enough, doesn't it?"

62
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Hiroki: "It sure does..."

63
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:19,000
*This is getting kind of freaky.*

64
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:23,000
Hiroki: "Then, are you both talking to me in my sleep?"

65
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Cosmos: "Bingo. You're right on the money, hehe."

66
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,000
Hiroki: "Wow, uh..."

67
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:35,000
*I shake my head - or, I guess my "dream self" does. In actuality, my body's still lying in bed, curled up beneath my sheets.*

68
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:41,000
Hiroki: "I think I get it. You must be using your succubus powers to speak to me, right?"

69
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:48,000
Ayu: "Exactly. I thought we should utilize them every once in a while, else you'd forget what we really are."

70
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:55,000
Ayu: "Cosmos and I are succubi, don't forget. We have abilities you puny humans could only dream of!"

71
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Hiroki: "Well, I am dreaming right now..."

72
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,000
*I reply, with a wry smile.*

73
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:09,000
Hiroki: "So, what's up? Something must be important, for the pair of you to drop in like this in the midst of one of my REM cycles."

74
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:15,000
Hiroki: "You must have something major to tell me, if you couldn't send me a text or an email."

75
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:24,000
Cosmos: "You're right about that. I use my phone a lot, but there are some matters so important, only face-to-face communication can cut it."

76
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:30,000
Cosmos: "I'm an awkward person, so I prefer talking online, but when it comes to you..."

77
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:34,000
*Cosmos leans towards me, her breath warm upon my cheek.*

78
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Cosmos: "You're special, Hiroki."

79
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:42,000
Cosmos: "I like you so much, I would far rather be able to see your face when we speak."

80
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:46,000
Cosmos: "Talking across a long distance doesn't feel right."

81
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Hiroki: "Wow..."

82
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:51,000
*I shiver, a little perturbed by Cosmos's closeness.*

83
00:06:51,000 --> 00:07:05,000
*It really does feel like I'm standing with Ayu and Cosmos, face-to-face(-to-face?), having a conversation - though, given the nebulous nature of our surroundings, I'm not sure where we're standing, exactly.*

84
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,000
*Somewhere in the void?*

85
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:16,000
*The void has gotten awfully sparkly, though, since Ayu and Cosmos saw fit to materialize themselves. I wonder if that's their doing?*

86
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,000
Cosmos: "I like this. It feels more intimate."

87
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Hiroki: "Intimate" is one word for it, yeah..."

88
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:32,000
*Personally, I think this whole experience is a little freaky - but, well, I thought the same thing after Cosmos broke into my house that one time.*

89
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:37,000
*What's breaking into somebody's subconscious, after pulling a stunt like that?*

90
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:40,000
*I should be used to this kind of thing.*

91
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Hiroki: "So, did something happen?"

92
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Cosmos: "Yes, it did. Ayu missed you. She said she couldn't stand not being able to see your face, so she came to see me and-"

93
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Ayu: "Hey, Cosmos...!"

94
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:56,000
*Ayu glowers at Cosmos, her pretty features twisting with obvious embarrassment.*

95
00:07:56,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Ayu: "Don't tell Hiroki that! He doesn't need to know!"

96
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Cosmos: "But he asked. As his girlfriends, shouldn't we tell him the truth?"

97
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Ayu: "You might be content to be this loser's girlfriend-"

98
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:15,000
*Urgh. If I wasn't so used to Ayu's acid tongue, I might take umbrage at being called a "loser".*

99
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:21,000
*I know Ayu well enough, however, to know that she's not being serious - at least, not wholly.*

100
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:26,000
*If she was, she wouldn't be squeezing my hand as tightly as she is.*

101
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,000
Ayu: "-but I'm worth much, much more than that!"

102
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:32,000
Ayu: "Hiroki is nothing more than my cameraman!"

103
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Cosmos: "A cameraman that you can't keep away from."

104
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Ayu: "Wh-Who says I can't keep away from him? I only decided to check up on him out of the goodness of my heart, in case he was feeling lonely!"

105
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,000
Ayu: "I'm doing this for his sake!"

106
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,000
Cosmos: "So you say..."

107
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,000
*Cosmos frowns.*

108
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:59,000
Cosmos: "But, as far as I recall, you've been crying to me every night this week, wondering when Hiroki will come back from Astoria."

109
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,000
Cosmos: "Didn't you say, only yesterday... Ahem."

110
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:07,000
*Cosmos clears her throat, then launches into her best impression of Ayu.*

111
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Cosmos: "Oh, Cosmos, I'm so sad! I really can't take it anymore! Hiroki's been gone for so long, he'll definitely fall for another girl! He's so handsome, and he smells so good, I bet all the European succubi will flirt with him, and then-"

112
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Ayu: "Sh-Shut up...!"

113
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:29,000
*A scowling, red-faced Ayu retorts, while slamming her foot against Cosmos's.*

114
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:38,000
*This might be a dream, but I guess our bodies have some sort of heft to them - and the ability to feel pain, too - because Cosmos yelps.*

115
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Ayu: "Hiroki doesn't need to know all of these things! I-It isn't relevant! Besides, you're exaggerating! I'm not that insecure!"

116
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Ayu..."

117
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:55,000
*Noticing Ayu's discomfort (but how can I not? It rolls off her, like waves), I caress the top of her hand.*

118
00:09:55,000 --> 00:10:02,000
Hiroki: "You don't need to feel ashamed about your feelings. You can confide in me. I won't judge."

119
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:04,000
Ayu: "Wh-What...? Are you sure...?"

120
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:12,000
Hiroki: "I'm quite sure. I like talking to you - and, I've gotta admit, I was missing you and Cosmos a little, too."

121
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,000
Ayu: "You were...?"

122
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
*Ayu looks at me skeptically.*

123
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Ayu: "But why? Haven't you been busy, spending time with Hifumin, and Hazel, and Marina, and that fancy European princess?"

124
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Ayu: "I'm surprised you have enough time to think about me at all!"

125
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:40,000
Hiroki: "Of course I've been thinking about you. You and Cosmos are important to me  - and, while I won't lie and say I've not been having fun in Astoria, I'm looking forward to be reunited with you."

126
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,000
Hiroki: "You don't have to worry about that."

127
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:51,000
Hiroki: "If you're checking up on me because you're afraid I might've gotten bored of you, then there really is no need."

128
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:56,000
Hiroki: "My feelings for you aren't going to change: not that easily."

129
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Ayu: "Really...?"

130
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,000
*Ayu's brow furrows.*

131
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Ayu: "But didn't you agree to go on a date with that princess girl?"

132
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
Hiroki: "Well, about that..."

133
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:17,000
*I don't bother asking Ayu how she knows about my plans with Stephania. There's no point. Since Ayu's a succubus, there's a non-zero chance that she might have read my mind.*

134
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:22,000
*I don't see the point in trying to deny this, either; not when it's the truth.*

135
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,000
*I need to take this in my stride.*

136
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:27,000
Hiroki: "I am going on a date with Stephania, yes-"

137
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,000
Ayu: "Stephania"!"

138
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,000
*Ayu scoffs.*

139
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:35,000
Ayu: "I can't believe you're on first-name terms with a princess! How shameless can you be?!"

140
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:40,000
Cosmos: "I quite like it, hehe. I'm glad my boyfriend is so desirable."

141
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Cosmos: "Steffy has good taste~"

142
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Ayu: "And now you're calling her "Steffy", though you've never even met her?! You're being awfully over-familiar, aren't you?!"

143
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:59,000
Hiroki: "-but, though I like Stephania, and I think she's cute, our relationship won't diminish the feelings I have towards the pair of you."

144
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,000
Hiroki: "You'll always be my favorite idol, Ayu..."

145
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:08,000
*Not that she's up against particularly stiff competition, given I'm not big into idol music.*

146
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:12,000
Hiroki: "...and you'll always be adorable girlfriend, Cosmos..."

147
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:18,000
*That, I reckon, will have a bigger impact on Cosmos than calling her "my favorite lewd model".*

148
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:26,000
Hiroki: "...so you can both rest easy. No matter where I am, or what's going on in my life, I'll never get bored of you."

149
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,000
Ayu: "R-Really?"

150
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,000
*Shyly, Ayu glances at me.*

151
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Ayu: "D-Do you mean that...?"

152
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Hiroki: "Every single word."

153
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Hiroki: "The three of us can go on a date together, if you want, when I get back to Japan. Would you like that?"

154
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,000
Cosmos: "A date...?!"

155
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:49,000
*Cosmos stares at me, her eyes sparkling. Her tail, I can't help but note, twitches at this prospect, like a puppy's.*

156
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:56,000
Cosmos: "That sounds like fun! I want to go on a date with you, Hiroki! It feels like it's been a long time."

157
00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Cosmos: "I'll have to pick something cute to wear, hehe~"

158
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Ayu: "Hmph. Don't be stupid. You don't own any "cute" clothes; only shameless ones."

159
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Cosmos: "Shameless clothes can be cute, too!"

160
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Ayu: "Nuh-uh. You expose far too much skin. You ought to be careful, or Hiroki will think that you're easy."

161
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:23,000
Cosmos: "I'm not easy. I'm very selective when it comes to my partners. I've only ever dated Hiroki before."

162
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Cosmos: "You're just too difficult, Ayu."

163
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Cosmos: "You need to learn to say what you really think, or you'll never be happy, which is a shame."

164
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Cosmos: "As your bestie, I want you to thrive!"

165
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Ayu: "I-I wish you'd can it with the "bestie" stuff, really..."

166
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,000
*Ayu pouts.*

167
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:49,000
Ayu: "A-And I couldn't care less about going on some stupid date. I'm not about to get excited by something so simple."

168
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Ayu: "As a mature lady-"

169
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:59,000
*Ayu, mature? Please. Even disregarding her general attitude, the way she dresses is way too cutesy to be grown-up!*

170
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Ayu: "-I have sophisticated tastes. I'm not happy about this at all, but... Well."

171
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,000
*Ayu demurs, as I knew she would, her eyes affixed upon mine.*

172
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:11,000
Ayu: "I... appreciate the effort, I suppose."

173
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:18,000
Ayu: "Th-Thank you for always being so thoughtful, Hiroki. I'm glad you don't think I'm being too clingy, um..."

174
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:24,000
Ayu: "A-And I'll look forward to seeing you, wh-when your trip from Astoria is over."

175
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:26,000
Ayu: "I-I hope you have a good time."

176
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Hiroki: "I'm sure I will - and I wish you the same, too. Don't miss me too much, 'kay?"

177
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:39,000
Ayu: "A-As if I would! D-Don't get too ahead of yourself! I-I'm not crazy about you or anything..."

178
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:42,000
*Here, Ayu's voice drops to a whisper.*

179
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Ayu: "N-Not that crazy, at least."

180
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:52,000
Cosmos: "As for me, I'm not like Ayu. I don't mind being honest about my feelings, so I can tell you this upfront."

181
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Cosmos: "I am crazy about you, Hiroki."

182
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:59,000
Cosmos: "You're the best boyfriend in the whole wide world!"

183
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:04,000
Cosmos: "Now, I should go. I need to pick out my outfit for our date!"

184
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Ayu: "Let me help you with that."

185
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,000
Cosmos: "Do you want to?!"

186
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,000
*Cosmos beams.*

187
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Cosmos: "That's so nice of you, Ayu!"

188
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Ayu: "I'm not being "nice", moron. I'm just worried, if I let you choose an outfit on your own, you'll end up in something completely, utterly unfitting - just like that stupid cat maid bikini you wore to my beach house."

189
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:29,000
Cosmos: "What? I thought my bikini was cute..."

190
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Ayu: "Your sense of "cute" is rather different from everybody else's. Your tastes are utterly bizarre."

191
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,000
*Ayu snorts.*

192
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:47,000
Ayu: "If the three of us are going to go on a date together, I'd like you at least look like a normal person. I don't want us getting a lot of stares."

193
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Cosmos: "Is it bad if people stare at me...?"

194
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Ayu: "Yes, it is! We're not meant to draw attention to ourselves, stupid - and, besides, it's embarrassing!"

195
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:01,000
Ayu: "I don't want people to think I'm friends with a weirdo!"

196
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:04,000
Cosmos: "So, are you admitting that we are friends?"

197
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,000
Ayu: "Yes! I mean..."

198
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:08,000
*Ayu hastily backpedals, her face flushed.*

199
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:12,000
Ayu: "N-No, we're not! I don't care about you, n-not at all!"

200
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,000
Cosmos: "Hehe."

201
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:19,000
*Cosmos, who's even more familiar with Ayu and her mood swings than I am, giggles.*

202
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:24,000
Cosmos: "That's really nice of you, Ayu. I'm glad you care about me so much!"

203
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:28,000
Ayu: "I-I don't! Stop putting words into my mouth, you dummy!"

204
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:34,000
*Cosmos and Ayu both begin to fade from view, taking Ayu's one-sided bickering along with her.*

205
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:41,000
*I guess the dream they sent me is coming to an end - and, with it, my consciousness begins to return.*

206
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:44,000
*I blink, my eyelashes trembling, and then...*

207
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:47,000
???: "-sara? Mr. Ogasawara? Are you awake...?"

208
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,000
Hiroki: "Ah...!"

209
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
*I start, my eyelids widening, as roughly, I find myself pulled into the world of the living...*

210
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:59,000
*Though, in this case, "shaken" might be the most accurate word to use.*

211
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:04,000
*I can feel a pressure about my shoulders, and fingers curled against my skin.*

212
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:13,000
*My body shifts up and down - not, alas, of my own volition - and the back of my head hits against my pillow with a dull thwump.*

213
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:16,000
*It feels a bit like I'm enduring an earthquake.*

214
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:21,000
*I blink, white spots flaring momentarily across my vision, then stare.*

215
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:27,000
*The blurriness about the fringes of my vision eventually dissipates, and when it does...*

216
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,000
Elizabeth: "Mr. Ogasawara?"

217
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:34,000
*I eventually see what - or, in this case, "who" - was causing my discomfort.*

218
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:43,000
*A very pretty, almost porcelain face hovers above my own, in which are set a pair of bright red irises lined with full, white lashes.*

219
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:52,000
*This doll-like face is framed with masses of curly hair, which tumble about a pair of slender shoulders, clad in a black dress.*

220
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:59,000
*A few strands of this loose hair brushes against my cheeks, almost like an embrace, which makes me shiver.*

221
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:04,000
*I know, of course, who this face - and who this hair - belongs to.*

222
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:11,000
*This is Elizabeth, last name redacted: a maid who works in the service of the Astorian royal family.*

223
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:23,000
*Elizabeth is fiercely loyal to her mistress, the princess Stephania, and she would - from what I've gathered, after spending time with her - sacrifice her life for her lady's sake.*

224
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:29,000
*Elizabeth isn't engaged in any particularly death-defying feats right now, however.*

225
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:34,000
*She's doing nothing more strenuous than trying to get me out of bed.*

226
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:37,000
*I appreciate her attentiveness, although...*

227
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:38,000
Hiroki: "Hey, um..."

228
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:47,000
*Somewhat awkwardly, I survey Elizabeth. She's looming over me; her thighs pinning me in place on the mattress, so I can't escape.*

229
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:51,000
*As far as wake-up calls go, this one is pretty intimate.*

230
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:54,000
Hiroki: "Do you have to straddle me like that?"

231
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,000
Elizabeth: "Oh?"

232
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:58,000
*Elizabeth raises an eyebrow impassively.*

233
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:03,000
Elizabeth: "Do you have a problem with our current positions, Mr. Ogasawara?"

234
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Hiroki: "It's a bit awkward, yeah; especially first thing in the morning. If anybody were to walk in on us like this, they'd definitely get the wrong idea..."

235
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:19,000
Elizabeth: "Oh, you don't need to worry about that. Nobody will come in."

236
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:28,000
Elizabeth: "I've made it quite clear to the other maids that I shall be the only one to service you in the mornings, Mr. Ogasawara."

237
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,000
Hiroki: "Service me"?"

238
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:33,000
*I repeat this dumbly, a hot flush spreading across my face.*

239
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:46,000
*I don't think Elizabeth means that in a licentious manner (at least, I don't think she does), but this particular turn of phrase is conjuring up some pretty lewd imaginings in my depraved mind.*

240
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:55,000
*I don't suppose it helps that, not so very long ago, Elizabeth and I really did get all up close and personal in the bathroom...*

241
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,000
Elizabeth: "Yes, service you."

242
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:00,000
*Elizabeth affirms, with a nod of her head.*

243
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Elizabeth: "I would not let any of the palace's other maids, well-meaning though they may be, lay a finger upon you. They are not worthy of attending you."

244
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:20,000
Elizabeth: "You are a special guest of milady's and, as such, you deserve to be treated with the best maid milady has at her disposal: namely, myself."

245
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,000
Hiroki: "Whew..."

246
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,000
*I whistle.*

247
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Hiroki: "You're awfully confident in your abilities."

248
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:32,000
Elizabeth: "Should I not be? I know my worth, both as a maid and a woman - as should you."

249
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:37,000
Elizabeth: "There is nothing I would not do to appease you, Mr. Ogasawara."

250
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:42,000
*...Alright, if I had any doubts before, they've since been expunged.*

251
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:51,000
*It can be hard to tell with Elizabeth, given she tends towards the emotionless, but I'm pretty sure she's trying to flirt with me.*

252
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:53,000
*There's nothing else this could be!*

253
00:20:53,000 --> 00:21:00,000
Elizabeth: "...Still. I do not wish to command all of your attention: not this morning, at least."

254
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Elizabeth: "Your presence is wanted. That is why I came to awake you, and why I chose to employ such unconventional methods in doing so."

255
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:15,000
Elizabeth: "It is of paramount importance that you rouse yourself as quickly as possible."

256
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Hiroki: "Oh?"

257
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,000
*I blink.*

258
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Hiroki: "What's going on?"

259
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Elizabeth: "Do you not know?"

260
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,000
*Elizabeth examines me scathingly.*

261
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:29,000
Elizabeth: "Milady is waiting for you, and I am sure you do not wish to keep her on tenterhooks."

262
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Elizabeth: "I spoke to her the night prior, and it seems she is most looking forward to your date today."

263
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Elizabeth: "She is so very excited, it would be the height of rudeness to delay matters."

264
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:44,000
Hiroki: "Oh, riiiight."

265
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:47,000
*I nod, realization - at long last - dawning.*

266
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:51,000
*I think I must've been pretty out of it for this to slip my mind.*

267
00:21:51,000 --> 00:22:01,000
*That hyper-realistic dream I had about Ayu and Cosmos - planted, as I can now perceive, by Ayu and Cosmos themselves - must've scrambled my mind.*

268
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:06,000
*I can remember everything now, though. It's all falling into place.*

269
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,000
*Still...*

270
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:16,000
Hiroki: "I understand that, though I didn't know Stephania wanted me to take her out on a date today. We didn't make any concrete plans."

271
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,000
Hiroki: "I didn't realize-"

272
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Elizabeth: "That milady was being serious?"

273
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,000
*Elizabeth narrows her eyes.*

274
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:33,000
Elizabeth: "Please do not tell me, Mr. Ogasawara, that you made this promise with milady willy-nilly, with no intention of actually upholding it."

275
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:45,000
Elizabeth: "Milady has been eagerly anticipating this date all morning. She was so excited, in fact, she awoke at the crack of dawn, when the clock had only but struck 06:00."

276
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:54,000
Elizabeth: "Turning her down now would be an act of utmost cruelty, akin to crushing her poor, fragile heart beneath your unworthy heel."

277
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:58,000
Elizabeth: "As milady's top maid, I cannot condone that!"

278
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:05,000
Elizabeth: "If you cause milady pain, then I shall amplify said pain twofold, and inflict it upon you!"

279
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:10,000
*Elizabeth's pale fingers sink into my shoulders, just hard enough to hurt.*

280
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:16,000
Elizabeth: "Do you want me to insert pins beneath your fingernails, Mr. Ogasawara?"

281
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:27,000
Elizabeth: "I might appear dainty, but I assure you, I am strong enough to manage feats which would make a demon blush, for the sake of preserving milady's smile."

282
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:31,000
Hiroki: "What? No, of course I don't want that! Geez, Elizabeth!"

283
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:38,000
*I scramble back in bed, the covers rumpling about me, and get to my feet; staggering as I do so.*

284
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:43,000
Hiroki: "I'm not about to turn Stephania down! I'm excited about this date, too!"

285
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:49,000
Hiroki: "I'm just surprised, is all, about the timing! I didn't think we'd be going out so soon!"

286
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,000
Elizabeth: "And?"

287
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:52,000
*Elizabeth's eyes narrow.*

288
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:58,000
Elizabeth: "Is that a bad thing? Do you not wish to spend your time in milady's company?"

289
00:23:58,000 --> 00:24:00,000
Hiroki: "Now, did I say that?"

290
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:03,000
Elizabeth: "Not in those exact words, I suppose..."

291
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Hiroki: "Then don't go leaping to wild conclusions."

292
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:16,000
Hiroki: "I get that you care about Stephania - your loyalty is remarkable, really - but I'm not some scumbag who's about to take her for a ride."

293
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:25,000
Hiroki: "I'm just tired, is all. I had a pretty intense dream last night, and I didn't get much sleep. I'm still kind of dazed."

294
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:32,000
Hiroki: "That doesn't mean I'm not happy about all this, though. That couldn't be further from the truth."

295
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:41,000
Hiroki: "I think I'm a pretty fortunate guy, all things considered, that a cute girl like Stephania has taken such an interest in me."

296
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:50,000
Hiroki: "If I seem hesitant about all of this, that's 'cause I can't help but feel like I'm not worthy of spending time with her."

297
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:51,000
Elizabeth: "...Hmm."

298
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:55,000
*Elizabeth presses her lips together in contemplation.*

299
00:24:55,000 --> 00:25:02,000
Elizabeth: "I suppose you have a point. Milady is a princess, while you are nothing but a commoner."

300
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, yeah. You don't have to spell it out."

301
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:08,000
Elizabeth: "However..."

302
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:12,000
*Elizabeth's expression softens, and once more, she appraises me.*

303
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:21,000
Elizabeth: "For a commoner, you are rather considerate. I am happy to hear that you are thinking of milady, despite my threats."

304
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:27,000
Elizabeth: "Am I to take it you have no qualms in spending the day with milady, then?"

305
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:30,000
Hiroki: "I've one or two qualms, I guess..."

306
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:45,000
*Some of which involve my fear that the paparazzi might find out about this, and publicize my relationship with Astoria's princess, and others of which involve my newfound fear Elizabeth might gut me if I fail to satisfy Stephania.*

307
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:49,000
Hiroki: "But, what the heck. I'm not about to make Stephania cry."

308
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:59,000
Hiroki: "If she wants to go on a date with me, then I'll do my best to satisfy her. It's the least I can do, when she's been such a gracious hostess."

309
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:03,000
Elizabeth: "Wonderful. I am very pleased to hear it."

310
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:07,000
Elizabeth: "I will hasten to inform milady of the good news."

311
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:17,000
Elizabeth: "You should really get dressed first, however. You can hardly speak to milady in that slovenly state: not when you are to go on a date."

312
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:20,000
Elizabeth: "You need to make a good impression!"

313
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Hiroki: "I know, Mom."

314
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:22,000
*I click my tongue.*

315
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:26,000
Hiroki: "Just give me a little while to get ready, 'kay?"

316
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:34,000
Elizabeth: "I will give you fifteen - no, ten minutes. Keeping milady waiting any longer would be an unpardonable crime."

317
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:38,000
Elizabeth: "Please don't make me break your kneecaps."

318
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:39,000
Hiroki: "R-Right..."

319
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,000
*I shudder.*

320
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:45,000
*Elizabeth's voice is so staid, I can't tell how serious she's being.*

321
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:52,000
*Would she really inflict bodily harm upon me if I take a second too long with my morning ablutions?*

322
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:59,000
*I thought Elizabeth was a sensible woman, but I'm starting to think she might be even scarier than Yue.*

323
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:10,000
*I wash my face and brush my teeth in double-quick time, mindful of Elizabeth's threats, then pull on a set of clothes warm enough to insulate me from the wintry winds.*

324
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:18,000
*Freshly dressed and ready to go, I then reconvene with Elizabeth, who was waiting for me dutifully outside my bedroom door.*

325
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:27,000
*Elizabeth then escorts me through the expansive hallways of the palace, and down an impressive set of steps, to the ground floor.*

326
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:35,000
*This is the same route I've taken numerous times during my stay in the palace, and it's become almost familiar to me.*

327
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:40,000
*I don't necessarily need Elizabeth's guidance, but I accept it nonetheless.*

328
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:51,000
*I'm only too aware that, as a maid, Elizabeth takes nothing more seriously than her duties towards A) Princess Stephania, and B) Princess Stephania's guests.*

329
00:27:51,000 --> 00:28:00,000
*I'm a bit fearful that, if I were to shrug aside Elizabeth's offers to help with a churlish, "I can do it myself", I might offend her.*

330
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:08,000
*I can't see any reason to make enemies with Stephania's dearest ally, so I choose, instead, to comply with her.*

331
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:14,000
*Eventually, we make it the parlor, where Stephania is waiting - and, the moment I see her...*

332
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:15,000
Hiroki: "Oh..."

333
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:21,000
*...I feel what little breath I still possess, after my walk through the palace, leaving me.*

334
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:31,000
*Stephania isn't attired, for once, in in her blue and white gown, replete with the tiara - and she isn't wearing her wispy lilac nightgown, either.*

335
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:40,000
*Stephania is clad, instead, in a sweet dress with a bell-shaped skirt, which fans out about her thighs like the head of a flower.*

336
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:49,000
*To complete the look, she's wearing a thick, cable-knit cardigan, and her blonde, fluffy hair is tied back into two girlish pigtails.*

337
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:57,000
*Stephania's outfit is comprised of pale blue and mint green shades, with a lot of white thrown in for good measure.*

338
00:28:57,000 --> 00:29:08,000
*Her skirt is short enough to off her slender legs, which are clad in a pair of white, knee-high stockings, but her overall appearance isn't at all scandalous.*

339
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:15,000
*If I had to describe Stephania's outfit in one word, perhaps I'd use "cozy". She looks incredibly fluffy.*

340
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:21,000
*When she's dressed as a princess, Stephania gives off a certain air of regal authority.*

341
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:33,000
*In these clothes, however, she looks much more like your average girl next-door; the sort who'd be willing to pour you a glass of barley tea, and listen to all your work-related woes.*

342
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:41,000
*She looks pretty - that much is undeniable - but it's in an innocent, unassuming sort of way which makes my heart melt.*

343
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:48,000
*I thought Stephania looked good in her nightgown, but I think I might have to reassess my previous opinion.*

344
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:53,000
*This outfit makes it apparent that she does, in fact, look good in everything.*

345
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:55,000
Stephania: "Oh, Hiroki...!"

346
00:29:55,000 --> 00:30:01,000
*Stephania greets me shyly when I enter the parlor, both her hands clasped at her front.*

347
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:10,000
*She didn't seem at all abashed last night, after she happened upon me in her nightclothes, but now she looks much more self-conscious.*

348
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:15,000
*She's so awkward, in fact, she's having genuine trouble meeting my eye.*

349
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:16,000
*I wonder why.*

350
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:23,000
*She's actually wearing more clothes now than she was last night. Why, then, is her face so flushed?*

351
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:27,000
Stephania: "It is, um... V-Very good to see you. Um..."

352
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:30,000
Stephania: "Wh-What do you think of my outfit?"

353
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:32,000
Hiroki: "I think you look great."

354
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:35,000
*I answer without pause, earnestly enough.*

355
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:47,000
*I'm not sure what else there is for me to say, really, other than a more bombastic "you look freaking amazing", which would probably embarrass Stephania more than she is already.*

356
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:50,000
Stephania: "D-Do you really think so...?"

357
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:55,000
*Stephania looks down at herself, uncertainty written across her fair face.*

358
00:30:55,000 --> 00:31:00,000
Stephania: "I-I'm not accustomed to dressing in clothes such as this."

359
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:08,000
Stephania: "In the palace, I usually wear fancy gowns and dresses that my mother picks out for me - and, of course, my tiara."

360
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:12,000
Stephania: "Without all my finery, I feel somewhat naked."

361
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:22,000
Stephania: "Elizabeth assured me, as she helped me dress this morning, that all girls wear clothes such as this when they go on dates, but I'm uncertain."

362
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:30,000
Stephania: "I know so little about the world outside the palace, it's impossible for me to say what's "normal" and what isn't!"

363
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:32,000
Stephania: "This dress..."

364
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:35,000
*Stephania picks at the hem of said dress.*

365
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:38,000
Stephania: "Do you think it's too short for me?"

366
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:46,000
Elizabeth: "It is somewhat short, yes, but that is simply how women wear their skirts nowadays. It is a fashion statement."

367
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:53,000
Elizabeth: "Were the hem any longer, you would be taken for one with no knowledge of modern trends."

368
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:58,000
Elizabeth: "You don't want to look like your grandmother, Lady Gertrude, do you?"

369
00:31:58,000 --> 00:32:01,000
Stephania: "O-Oh, no! Perish the thought!"

370
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:10,000
Stephania: "I would like to look "hip" and "trendy" - is that what the youths of today say? - b-but I think there should be some limits..."

371
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:18,000
*Stephania continues to tug at the hem of her skirt, all the while wearing an expression which borders on anguished.*

372
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:23,000
Stephania: "A-A sudden gust of wind would be enough to expose everything...!"

373
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:27,000
Hiroki: "I guess that's a possibility, yeah... But don't worry."

374
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:35,000
Hiroki: "If you're scared about exposing too much, I can lend you my coat. It should be able to cover most of you up."

375
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:40,000
Stephania: "That is very kind of you, but would that really be alright...?"

376
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:50,000
Hiroki: "Sure. We're going on a date, so it's my job to see to it that you're comfortable. My coat is yours for the taking, should you ever need it."

377
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:53,000
Hiroki: "You only have to ask, milady."

378
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:56,000
*I drop Stephania an exaggerated bow.*

379
00:32:56,000 --> 00:33:02,000
*I'm only joking, really, but Stephania seems to take my words in earnest, because she smiles.*

380
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:08,000
Stephania: "Wh-Why, thank you. That is very kind of you, ehehe. I feel a lot better now."

381
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:17,000
Stephania: "I'm still a bit anxious about this outfit - it sits so very strangely on me! - b-but, well, I suppose that is the point."

382
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:24,000
Stephania: "I asked Elizabeth to sew me something quite unlike my usual clothes, so nobody would recognize me."

383
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:27,000
Stephania: "This is part of my disguise!"

384
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:31,000
Hiroki: "Oh? Did you make this outfit yourself, Elizabeth?"

385
00:33:31,000 --> 00:33:33,000
Elizabeth: "I did, indeed."

386
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:39,000
Elizabeth: "Milady asked last night that I prepare suitable clothes for today's date."

387
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:51,000
Elizabeth: "Not wishing to disappoint her, I stayed up all night researching various fashion trends, and collating them, in order to craft something that would show off all her charms."

388
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:59,000
Elizabeth: "Once I had a pattern down, I set to work procuring the fabrics from my stores, and sewing everything together."

389
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:04,000
Elizabeth: "I was kept so busy, I had but a scant hour of sleep last night."

390
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:05,000
Hiroki: "An hour?!"

391
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:08,000
*My eyebrows shoot up my forehead in surprise.*

392
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:11,000
Hiroki: "That's kind of intense. Aren't you tired?"

393
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:21,000
Elizabeth: "Somewhat, yes. My own feelings of exhaustion, however, are immaterial. I am merely happy to see milady looking so lovely, as I knew she would."

394
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:29,000
Elizabeth: "If she asked, I would gladly give up all of my sleep for her sake. That is the extent of my feelings for milady."

395
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:33,000
Elizabeth: "She deserves nothing less, being so charming!"

396
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:37,000
Hiroki: "I agree, Stephania does look cute in her outfit..."

397
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,000
Stephania: "Eep...!"

398
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:42,000
Hiroki: "...but you need to take care of yourself too, Elizabeth."

399
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:52,000
Hiroki: "Maybe you should take a nap today, if you can? I'll look after Stephania in your stead, so don't you fret. I'm sure I can show her a good time."

400
00:34:52,000 --> 00:34:55,000
Stephania: "Oh, Hiroki! You're so cool...!"

401
00:34:55,000 --> 00:35:00,000
*Stephania sighs breathlessly; swayed, I think, by my reassurances.*

402
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:03,000
*Elizabeth, meanwhile, looks similarly appeased.*

403
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:07,000
*A small smile captures her lips, and lightly, she says...*

404
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:16,000
Elizabeth: "Were you any other man, I would question your words. When you speak hence, however, I cannot help but feel reassured."

405
00:35:16,000 --> 00:35:25,000
Elizabeth: "Perhaps I will take you up on your kind offer and allow myself to rest. I hope only that the pair of you enjoy yourselves."

406
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:30,000
Elizabeth: "There is nothing that makes me happier than your happiness, milady."

407
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:31,000
*Some time later...*

408
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:41,000
Stephania: "Goodness, Rosenberg is so scenic! I had no idea how lovely it was; particularly during this time of year, when the ground is all frozen!"

409
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:45,000
Stephania: "It looks just like a scene from a storybook!"

410
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:54,000
*A cheerfully smiling Stephania glances about the paved city streets, her pale blonde hair fluttering with every step she takes.*

411
00:35:54,000 --> 00:36:05,000
*It's a cool day, despite the wan sunshine which shimmers through gaps in the clouds, and a gentle breeze nudges the ends of Stephania's hair and the hem of her dress.*

412
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:12,000
*It's a wonder she isn't cold. I feel cold simply looking at her. She's displaying quite a lot of her thighs.*

413
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:22,000
*I ask Stephania whether she's alright (I've not forgotten my earlier promise to lend her my coat, if the need should arise), but she refuses laughingly.*

414
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:28,000
Stephania: "Oh, no, I'm quite alright. Thank you for your concern, though, Hiroki!"

415
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:31,000
Hiroki: "Are you sure? It's pretty nippy today."

416
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:39,000
Stephania: "Yes, I suppose it is. I'm used to it, though. Astoria is a very cold country. Even our summers are mild."

417
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:47,000
Stephania: "As a child, I used to play out in the snowdrifts with my nurse. I loved going sledding in the hills, hehe."

418
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:57,000
Stephania: "I would often end up stuck, head-first, in the snow. My nurse had to uproot me like a turnip, and shake the snowflakes from my hair!"

419
00:36:57,000 --> 00:37:02,000
Stephania: "I never minded, though. I thought it was a good deal of fun!"

420
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:07,000
Hiroki: "And you never caught hypothermia while you were playing outdoors?"

421
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:08,000
Stephania: "Well..."

422
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:12,000
*Stephania smiles coyly, her fingers linked at her front.*

423
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:18,000
Stephania: "Maybe I did, once or twice, but I never suffered from any serious ailments."

424
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:21,000
Stephania: "We Astorians are a hardy bunch, hehe!"

425
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:25,000
Stephania: "I mightn't look it, but I'm very strong!"

426
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:29,000
*Stephania flexes her non-existent muscles, which makes me smile.*

427
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:34,000
*If Stephania were even slenderer than she is, her arms would be like sticks.*

428
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:39,000
*I don't think all that karuta has done much to help tone her body.*

429
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:50,000
Stephania: "Really, though, it's been a long while since last visited Rosenberg! It looks much the same as it did when I was a girl, but it seems even more exciting now!"

430
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:52,000
Stephania: "I wonder why..."

431
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:56,000
Hiroki: "Maybe it's because you're not with your servants today?"

432
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:58,000
Stephania: "Yes, that might be so!"

433
00:37:58,000 --> 00:38:07,000
Stephania: "When I was a little girl, my nurse accompanied me everywhere. Then, when I grew older, Lizzie became my new companion."

434
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:15,000
Stephania: "I've spent so much of my life with Lizzie, I can't recall the last time I set foot outside the palace without her."

435
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:21,000
Stephania: "I appreciate her company, of course - she's a very dear friend of mine - but..."

436
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:23,000
*Stephania sighs wistfully.*

437
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:32,000
Stephania: "Sometimes, I wish Lizzie wouldn't baby me so much. I'm a grown woman, and I'm more than capable of looking after myself."

438
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:40,000
Stephania: "Other girls my age aren't accompanied by their maids when they go outside. They have much more freedom than I do!"

439
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:50,000
Hiroki: "Well, you have that freedom now. I'm not about to tell you what you can and can't do - not unless you get some truly crazy ideas into your head."

440
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:52,000
Stephania: "Truly crazy?"

441
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:53,000
Stephania: "Such as?"

442
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:59,000
Hiroki: "Shaving off all your lovely blonde hair, I guess - or running away to join a circus."

443
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:06,000
Hiroki: "I don't think Elizabeth would be happy if I let you do that, and neither would your parents."

444
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:07,000
Stephania: "Oh my!"

445
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:08,000
*Stephania giggles.*

446
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:19,000
Stephania: "I cannot deny, I have wondered what it would be like to be a trapeze artist, or how it would feel to ride on the back of a tiger through a flaming hoop..."

447
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:21,000
Hiroki: "Stephania, no!!!"

448
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,000
Stephania: "But..."

449
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:25,000
*Stephania grins, her green eyes glinting coyly.*

450
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:34,000
Stephania: "I think going on a nice, normal date with you sounds more enjoyable than all the grand old adventures in all the world!"

451
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:37,000
*...Ah, I see. So, she was just teasing me.*

452
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:43,000
*Stephania's more mischievous than she might look. Her current smile is downright impish.*

453
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,000
Hiroki: "Geez..."

454
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:46,000
*I exhale, my shoulders slumping.*

455
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:51,000
*It's so cold, my breath escape my pursed lips in a translucent cloud, like mist.*

456
00:39:51,000 --> 00:39:56,000
Hiroki: "You almost gave me a heart attack. Don't say scary things like that."

457
00:39:56,000 --> 00:40:05,000
Hiroki: "I've never had to look out for a princess before. It's a pretty heavy responsibility as it is, without you making it worse."

458
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:08,000
Stephania: "Hehe~ Sorry about that, Hiroki."

459
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:12,000
*Still giggling, Stephania loops her arm through mine.*

460
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:24,000
Stephania: "I'll try to behave myself while we're together, but please, let me have some fun. It's so horribly stuffy in the palace, I need to cut loose every once in a while."

461
00:40:24,000 --> 00:40:31,000
Hiroki: "Cutting loose is fine, so long as you don't seriously mean to ride on the backs of any tigers."

462
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:36,000
Stephania: "I shan't! I will be on my best behavior (to an extent): I promise!"

463
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:37,000
Stephania: "Now..."

464
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:42,000
*Stephania scans the plaza, and soon, her eyes alight upon an intriguing sight.*

465
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:50,000
*There's a food cart not too far away which is painted in pastel hues, from which a delectable aroma is wafting.*

466
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:57,000
*Based on all its signage, this cart looks like it's dedicated to the making and selling of crêpes.*

467
00:40:57,000 --> 00:40:59,000
Stephania: "Ooh! Hiroki, Hiroki!"

468
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:07,000
*Stephania tugs at my arm like a woman possessed, then points with childish glee towards the aforementioned cart.*

469
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:19,000
Stephania: "Can we get crêpes? Please, please, pretty please? I've not had a crêpe in years, and they really are delicious, especially with chocolate sauce and whipped cream!"

470
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:22,000
Hiroki: "You like whipped cream on your crêpes?"

471
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:26,000
*Stephania beams, then snuggles up beside me even more intimately.*

472
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:32,000
*She's being so familiar, this "date" is starting to feel like the genuine article.*

473
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:38,000
*It's almost like we're an actual lovey-dovey couple, come out to enjoy the sights.*

474
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:43,000
*Next, we'll be sharing our food, holding hands, and taking selfies together.*

475
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:47,000
*...Darn. The thought's so sweet, my heart's starting to stammer.*

476
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:48,000
*Why am I blushing?*

477
00:41:48,000 --> 00:41:59,000
*I'm plenty used to female attention, given the whole "succubus harem" thing, but succubi don't go in for cutesy "dates" like this (succubi other than Cosmos, I mean).*

478
00:41:59,000 --> 00:42:07,000
*For all my experience when it comes to seduction, I don't have much experience with the softer, sweeter side of love.*

479
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:12,000
*It's been a long time, I muse, since I went out with a woman like this.*

480
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:15,000
*I guess I'd better make the most of it.*

481
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:18,000
Stephania: "Let's get going, Hiroki! I'm starving!"

482
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:23,000
Hiroki: "How can you be starving? You had breakfast only a couple of hours ago."

483
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:27,000
Stephania: "Exactly! That was hours ago, and I'm hungry again!"

484
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:29,000
Stephania: "Besides..."

485
00:42:29,000 --> 00:42:34,000
*Shyly, Stephania scuffs at the icy ground with the tip of her shoe.*

486
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:37,000
Stephania: "I didn't eat very much at breakfast."

487
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:38,000
Hiroki: "You didn't?"

488
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:39,000
*I blink.*

489
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:48,000
Hiroki: "I would've thought Elizabeth would be determined to get some good, hearty food into you. She seems like a commandeering sort."

490
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:56,000
Stephania: "She is, yes, and she was - but I was so excited about our date, my stomach was all tied up in knots..."

491
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:57,000
Hiroki: "Aah. I see."

492
00:42:57,000 --> 00:43:04,000
*I exhale with newfound understanding, my breath once more escaping my lips in a hazy cloud of condensation.*

493
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:13,000
Hiroki: "Well, if it's a crêpe you want, it's a crêpe you'll get. I'm determined to make all your dreams come true today, milady."

494
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:16,000
Stephania: "Hehe. Thanks, Hiroki. You're the best!"

495
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:19,000
*Stephania giggles - and then, quick as a flash...*

496
00:43:19,000 --> 00:43:20,000
Hiroki: "Aah..."

497
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:25,000
*...she stands on her tiptoes, and presses a kiss against my cheek.*

498
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:32,000
*It's a quick, fleeting sort of kiss, which doesn't linger, but it makes me blush even more regardless.*

499
00:43:32,000 --> 00:43:39,000
*This was only supposed to be a pretend date, but my feelings for Stephania are getting rather complicated.*

500
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:43,000
*I think I really might like her after all. How could I not?*

501
00:43:43,000 --> 00:43:45,000
*She's way too cute not to love.*

502
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:51,000
Stephania: "My goodness, this really is yummy! It's even better than I thought it would be!"

503
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,000
Hiroki: "Oh yeah?"

504
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:55,000
*I examine Stephania, smiling all the while.*

505
00:43:55,000 --> 00:44:01,000
*I bought a crêpe for her, at her sweetly-spoken behest, and now she's busy nibbling at it.*

506
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:07,000
*Stephania holds her crêpe, which is slotted into a cute cardboard container, in one hand.*

507
00:44:07,000 --> 00:44:17,000
*Stephania's other hand, meanwhile, rests against her cheek, upon which a small blob of cream rests; white and perfect, like a freshly-piped rosette.*

508
00:44:17,000 --> 00:44:23,000
*The crêpe I bought for Stephania is, as per her requests, full of strawberries and cream.*

509
00:44:23,000 --> 00:44:34,000
*It's so full of cream, in fact, I can see it trickling down the sides of the brown, freshly-cooked side of her crêpe; staining the tips of Stephania's dainty fingers.*

510
00:44:34,000 --> 00:44:40,000
*There's a bit of a breeze, and it blows as Stephania and I wander about Rosenberg's streets.*

511
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:47,000
*Stephania's blonde hair, tied back in two cute, girlish pigtails, flutter, as does the hem of her skirt.*

512
00:44:47,000 --> 00:45:00,000
*Stephania's attire is every bit as pastel as the pale pink cardboard container which holds her crêpe, and the splotches of cream on her cheeks seem - strangely enough - to complement her flushed skin.*

513
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:05,000
*Stephania looks so cute, crêpe in hand, she might as well be a painting.*

514
00:45:05,000 --> 00:45:11,000
*Framed as she is by all of Rosenberg's picturesque buildings, she reminds me of a fairy...*

515
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:14,000
Stephania: "Yes, indeed! This is simply delicious!"

516
00:45:14,000 --> 00:45:19,000
*A fairy with a fondness for whipped cream, and a massive sweet tooth.*

517
00:45:19,000 --> 00:45:27,000
Stephania: "The delicacies the palace's cooks prepare are wonderful too, of course, but they cannot compare to this!"

518
00:45:27,000 --> 00:45:34,000
Stephania: "It seems a wonder that food prepared upon the streets, before my very eyes, should taste so good!"

519
00:45:34,000 --> 00:45:44,000
Stephania: "I feel I've been awfully ignorant, growing up in luxury as I have, but now I'm beginning to see how wonderful simple pleasures like this can be!"

520
00:45:44,000 --> 00:45:46,000
Stephania: "Om, nom, nom..."

521
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:52,000
*Stephania takes another bite of her crêpe, her face glowing with sugar-induced happiness.*

522
00:45:52,000 --> 00:45:55,000
Stephania: "Oh, this really is divine!"

523
00:45:55,000 --> 00:46:01,000
Hiroki: "I'm glad to hear it! You really do look like you're enjoying that, although..."

524
00:46:01,000 --> 00:46:02,000
Stephania: "Although?"

525
00:46:02,000 --> 00:46:06,000
*Stephania inclines her head quizzically in my direction.*

526
00:46:06,000 --> 00:46:10,000
Stephania: "There isn't an issue with my etiquette, is there?"

527
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:18,000
Stephania: "I'm not accustomed to eating food with my hands. I do hope I'm not going about it in the wrong manner!"

528
00:46:18,000 --> 00:46:29,000
Hiroki: "No, it's fine. There aren't any issues with the way you're eating - you're being quite dainty, in fact! - but you do have a bit of cream on your cheek."

529
00:46:29,000 --> 00:46:30,000
Stephania: "I-I do?"

530
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:32,000
*Stephania stares at me, aghast.*

531
00:46:32,000 --> 00:46:34,000
Stephania: "I-I had no idea...!"

532
00:46:34,000 --> 00:46:39,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, you do. There's only a little cream, though. Don't worry about it."

533
00:46:39,000 --> 00:46:44,000
Stephania: "B-But I must worry about it! I must look like such a mess!"

534
00:46:44,000 --> 00:46:50,000
Stephania: "If Lizzie knew how clumsy I'm being, she would most certainly scold me!"

535
00:46:50,000 --> 00:46:57,000
Hiroki: "I dunno if she'd go quite that far. I think Elizabeth would be happy simply to see you having fun."

536
00:46:57,000 --> 00:47:05,000
Stephania: "Maybe so, but I was born a lady! I was taught to mind my manners from a young age! I'm letting myself down!"

537
00:47:05,000 --> 00:47:09,000
Stephania: "I don't want you think of me as slovenly!"

538
00:47:09,000 --> 00:47:16,000
Hiroki: "I don't think of you as slovenly. I was actually thinking, in fact, that you look very cute."

539
00:47:16,000 --> 00:47:18,000
Stephania: "C-Cute...?"

540
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:22,000
*Stephania stammers, her cheeks beginning to fluster.*

541
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:32,000
Stephania: "I-I'm not certain about that. I doubt I look very cute at the present: not with my face covered in cream! I must look like a street urchin!"

542
00:47:32,000 --> 00:47:43,000
Hiroki: "No, you do look cute. It's nice to see you getting so excited about food, of all things, and I'm glad you're not being too self-conscious around me."

543
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:51,000
Hiroki: "I think we'd both be enjoying ourselves much less if you were constantly worrying about the way you look."

544
00:47:51,000 --> 00:47:56,000
Hiroki: "I don't want you to feel self-conscious. I just want you to have fun."

545
00:47:56,000 --> 00:48:00,000
Hiroki: "We're not in the palace, so you needn't worry."

546
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:03,000
Stephania: "A-Are you quite certain about that?"

547
00:48:03,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Hiroki: "I am, indeed! I'll prove it, in fact!"

548
00:48:06,000 --> 00:48:14,000
*I take my phone out of my pocket, then hold it up, so the viewfinder is full of Stephania's cream-spattered face.*

549
00:48:14,000 --> 00:48:15,000
Stephania: "Hmm?"

550
00:48:15,000 --> 00:48:19,000
*Stephania observes me curiously, her brow furrowed.*

551
00:48:19,000 --> 00:48:22,000
Stephania: "What are you doing, Hiroki?"

552
00:48:22,000 --> 00:48:24,000
Hiroki: "What do you think?"

553
00:48:24,000 --> 00:48:25,000
*I grin.*

554
00:48:25,000 --> 00:48:29,000
Hiroki: "I'm going to take a photo of you, obviously."

555
00:48:29,000 --> 00:48:33,000
Stephania: "Wh-What...?! B-But why would you want to do that?"

556
00:48:33,000 --> 00:48:45,000
Hiroki: "Well, why not? You're cute, like I said, and I want to commemorate this moment. It's the first time you've ever had a crêpe, so it feels like a pretty big milestone!"

557
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:50,000
Stephania: "B-But my face is dirty...! You can't take a photo of me like this!"

558
00:48:50,000 --> 00:48:53,000
Hiroki: "I can and I will. I want to."

559
00:48:53,000 --> 00:49:03,000
Hiroki: "This is proof that you've gotten close enough to me to show off a more vulnerable side of yourself. I think you look perfectly precious."

560
00:49:03,000 --> 00:49:07,000
Stephania: "P-Precious...? D-Do you really think so...?"

561
00:49:07,000 --> 00:49:10,000
*Demurely, Stephania looks down at her feet.*

562
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:15,000
Stephania: "I-I'm not so sure about that. Th-This is all rather embarrassing."

563
00:49:15,000 --> 00:49:21,000
Stephania: "I-I've never had my photo taken like this before; n-not on the street, b-by a man..."

564
00:49:21,000 --> 00:49:23,000
Stephania: "B-But, well..."

565
00:49:23,000 --> 00:49:27,000
*Stephania inhales, then, gathering her courage, lifts her head.*

566
00:49:27,000 --> 00:49:32,000
*Her green eyes meet mine anew, and gently, her lips curve upwards into a smile.*

567
00:49:32,000 --> 00:49:42,000
Stephania: "Y-You're probably right. Lizzie wanted me to go on this date so I could experience new things, a-and this would definitely be new."

568
00:49:42,000 --> 00:49:48,000
Stephania: "I do feel a bit shy - not to mention self-conscious - but maybe that's a good thing?"

569
00:49:48,000 --> 00:49:54,000
Stephania: "My heart is pounding so hard, l-like it does when I'm playing karuta..."

570
00:49:54,000 --> 00:49:58,000
Stephania: "But it's a warm, gentle kind of feeling."

571
00:49:58,000 --> 00:50:05,000
Stephania: "I think it's alright if you want to take my photograph after all. I want to remember this day, too."

572
00:50:05,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Hiroki: "You do?"

573
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:15,000
*I might've been the one to suggest this, but I don't want to be too pushy, and neither do I want to make Stephania feel uncomfortable.*

574
00:50:15,000 --> 00:50:17,000
Hiroki: "Is this really alright?"

575
00:50:17,000 --> 00:50:20,000
Stephania: "It is, yes! I don't have any qualms."

576
00:50:20,000 --> 00:50:26,000
Stephania: "You can take a photo of me, even if my face is dirty. I'll give you permission."

577
00:50:26,000 --> 00:50:35,000
Stephania: "I wouldn't let anybody else take so many liberties with me, given my status as a princess, but when it comes to you..."

578
00:50:35,000 --> 00:50:40,000
Stephania: "You're special to me, Hiroki - and I really do like you."

579
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:42,000
*Later that evening...*

580
00:50:42,000 --> 00:50:45,000
Stephania: "Oh, I had such a good time today!"

581
00:50:45,000 --> 00:50:50,000
*Stephania smiles at me, her green eyes glittering with girlish joy.*

582
00:50:50,000 --> 00:51:05,000
*After wandering around Rosenberg for several hours, enjoying its sights and sampling a lot of food (mostly sweets), Stephania and I eventually wound up at a large Ferris wheel, located a stone's throw away from the main plaza.*

583
00:51:05,000 --> 00:51:10,000
*By this point, the sun has already set, and the sky is strewn with stars.*

584
00:51:10,000 --> 00:51:18,000
*The moon, meanwhile, hovers above the spokes of the giant Ferris wheel like a crystal ball; white, bright, and enigmatic.*

585
00:51:18,000 --> 00:51:30,000
*Stephania's face is illuminated, not only by the moon, but by the assortment of lights inserted into the chassis of the Ferris wheel, which flicker in the dark like fireflies.*

586
00:51:30,000 --> 00:51:42,000
*The gondola we were ushered into is fairly small, and there's not much space for the pair of us. We sit facing one another, packed in tight; my knees bumping against Stephania's.*

587
00:51:42,000 --> 00:51:52,000
*Fortunately, Stephania doesn't seem to mind the close proximity. She doesn't look at all bashful, as I feared she might be, on her very first date.*

588
00:51:52,000 --> 00:51:57,000
*Stephania, instead, seems to have enjoyed all we've done together thus far.*

589
00:51:57,000 --> 00:52:03,000
*That previous remark of hers all but confirmed it, unless she was simply trying to be polite?*

590
00:52:03,000 --> 00:52:12,000
*I doubt even the world's best actress could fake a smile as ebullient as the one which is currently playing about her lips, however.*

591
00:52:12,000 --> 00:52:16,000
*Stephania looks so happy, her face is positively glowing.*

592
00:52:16,000 --> 00:52:21,000
Stephania: "Thank you, Hiroki, for agreeing to this selfish wish of mine."

593
00:52:21,000 --> 00:52:30,000
Stephania: "I'm sure I've been a nuisance, dragging you about hither and thither so ceaselessly, but you never once complained."

594
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:37,000
Stephania: "You've put up with every single one of my whims - and, indeed, you've indulged in them."

595
00:52:37,000 --> 00:52:39,000
Stephania: "I am in your debt."

596
00:52:39,000 --> 00:52:46,000
Hiroki: "Hey, don't worry about it. You're making this day sound totally one-sided, but it wasn't: not at all."

597
00:52:46,000 --> 00:52:56,000
Hiroki: "Sure, you might've been a bit enthusiastic while we were walking around, but that's not at all a bad thing. I'm glad you had so much fun."

598
00:52:56,000 --> 00:52:58,000
Stephania: "You are...?"

599
00:52:58,000 --> 00:53:11,000
Hiroki: "Yeah! Shy, demure girls who hang back, letting the guy plan everything out, can be sweet in their own way, but it takes a real load off my shoulders when my partner takes some initiative."

600
00:53:11,000 --> 00:53:19,000
Hiroki: "I wouldn't have liked to dictate everything we did together; not when you were looking forward to this date so much."

601
00:53:19,000 --> 00:53:26,000
Hiroki: "It's... satisfying, I guess, that you trust me enough to tell me what you actually want to do."

602
00:53:26,000 --> 00:53:30,000
Hiroki: "It makes me feel like I've gotten even closer to you..."

603
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:33,000
Hiroki: "If that doesn't sound too forward?"

604
00:53:33,000 --> 00:53:37,000
Stephania: "Oh, no! I feel like I've become closer to you, too!"

605
00:53:37,000 --> 00:53:45,000
Stephania: "I liked you the moment I first laid eyes upon you, but I never knew I'd come to like you quite as much as I do."

606
00:53:45,000 --> 00:53:50,000
Stephania: "You are very dear to me, and you're so very considerate, too!"

607
00:53:50,000 --> 00:53:54,000
Hiroki: "I could say the same about you, Stephania... Um..."

608
00:53:54,000 --> 00:53:58,000
*I smile bashfully, and running a hand through my hair, say...*

609
00:53:58,000 --> 00:54:03,000
Hiroki: "Now that I come to think of it, I've been calling you that all day, huh?"

610
00:54:03,000 --> 00:54:07,000
Stephania: "Indeed, you have. Why? Is there a problem with it?"

611
00:54:07,000 --> 00:54:15,000
Hiroki: "Not at all. It took a bit of getting used to, after calling you "princess" for so long, but I like the intimacy."

612
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:23,000
Hiroki: "Stephania" is a lot to get my mouth around, though. I'm still not sure if I've gotten the hang of it..."

613
00:54:23,000 --> 00:54:29,000
Stephania: "Oh, yes! I can't imagine there are many people called "Stephania" in Japan!"

614
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:33,000
Hiroki: "It's not a name I've ever come across before, certainly."

615
00:54:33,000 --> 00:54:42,000
Hiroki: "There were three Yunas in my class back when I was in high school, and two Tamakis, but I can't say there were any Stephanias."

616
00:54:42,000 --> 00:54:45,000
Hiroki: "I suppose that makes you unique..."

617
00:54:45,000 --> 00:54:49,000
Hiroki: "But maybe it'd be easier if I gave you a nickname?"

618
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:51,000
Stephania: "A nickname?!"

619
00:54:51,000 --> 00:54:55,000
*Stephania beams at me expectantly, her eyes shining.*

620
00:54:55,000 --> 00:54:58,000
Stephania: "I've never had a nickname before!"

621
00:54:58,000 --> 00:55:01,000
Stephania: "What would you like to call me?"

622
00:55:01,000 --> 00:55:03,000
Stephania: "Oh! "Steffy"!"

623
00:55:03,000 --> 00:55:04,000
*Stephania beams.*

624
00:55:04,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Stephania: "I like that!"

625
00:55:06,000 --> 00:55:07,000
Hiroki: "You do?"

626
00:55:07,000 --> 00:55:16,000
Stephania: "Yes! I've often thought that my name sounds much too stuffy and formal, even if you remove the "Sofia Maria Isabella" part!"

627
00:55:16,000 --> 00:55:19,000
Stephania: "Steffy" is a much cuter alternative!"

628
00:55:19,000 --> 00:55:22,000
Stephania: "Isn't that what Hazel was calling me?"

629
00:55:22,000 --> 00:55:29,000
Hiroki: "Oh, yeah. You're right, now that you mention it. Maybe that's where I picked it up from..."

630
00:55:29,000 --> 00:55:32,000
*I guess I'm not as original as I thought.*

631
00:55:32,000 --> 00:55:41,000
Stephania: "If Hazel's been calling me that, then you can, too. I've no qualms with it. In fact, I welcome our newfound closeness, hehe!"

632
00:55:41,000 --> 00:55:42,000
Hiroki: "Same here."

633
00:55:42,000 --> 00:55:45,000
*I smile, touched at Stephania's joy.*

634
00:55:45,000 --> 00:55:51,000
*We're not just close in the emotional sense right now, either, but in a physical sense, too.*

635
00:55:51,000 --> 00:55:57,000
*When Stephania shifts, I can feel the hem of her skirt brushing against my pants.*

636
00:55:57,000 --> 00:56:05,000
*This touch isn't quite as stimulating as direct skin on skin contact, but it's enough to make my heart flutter regardless.*

637
00:56:05,000 --> 00:56:10,000
*Stephania, I can't help but ponder, as I survey her face, is awfully pretty.*

638
00:56:10,000 --> 00:56:15,000
*She's so pretty, in fact, I'm struck with the urge to lean in and...*

639
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:16,000
Stephania: "Hiroki."

640
00:56:16,000 --> 00:56:22,000
*Stephania's voice, soft as falling feathers, draws my mind away from these licentious musings.*

641
00:56:22,000 --> 00:56:26,000
Stephania: "I must thank you again for being so patient with me."

642
00:56:26,000 --> 00:56:37,000
Stephania: "I know I must seem hopelessly naïve to you - there's a good deal I don't know, having lived in the palace all my life! - but you have been a wonderful partner."

643
00:56:37,000 --> 00:56:40,000
Stephania: "With you, I feel very safe and warm..."

644
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:44,000
*Still smiling, Stephania rests a hand upon her chest.*

645
00:56:44,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Stephania: "And happy, too."

646
00:56:46,000 --> 00:56:51,000
Stephania: "It's strange, but... for some reason, my heart won't stop pounding."

647
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:54,000
Stephania: "Perhaps this is selfish of me, but..."

648
00:56:54,000 --> 00:56:57,000
*Stephania begins to squirm, her face flushed.*

649
00:56:57,000 --> 00:57:03,000
Stephania: "Though we've had a wonderful time together, part of me still wants more."

650
00:57:03,000 --> 00:57:10,000
Stephania: "I fear this is unfair of me, when you have a fiancée who adores you, but Hiroki... Please..."

651
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:20,000
Stephania: "I-If this is supposed to be a date, then, um... I-I was wondering, t-to cap off the night, whether you would... Y-You would, um..."

652
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:22,000
Hiroki: "I would... What...?"

653
00:57:22,000 --> 00:57:24,000
Stephania: "K-K-K... K..."

654
00:57:24,000 --> 00:57:25,000
Hiroki: "K...?"

655
00:57:25,000 --> 00:57:35,000
Stephania: "W-Well, um, y-you know. I-I don't want to ask for too much, b-but Lizzie told me s-such matters are fairly standard between men and women."

656
00:57:35,000 --> 00:57:43,000
Stephania: "Sh-She said successful dates often end like this - th-though, of course, I know very little on the subject!"

657
00:57:43,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Stephania: "I've not been on a date before, s-so perhaps she was teasing me, b-but if there's any truth to her words, then..."

658
00:57:51,000 --> 00:57:54,000
*Stephania swallows, her slender throat convulsing.*

659
00:57:54,000 --> 00:57:59,000
Stephania: "I-I would like it very much if you could k... k... k..."

660
00:57:59,000 --> 00:58:03,000
Stephania: "O-Oh, I can't say it...! It's too embarrassing...!"

661
00:58:03,000 --> 00:58:05,000
Hiroki: "It's alright, Steffy."

662
00:58:05,000 --> 00:58:11,000
*Finally taking pity on my cute partner, I reach in, and taking my hand in her own, I say...*

663
00:58:11,000 --> 00:58:16,000
Hiroki: "I know what you want - and no, I don't think you're being selfish."

664
00:58:16,000 --> 00:58:20,000
Hiroki: "I'm more than happy to make your dreams come true."

665
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:26,000
Hiroki: "This is your very first date, after all... and I want it to be as perfect as possible."

666
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:28,000
Stephania: "Oh, Hiroki..."

667
00:58:28,000 --> 00:58:36,000
*Stephania sighs tremulously, her pale eyelashes falling shut - as, very carefully, I lean in, and overlap my lips with hers.*

668
00:58:36,000 --> 00:58:37,000
Stephania: "Mm..."

669
00:58:37,000 --> 00:58:42,000
*Stephania sighs against my mouth, her slender shoulders shaking, as I kiss her.*

670
00:58:42,000 --> 00:58:53,000
*Our kiss is a chaste, gentle one, which is only to be expected. This is Stephania's first, and I don't want to take things too quickly. I don't want to upset her.*

671
00:58:53,000 --> 00:58:55,000
Stephania: "Mm, chh... Haa, haa..."

672
00:58:55,000 --> 00:59:01,000
*Our kiss is a fleeting thing - soft and delicate - but it makes my heart hammer regardless.*

673
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:03,000
*Stephania really is adorable.*

674
00:59:03,000 --> 00:59:08,000
*My date with Stephania concluded, we return to the palace later that night.*

675
00:59:08,000 --> 00:59:18,000
*The memory of Stephania's lips against mine hovers at the forefront of my mind throughout the journey back, and - later - during our opulent dinner.*

676
00:59:18,000 --> 00:59:29,000
*I'm so preoccupied with my Stephania-related musings, and of the softness of her mouth, that I find myself missing my own mouth numerous times while trying to eat.*

677
00:59:29,000 --> 00:59:36,000
*I drop bits of exquisitely-prepared quail onto the tabletop, and onto my thighs, which makes Marina sigh.*

678
00:59:36,000 --> 00:59:44,000
Marina: "Goodness me, Hiroki, you're being awfully clumsy! Don't tell me your motor functions are beginning to fail you!"

679
00:59:44,000 --> 00:59:52,000
Marina: "You aren't that old - though I suppose you're oft subjected to rather rigorous workouts, given your love life..."

680
00:59:52,000 --> 00:59:54,000
*Marina smiles seductively.*

681
00:59:54,000 --> 01:00:03,000
Marina: "If I'm being too hard on you, you need only tell me. I shall try to ease up in the future, lest I drain you of all your vitality!"

682
01:00:03,000 --> 01:00:11,000
Hazel: "You've been lookin' kinda spaced out for a while there, Hiroki, ole buddy, ole pal. Did somethin' good happen?"

683
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:13,000
Hazel: "Don't tell me..."

684
01:00:13,000 --> 01:00:20,000
*Hazel glances over to Stephania, who, like me, has been making a dog's dinner of her... well, dinner.*

685
01:00:20,000 --> 01:00:24,000
Hazel: "You two didn't get up to somethin', did you?"

686
01:00:24,000 --> 01:00:26,000
Hiroki: "Wh-What! No, we didn't...!"

687
01:00:26,000 --> 01:00:30,000
*I try to defend my honor, and Stephania's, to little avail.*

688
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:39,000
*Hazel's insinuations have spread about the dinner table like wildfire, and now both Hifumi and Marina are looking at me askance.*

689
01:00:39,000 --> 01:00:40,000
Hifumi: "Something?"

690
01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:42,000
*Hifumi raises an eyebrow.*

691
01:00:42,000 --> 01:00:46,000
Hifumi: "My, my! I wonder what that could have been!"

692
01:00:46,000 --> 01:00:50,000
Marina: "I wonder, indeed. Maybe my worrying was for naught?"

693
01:00:50,000 --> 01:00:59,000
Marina: "You can't be too weary, Hiroki, despite your many obligations, if you've strength enough to seek out further conquests!"

694
01:00:59,000 --> 01:01:03,000
Marina: "I'm unsure whether I should be amused or aggrieved!"

695
01:01:03,000 --> 01:01:08,000
Marina: "Clearly, I've not been keeping a tight enough leash on you!"

696
01:01:08,000 --> 01:01:14,000
Hazel: "Are you gonna put Hiroki on a leash, Marina? Would you walk him like a dog?"

697
01:01:14,000 --> 01:01:20,000
Marina: "I might, if he doesn't object to it. What do you think? Would you like to be my puppy?"

698
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:24,000
Marina: "You certainly go into heat enough, you filthy animal."

699
01:01:24,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Hiroki: "Th-That's not fair...!"

700
01:01:26,000 --> 01:01:28,000
*I retort, my face fiery.*

701
01:01:28,000 --> 01:01:30,000
Hiroki: "I didn't do anything wrong!"

702
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:31,000
Marina: "Really, now?"

703
01:01:31,000 --> 01:01:32,000
*Marina scoffs.*

704
01:01:32,000 --> 01:01:43,000
Marina: "That's what you say, but you can't fool me. Don't think I've not noticed how steadfastly you've been avoiding our dear hostess's eyes throughout this meal."

705
01:01:43,000 --> 01:01:48,000
Marina: "Is there something you would like to share with the rest of us?"

706
01:01:48,000 --> 01:01:49,000
Hiroki: "N-No...!"

707
01:01:49,000 --> 01:01:53,000
*I glance away from Marina, my body prickling with sweat.*

708
01:01:53,000 --> 01:01:58,000
Hiroki: "Y-You're reading into it too much. Nothing happened, r-really..."

709
01:01:58,000 --> 01:02:07,000
*Nothing, unless you count a kiss. It's not like I copped a feel of Stephania in the Ferris wheel or anything, though I certainly could have.*

710
01:02:07,000 --> 01:02:15,000
*The memory of Stephania's lips upon mine assails me once more. She felt incredibly soft - and she smelt incredibly good, too.*

711
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:19,000
*Up close, she looked more adorable than ever before.*

712
01:02:19,000 --> 01:02:21,000
Hazel: "Hiroki? Earth to Hiroki?"

713
01:02:21,000 --> 01:02:26,000
*Hazel rises from her seat, then waves her hand in front of my face.*

714
01:02:26,000 --> 01:02:31,000
Hazel: "Are you there, Hiroki? Don't tell me you've drifted off into Lala Land!"

715
01:02:31,000 --> 01:02:37,000
Hifumi: "Oh, leave him be. It is clear, from a glance, that our poor darling has been afflicted."

716
01:02:37,000 --> 01:02:38,000
Hazel: "Afflicted?"

717
01:02:38,000 --> 01:02:41,000
*Hazel draws back, her expression dubious.*

718
01:02:41,000 --> 01:02:47,000
Hazel: "Should I keep my distance? I don't wanna get sick before my tennis tournament..."

719
01:02:47,000 --> 01:02:53,000
Hifumi: "Oh, no, I don't believe his disease is catching. It is, however, rather serious."

720
01:02:53,000 --> 01:02:58,000
Hifumi: "I'm no doctor, but even I can discern that he is quite lovesick!"

721
01:02:58,000 --> 01:02:59,000
*...Gah.*

722
01:02:59,000 --> 01:03:06,000
*I can't possibly focus on eating; not with all these eyes upon me (or not upon me, in Stephania's case).*

723
01:03:06,000 --> 01:03:12,000
*This is unbearable. My skin is prickling, and my stupid face won't stop flushing.*

724
01:03:12,000 --> 01:03:14,000
*Maybe Hifumi is right.*

725
01:03:14,000 --> 01:03:20,000
*It was only a kiss, but since then, I've not been able to regard Stephania in the same way.*

726
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:22,000
*Maybe I really have fallen for her.*

727
01:03:22,000 --> 01:03:26,000
*Curse me and my fondness for pretty women. I'm so predictable.*

728
01:03:26,000 --> 01:03:35,000
*The night eventually falls, despite my discomfort, and I retreat to my luxurious bedchamber, to relax upon my equally luxurious bed.*

729
01:03:35,000 --> 01:03:42,000
*It's not late enough to sleep just yet, and I haven't taken the liberty of changing into my pajamas.*

730
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:50,000
*I'm too tired after my day spent in Rosenberg with Stephania to do anything more strenuous than flipping through my phone.*

731
01:03:50,000 --> 01:03:57,000
*I look through my photo gallery and smile, lost in reminisces, at all the snapshots I took during my date.*

732
01:03:57,000 --> 01:04:04,000
*I've took a lot of photos of Stephania in particular, wearing her casual clothes, enjoying herself.*

733
01:04:04,000 --> 01:04:17,000
*I have photos of Stephania eagerly tucking into her crêpe; Stephania staring, eyes wide, at the fairy lights that festooned the streets; and Stephania beaming whilst sitting in the Ferris Wheel.*

734
01:04:17,000 --> 01:04:24,000
*Stephania looks blissfully happy in every single one of these snapshots: more so than she usually does.*

735
01:04:24,000 --> 01:04:32,000
*Freed from the confines of the palace, and the weight of the crown, she looks like an ordinary young woman out on a date.*

736
01:04:32,000 --> 01:04:38,000
*I bet these photos would fetch quite a lot of money, if I was unscrupulous enough to sell them.*

737
01:04:38,000 --> 01:04:44,000
*These candid shots of Stephania would drive up the sales of any magazine or newspaper.*

738
01:04:44,000 --> 01:04:49,000
*I can imagine the headlines an unscrupulous paper might publish now...*

739
01:04:49,000 --> 01:04:57,000
*ASTORIA MIGHT BE A COLD COUNTRY, BUT THAT DIDN'T STOP ITS PRINCESS, STEPHANIA, GOING ON A HOT DATE. READ ALL ABOUT IT!*

740
01:04:57,000 --> 01:04:58,000
*...Urgh.*

741
01:04:58,000 --> 01:05:01,000
*Just thinking about that makes me feel scummy.*

742
01:05:01,000 --> 01:05:10,000
*If my boss could see this treasure trove on my phone, he'd surely slap me on the back and congratulate me for a job well done.*

743
01:05:10,000 --> 01:05:16,000
*I've no desire, however, to sell any of these photos, no matter how valuable they might be.*

744
01:05:16,000 --> 01:05:23,000
*I didn't agree to go on a date with Stephania to turn a profit over on it. That really would be boorish.*

745
01:05:23,000 --> 01:05:28,000
*I went out with Stephania because I thought she might enjoy herself.*

746
01:05:28,000 --> 01:05:33,000
*I wanted her to have a good time - and I think my wishes were fulfilled.*

747
01:05:33,000 --> 01:05:44,000
*Stephania's smile was so sweet, I can still see it when I close my eyes. It's almost as though her radiantly happy face has been tattooed against my eyelids.*

748
01:05:44,000 --> 01:05:50,000
*I can remember, too, Stephania's shy confession, when we sat together in the Ferris Wheel.*

749
01:05:50,000 --> 01:05:58,000
*I remember the scent of her perfume, and the warmth of her skin... and the soft, gentle pressure of her lips upon mine.*

750
01:05:58,000 --> 01:06:11,000
*Stephania's kiss, hesitant though it was, made quite the impression. I didn't take a photograph of it, but that would be wholly unnecessary. I don't think I'll be forgetting it in a hurry.*

751
01:06:11,000 --> 01:06:18,000
*I set my phone to one side, sated by all my photographs, then press my trembling fingertips to my lips.*

752
01:06:18,000 --> 01:06:27,000
*Though it was a couple of hours since Stephania brought our mouths together, I can still sense the ghostly imprint of her mouth upon mine.*

753
01:06:27,000 --> 01:06:37,000
*Her kiss was much more hesitant than those of my succubi girlfriends; not half so experienced as Marina's, nor as demanding as Ayu's and Yue's.*

754
01:06:37,000 --> 01:06:43,000
*Stephania, unlike my succubus harem (Cosmos excluded), has no prior knowledge of men.*

755
01:06:43,000 --> 01:06:45,000
*That was her very first kiss.*

756
01:06:45,000 --> 01:06:51,000
*I feel a bit like I've stolen something from Stephania; something irrevocably precious.*

757
01:06:51,000 --> 01:07:00,000
*I'm not sure if I'm worthy of taking a princess's first kiss - but I feel flattered, regardless, that she thought to bequeath it upon me.*

758
01:07:00,000 --> 01:07:03,000
*Idly, I wonder what Stephania is doing right now.*

759
01:07:03,000 --> 01:07:10,000
*Is she lying in bed, attired in her nightgown, thinking about me, just like I'm thinking about her?*

760
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:14,000
*I turn thoughts of Stephania over in my head, until...*

761
01:07:14,000 --> 01:07:17,000
???: "Excuse me, Mr. Ogasawara? May I come in?"

762
01:07:17,000 --> 01:07:25,000
*A familiar voice on the other side of the door pulls me from my musings, coupled with a familiar rapping of knuckles.*

763
01:07:25,000 --> 01:07:32,000
*I know, of course, who this is. Hifumi, Marina, and Hazel would never address me as "Mr. Ogasawara".*

764
01:07:32,000 --> 01:07:37,000
*My unexpected visitor can only, by the process of elimination, be Elizabeth.*

765
01:07:37,000 --> 01:07:38,000
Hiroki: "Sure."

766
01:07:38,000 --> 01:07:41,000
*I sit up in bed, then look to the door.*

767
01:07:41,000 --> 01:07:44,000
Hiroki: "You can come in. I'm not doing anything."

768
01:07:44,000 --> 01:07:54,000
*The door opens with a click at my approval, and in walks Elizabeth. She looks neat and pristine as per usual; her pale hair shifting about her shoulders.*

769
01:07:54,000 --> 01:07:58,000
*Elizabeth stands by my bedside then, clearing her throat, says...*

770
01:07:58,000 --> 01:08:05,000
Elizabeth: "If you're not busy, Mr. Ogasawara, would you care to join the princess in her private chambers?"

771
01:08:05,000 --> 01:08:09,000
Hiroki: "Is that what Steffy - I mean, Stephania wants?"

772
01:08:09,000 --> 01:08:11,000
*Elizabeth nods primly.*

773
01:08:11,000 --> 01:08:18,000
Elizabeth: "Her highness conveyed me to you thus, to express that she would like to spend more time with you."

774
01:08:18,000 --> 01:08:29,000
Elizabeth: "From what I have heard about your date - and, believe me, she has been most forthcoming with the details - it sounds like the pair of you have much to discuss."

775
01:08:29,000 --> 01:08:36,000
Elizabeth: "Surely you are not content to let your date end where it did? The night is not yet over, and..."

776
01:08:36,000 --> 01:08:38,000
*Elizabeth smiles thinly.*

777
01:08:38,000 --> 01:08:43,000
Elizabeth: "There are many acts a couple can indulge in, beyond chaste kisses."

778
01:08:43,000 --> 01:08:49,000
*The true meaning behind Elizabeth's words isn't lost upon me, and I soon find myself blushing.*

779
01:08:49,000 --> 01:08:52,000
Hiroki: "I-Is that what Stephania wants?"

780
01:08:52,000 --> 01:09:00,000
Elizabeth: "Milady is so sheltered, the poor thing, I do not believe she herself wholly knows what it is she wants."

781
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
Elizabeth: "I have known her for many years, however, and I can guess at her desires."

782
01:09:06,000 --> 01:09:11,000
Elizabeth: "Right now, milady wants nothing more than to see you again."

783
01:09:11,000 --> 01:09:19,000
Elizabeth: "Would you grant her that honor, at the very least? A failure to do so might, I fear, break her poor heart."

784
01:09:19,000 --> 01:09:29,000
Elizabeth: "I would hate for you to reject her now, when she has such desperate need of you; particularly when you have made her so very happy!"

785
01:09:29,000 --> 01:09:35,000
*I think Elizabeth might be laying it on a bit thick there, but I know what she's driving at.*

786
01:09:35,000 --> 01:09:42,000
*My date with Stephania ended quickly, before we had a chance to fully affirm our feelings for one another.*

787
01:09:42,000 --> 01:09:49,000
*I, too, would like to know how Stephania feels about all of this - and about the kiss in particular.*

788
01:09:49,000 --> 01:10:00,000
*I was too awkward to barge into Stephania's private quarters on my own and ask after her, but if she's extending me an invitation, I might as well take her up on it.*

789
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:02,000
Hiroki: "...Alright, then."

790
01:10:02,000 --> 01:10:04,000
*I reply, after only a brief pause.*

791
01:10:04,000 --> 01:10:09,000
Hiroki: "I want to see how Stephania is, too. In fact, I would love to."

792
01:10:09,000 --> 01:10:11,000
Hiroki: "Please, lead the way."

793
01:10:11,000 --> 01:10:21,000
Elizabeth: "I thought you might say that. You really are a gentleman, Mr. Ogasawara! Certainly, you are not one to leave a fair maiden hanging."

794
01:10:21,000 --> 01:10:25,000
*Smiling, Elizabeth bows her head, then beckons me over.*

795
01:10:25,000 --> 01:10:33,000
Elizabeth: "Now, please follow me. The princess is waiting for you, and I know there is much she wishes to share with you."

796
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:37,000
Stephania: "Oh, Hiroki! I'm so happy that you agreed to visit me!"

797
01:10:37,000 --> 01:10:44,000
*Stephania rises to greet me when I enter her bedchamber, a tremulous smile upon her pretty face.*

798
01:10:44,000 --> 01:10:52,000
*Stephania is dressed, not in the casual attire she wore during our date, or even her fine blue dress, but in her nightgown.*

799
01:10:52,000 --> 01:11:00,000
*I suppose she must have been in the process of preparing for bed when she was struck with the desire to see me again.*

800
01:11:00,000 --> 01:11:05,000
*Was she so enthused she didn't think to change back into her everyday clothes?*

801
01:11:05,000 --> 01:11:09,000
*The thought is a flattering one, and I can't help but smile.*

802
01:11:09,000 --> 01:11:23,000
*This, I find myself thinking, is the first time I've been inside Stephania's bedchamber. Her room is even larger than mine - though that, I suppose, should be expected, given Stephania's status as a princess.*

803
01:11:23,000 --> 01:11:33,000
*Stephania's room boasts a large four poster bed, which looks plush, and a chandelier hangs from the ceiling, illuminating the patterned blue wallpaper.*

804
01:11:33,000 --> 01:11:45,000
*A vanity table stands next to her bed, upon which various perfume bottles and cosmetics are neatly arranged, and there're several potted plants scattered about in ornate vases.*

805
01:11:45,000 --> 01:11:52,000
*Stephania's room is very tidy, which speaks either of her own organizational skills, or Elizabeth's.*

806
01:11:52,000 --> 01:11:58,000
*Knowing Elizabeth, I bet she breaks her back to keep every square inch of this space spotless.*

807
01:11:58,000 --> 01:12:07,000
*Doubtless, Elizabeth would consider even the smallest speck of dust in Stephania's quarters to be a gross failing on her part...*

808
01:12:07,000 --> 01:12:14,000
*I didn't come here to examine Stephania's bedroom, though. I'm more interested in Stephania herself.*

809
01:12:14,000 --> 01:12:16,000
Stephania: "Um... Hiroki..."

810
01:12:16,000 --> 01:12:17,000
Hiroki: "Yes?"

811
01:12:17,000 --> 01:12:19,000
*I look at Stephania curiously.*

812
01:12:19,000 --> 01:12:20,000
Hiroki: "What is it?"

813
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:23,000
Stephania: "I was just wondering, um... W-Well..."

814
01:12:23,000 --> 01:12:28,000
Stephania: "H-How much of this situation did Lizzie explain to you?"

815
01:12:28,000 --> 01:12:32,000
Hiroki: "She said that you wanted to speak to me again..."

816
01:12:32,000 --> 01:12:40,000
*And she alluded, in terms which weren't particularly uncertain, that Stephania might want to do even more than that.*

817
01:12:40,000 --> 01:12:47,000
*I think I'd be better off not telling Stephania that, though. I don't want to make her feel anxious.*

818
01:12:47,000 --> 01:12:51,000
Hiroki: "...but beyond that, she didn't tell me too much."

819
01:12:51,000 --> 01:12:58,000
Stephania: "R-Really? That's a relief, ehehe. I was afraid she might have given you strange ideas."

820
01:12:58,000 --> 01:13:00,000
Elizabeth: "Would I, milady?"

821
01:13:00,000 --> 01:13:05,000
*Elizabeth, who is standing sentinel by the doorway, now speaks up.*

822
01:13:05,000 --> 01:13:14,000
Elizabeth: "You ought to know that I wish for nothing more beyond your happiness. I have no desire whatsoever to make you feel uncomfortable."

823
01:13:14,000 --> 01:13:21,000
Elizabeth: "You asked me to summon Mr. Ogasawara hence, and so, I did. As a maid, I can do naught but obey you."

824
01:13:21,000 --> 01:13:25,000
Stephania: "Y-Yes, thank you. You are very good to me, Lizzie."

825
01:13:25,000 --> 01:13:28,000
Stephania: "I'm glad you didn't say too much."

826
01:13:28,000 --> 01:13:32,000
Elizabeth: "Indeed, I did not. Discretion is my middle name."

827
01:13:32,000 --> 01:13:33,000
*Yeah, right...*

828
01:13:33,000 --> 01:13:40,000
*I'm amazed Elizabeth can lie to Stephania's face like that. Where does she get off, being so brazen?!*

829
01:13:40,000 --> 01:13:45,000
Stephania: "I-I think I would rather tell Hiroki how I feel myself, and yet..."

830
01:13:45,000 --> 01:13:46,000
*Stephania sighs.*

831
01:13:46,000 --> 01:13:51,000
Stephania: "My feelings are so very complicated, I hardly know where to start!"

832
01:13:51,000 --> 01:14:00,000
Elizabeth: "Perhaps you could begin at the beginning, milady? That, as I have found, is often the best way to go about such matters."

833
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:06,000
Stephania: "Y-Yes, of course. Forgive me for my ineptitude. I shall try to calm myself."

834
01:14:06,000 --> 01:14:11,000
*Stephania inhales deeply, one hand pressed to her chest, then looks to me.*

835
01:14:11,000 --> 01:14:18,000
*With wide eyes, which seem to shine beneath the lights of her chandelier, Stephania then speaks.*

836
01:14:18,000 --> 01:14:28,000
Stephania: "I-I understand that this is an imposition, Hiroki - especially given the lateness of the hour - but I really couldn't wait to see you again."

837
01:14:28,000 --> 01:14:31,000
Stephania: "I fear much between us has gone unsaid."

838
01:14:31,000 --> 01:14:37,000
Stephania: "Though I had a lovely time with you, I-I fear it is not enough - which isn't to say-"

839
01:14:37,000 --> 01:14:40,000
*Stephania hastens to correct herself.*

840
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:50,000
Stephania: "-that I found your company lacking, or that I'm in any way disappointed with how the day went. Nothing could be further from the truth!"

841
01:14:50,000 --> 01:14:59,000
Stephania: "I'm very, very happy that we spent so much time together today! I'm truly blessed you would indulge me so, and yet-"

842
01:14:59,000 --> 01:15:05,000
Elizabeth: "Milady, please. You must remember to breathe, else I fear you will hyperventilate."

843
01:15:05,000 --> 01:15:12,000
Elizabeth: "As much as you might like Mr. Ogasawara, I do not want you going to pieces for his sake!"

844
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
*Elizabeth crosses the room, then rests her palm against Stephania's slender back.*

845
01:15:18,000 --> 01:15:22,000
*Gently, she massages it, while Stephania endeavors to inhale.*

846
01:15:22,000 --> 01:15:24,000
Stephania: "Haa... haa..."

847
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:28,000
*Stephania breathes in slowly and deliberately, still shaking.*

848
01:15:28,000 --> 01:15:33,000
Stephania: "Th-Thank you, Lizzie. I feel somewhat better now, although..."

849
01:15:33,000 --> 01:15:36,000
Hiroki: "What is it? Is something the matter?"

850
01:15:36,000 --> 01:15:41,000
Stephania: "O-Oh, yes! Something is the matter indeed, with my foolish heart!"

851
01:15:41,000 --> 01:15:53,000
Stephania: "Though you lavished a great deal of attention upon me during our date, a-and you were unfailingly kind and considerate towards me, I want even more of your time!"

852
01:15:53,000 --> 01:16:00,000
Stephania: "I must be a truly selfish, spoiled girl, but that kiss we shared in the Ferris wheel..."

853
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:04,000
Stephania: "Magical though it was, it simply wasn't enough!"

854
01:16:04,000 --> 01:16:09,000
Stephania: "Now we're on intimate terms, Hiroki, I want to know you even better!"

855
01:16:09,000 --> 01:16:15,000
Stephania: "I want you to kiss me anew, as you did before, but with even more passion!"

856
01:16:15,000 --> 01:16:20,000
Stephania: "I wish to know what it feels like to be embraced as a woman..."

857
01:16:20,000 --> 01:16:25,000
Stephania: "And, if possible, I would like it if you could love me, too!"

858
01:16:25,000 --> 01:16:26,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

859
01:16:26,000 --> 01:16:30,000
*I stare at Stephania mutely for a few moments, struck dumb.*

860
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:37,000
*I was expecting this kind of request, but I never imagined she'd sound so passionate while delivering it.*

861
01:16:37,000 --> 01:16:43,000
*Stephania's so worked up she's trembling, and it really does look like she might cry.*

862
01:16:43,000 --> 01:16:47,000
*It must have taken her a lot of courage to say all that.*

863
01:16:47,000 --> 01:16:52,000
*The sincerity of her request pieces my breast, and I sigh in sympathy for her.*

864
01:16:52,000 --> 01:16:59,000
*I hadn't planned to further deepen my relationship with Stephania, but if that's what she wants, then...*

865
01:16:59,000 --> 01:17:02,000
Stephania: "G-Goodness! Just listen to me!"

866
01:17:02,000 --> 01:17:03,000
*Stephania winces.*

867
01:17:03,000 --> 01:17:10,000
Stephania: "I must sound so desperate; a trait, or so I've heard, which isn't at all attractive in women!"

868
01:17:10,000 --> 01:17:13,000
Stephania: "Why did I not hold my tongue?!"

869
01:17:13,000 --> 01:17:21,000
Stephania: "Please, Hiroki, forget all you heard! I like you, and I don't want to make things awkward between us!"

870
01:17:21,000 --> 01:17:25,000
Stephania: "None of this happened! M-My feelings are-"

871
01:17:25,000 --> 01:17:28,000
Stephania: "D-Do you truly think so...?"

872
01:17:28,000 --> 01:17:39,000
Elizabeth: "I certainly do. I believe that you are one of the sweetest girls I have ever had the fortune of meeting. Mr. Ogasawara is speaking nothing but the truth."

873
01:17:39,000 --> 01:17:48,000
Elizabeth: "You ought to trust him; particularly if you want your relationship with him to become even more intimate than it already is."

874
01:17:48,000 --> 01:17:50,000
Stephania: "Intimate"? Oh my..."

875
01:17:50,000 --> 01:17:51,000
*Stephania flusters.*

876
01:17:51,000 --> 01:17:55,000
Stephania: "Th-This all seems to be happening so quickly..."

877
01:17:55,000 --> 01:17:59,000
Hiroki: "Am I being too forward? Would you rather I leave?"

878
01:17:59,000 --> 01:18:00,000
Stephania: "N-No...!"

879
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
*Stephania retorts, quicker than I had expected; her eyes boring fiercely into my own.*

880
01:18:06,000 --> 01:18:12,000
Stephania: "I-I am shy - that much, I cannot deny - and my heart will not stop pounding, yet..."

881
01:18:12,000 --> 01:18:16,000
Stephania: "Being with you like this makes me feel very happy."

882
01:18:16,000 --> 01:18:22,000
Stephania: "I wasn't lying when I said that I wanted to know you even better, Hiroki."

883
01:18:22,000 --> 01:18:29,000
Stephania: "I would endure any unpleasantness for your sake, if only to bind myself to you more fully."

884
01:18:29,000 --> 01:18:40,000
Hiroki: "Well, thanks. I'm glad to hear it, but you needn't worry about that. This won't be "unpleasant". I think I'm experienced enough to show you a good time."

885
01:18:40,000 --> 01:18:42,000
Hiroki: "Now, come here."

886
01:18:42,000 --> 01:18:48,000
*I wind an arm around Stephania's back, my fingers splayed against her shoulder blades.*

887
01:18:48,000 --> 01:18:53,000
Hiroki: "Don't be afraid. We can take this nice and slow - just like this..."

888
01:18:53,000 --> 01:18:55,000
*So saying, I lean in...*

889
01:18:55,000 --> 01:18:56,000
Stephania: "Mm, nn..."

890
01:18:56,000 --> 01:19:01,000
*And, after a brief pause, I claim Stephania's quivering lips with my own.*

891
01:19:01,000 --> 01:19:11,000
*I kiss her gently, as though I'm handling a precious object. Stephania is so light and slender - almost insubstantial - I don't want to hurt her.*

892
01:19:11,000 --> 01:19:14,000
*I mean to take things slowly, but...*

893
01:19:14,000 --> 01:19:15,000
Hiroki: "Mmm...?"

894
01:19:15,000 --> 01:19:19,000
*I'm the one, as it transpires, who's taken by surprise.*

895
01:19:19,000 --> 01:19:26,000
*Stephania must want me even more than I anticipated, because after a brief pause, she begins to kiss me back.*

896
01:19:26,000 --> 01:19:33,000
*She presses her body against mine, then squeezes her eyes shut; her pale eyelashes matting together.*

897
01:19:33,000 --> 01:19:38,000
*Her teeth nip my lower lip in a clumsy manner, and I gasp from it.*

898
01:19:38,000 --> 01:19:39,000
Hiroki: "Ah...!"

899
01:19:39,000 --> 01:19:41,000
*I didn't expect that.*

900
01:19:41,000 --> 01:19:48,000
*I also didn't expect that Stephania would use my shock to her advantage, to slide her tongue inside my mouth.*

901
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:56,000
*Sparks of electricity seem to shoot up my spine from our shared caresses, and I moan against Stephania's mouth.*

902
01:19:56,000 --> 01:19:57,000
Hiroki: "Mm, aah..."

903
01:19:57,000 --> 01:19:58,000
Stephania: "Aah..."

904
01:19:58,000 --> 01:20:06,000
*I have to wonder, as we kiss, Stephania taking the lead, who taught her all of this. How did she become so brazen?*

905
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:12,000
*This remains a mystery for only a few brief moments, however, before I finally figure it out.*

906
01:20:12,000 --> 01:20:15,000
Elizabeth: "Aah. Young love. How charming!"

907
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:20,000
Elizabeth: "I'm rooting for you, milady. Kiss him with everything you've got!"

908
01:20:20,000 --> 01:20:24,000
Elizabeth: "Ensnare his puny mortal heart and make him yours!"

909
01:20:24,000 --> 01:20:31,000
*"Mortal heart"? That's a bit of a weird thing to say - but, then again, Elizabeth's weird all over.*

910
01:20:31,000 --> 01:20:37,000
*She's so weird, in fact, I bet she must've told Stephania everything about kissing.*

911
01:20:37,000 --> 01:20:42,000
*Maybe, I wonder, as Stephania clumsily kisses me, Elizabeth is a bad influence.*

912
01:20:42,000 --> 01:20:49,000
*I might have to chastise her later (what in the world is she teaching Stephania, anyway???), but...*

913
01:20:49,000 --> 01:20:51,000
Stephania: "Mm, nn... Chhlp..."

914
01:20:51,000 --> 01:20:56,000
*For now, I'm content to enjoy the feeling of Stephania's mouth against my own.*

915
01:20:56,000 --> 01:21:05,000
*Though I'm a bit taken aback by Stephania's forcefulness, I can't deny one salient fact: namely, that kissing her really does feel good.*

916
01:21:05,000 --> 01:21:11,000
*Stephania stands on the balcony which overlooks the palace gardens, dressed in her nightgown.*

917
01:21:11,000 --> 01:21:20,000
*Her blonde hair is tied back into her two signature pigtails, though they look slightly rumpled, thanks to our earlier ministrations.*

918
01:21:20,000 --> 01:21:32,000
*Stephania's fingers are curled against the stone balustrades which line the balcony, and her eyes are affixed upon the tops of the trees, and the moon which shines above them.*

919
01:21:32,000 --> 01:21:38,000
*Illuminated by the celestial light, Stephania's face, when viewed in profile, seems to shimmer.*

920
01:21:38,000 --> 01:21:41,000
*The pair of us are standing here, quite alone.*

921
01:21:41,000 --> 01:21:50,000
*For once, Elizabeth didn't deign to join us. She seemed to sense, after the moment I shared with Stephania, that we'd want some time alone.*

922
01:21:50,000 --> 01:21:57,000
*Now, Stephania is glancing at me from over her shoulder. She surveys me, and smiling softly, says...*

923
01:21:57,000 --> 01:22:06,000
Stephania: "Thank you, Hiroki, for complying with my selfish requests - and thank you for agreeing to observe the night sky with me."

924
01:22:06,000 --> 01:22:09,000
Hiroki: "It's alright. Don't mention it."

925
01:22:09,000 --> 01:22:14,000
*I smile at Stephania consolingly, while running a hand through my rumpled hair.*

926
01:22:14,000 --> 01:22:19,000
Hiroki: "I had a lot of fun myself - both on our date, and earlier..."

927
01:22:19,000 --> 01:22:20,000
Hiroki: "Ahem."

928
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:27,000
*I clear my throat, in an attempt to mask the embarrassed flush which has begun to spread across my face.*

929
01:22:27,000 --> 01:22:36,000
*Stephania, too, looks a bit bashful at our earlier dalliances. Though she's smiling, her face is dusky pink, like the petals of a flower.*

930
01:22:36,000 --> 01:22:48,000
*She looks so sweet and vulnerable - particularly in that short, sheer nightgown of hers - that I'm struck with the desire once more to hold her in my arms, and to kiss her.*

931
01:22:48,000 --> 01:22:54,000
*I don't do that, however. I've tasted Stephania's mouth an innumerable amount of times already.*

932
01:22:54,000 --> 01:22:58,000
*Asking for further kisses would be selfish, at this point.*

933
01:22:58,000 --> 01:23:04,000
*I don't want to make too many requests from Stephania, but maybe it's too late for that.*

934
01:23:04,000 --> 01:23:10,000
*We have grown very intimate, after all; more so than I ever anticipated we would.*

935
01:23:10,000 --> 01:23:18,000
Hiroki: "I'm glad you invited me out on today's date. It was nice seeing you so happy. You seemed quite at your ease."

936
01:23:18,000 --> 01:23:24,000
Stephania: "Oh, indeed, I was! It was very fun, going on a date as a normal woman my age might."

937
01:23:24,000 --> 01:23:34,000
Stephania: "I felt, for a few moments, as though I wasn't Princess Stephania Sofia Maria Isabella of Astoria, but a normal girl: your girlfriend."

938
01:23:34,000 --> 01:23:42,000
Stephania: "Though I'm not displeased with my lot in life, it was most invigorating to experience something so new."

939
01:23:42,000 --> 01:23:47,000
Hiroki: "I found it invigorating, too, to help you in your discoveries."

940
01:23:47,000 --> 01:23:50,000
*I smile, then ruffle the top of Stephania's head.*

941
01:23:50,000 --> 01:23:58,000
Hiroki: "You might be a princess in the palace, but with me, you don't need to worry about such stuffy formalities."

942
01:23:58,000 --> 01:24:03,000
Hiroki: "Remember: to me, you're not Princess Stephania. You're Steffy."

943
01:24:03,000 --> 01:24:05,000
Stephania: "Oh, Hiroki..."

944
01:24:05,000 --> 01:24:09,000
*Stephania smiles, then rests her head against my shoulder.*

945
01:24:09,000 --> 01:24:12,000
Stephania: "I'm very happy to hear that."

946
01:24:12,000 --> 01:24:17,000
Stephania: "You've no idea how much fun I had today - or tonight, either."

947
01:24:17,000 --> 01:24:20,000
Stephania: "You really are a wonderful man."

948
01:24:20,000 --> 01:24:24,000
Hiroki: "Nah, I'm not. I'm nothing special, really..."

949
01:24:24,000 --> 01:24:29,000
Hiroki: "But I think it'd be in bad form to try and convince you otherwise."

950
01:24:29,000 --> 01:24:40,000
Hiroki: "Your feelings are more important than my silly insecurities - and, above all else, it's a relief to know I've not put you off romance with my clumsy fumbling!"

951
01:24:40,000 --> 01:24:47,000
Stephania: "Oh, it was quite the opposite! You've opened my eyes up to know wonderful love can be!"

952
01:24:47,000 --> 01:24:57,000
Stephania: "I was wholly ignorant of it, before I met you. Now we are together, however, and I am your Steffy, the world has never looked more splendid!"

953
01:24:57,000 --> 01:25:01,000
Stephania: "The moon is so bright, and the sky is so blue..."

954
01:25:01,000 --> 01:25:05,000
*Stephania sighs wistfully, her arm entwined with mine.*

955
01:25:05,000 --> 01:25:08,000
Stephania: "I think I could drown in it."

956
01:25:08,000 --> 01:25:13,000
Stephania: "It seems funny to think that so much can change, in but a scant week."

957
01:25:13,000 --> 01:25:24,000
Stephania: "I extended an invitation towards you, as my mistress's plus one, so that I might hone my abilities in karuta, but I've received much, much more than that."

958
01:25:24,000 --> 01:25:27,000
Stephania: "I really am happy that I met you."

959
01:25:27,000 --> 01:25:33,000
Stephania: "I only hope that my mistress you know won't be jealous about our relationship?"

960
01:25:33,000 --> 01:25:39,000
Hiroki: "Nah. It's fine. You don't need to worry on that score. I'll take care of her."

961
01:25:39,000 --> 01:25:42,000
Stephania: "A-Are you certain it will be alright?"

962
01:25:42,000 --> 01:25:51,000
Hiroki: "Oh, yeah. I'm quite certain. Hifumi isn't the jealous type, like I said, and it doesn't hurt that she likes you a lot herself."

963
01:25:51,000 --> 01:26:01,000
*I smile at Stephania's upturned face, drinking in her anxious, green-eyed gaze, as the wind continues to tug at my hair; the hem of my shirt.*

964
01:26:01,000 --> 01:26:05,000
Hiroki: "It'll all work out OK. These things tend to."

965
01:26:05,000 --> 01:26:07,000
*The following morning...*

966
01:26:07,000 --> 01:26:15,000
Stephania: "E-Excuse me, everyone. I don't want to be a bother, but there is something I feel I must announce to you!"

967
01:26:15,000 --> 01:26:23,000
*Stephania declares, once we've all taken our places in the dining room: Marina, Hazel, Hifumi, Elizabeth, and I.*

968
01:26:23,000 --> 01:26:32,000
*Stephania is attired, once more, in her dark blue gown lined with fur, which she seems to favor when she's residing within the palace.*

969
01:26:32,000 --> 01:26:40,000
*I suppose clothes like this, cut from the finest materials, are considered only appropriate for princesses such as Stephania.*

970
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:45,000
*The casual attire she wore yesterday, while cute, wasn't what I'd call "regal".*

971
01:26:45,000 --> 01:26:53,000
*I think I preferred Stephania in that bell-shaped dress that Elizabeth made. It made her look akin to a flower fairy...*

972
01:26:53,000 --> 01:27:04,000
*But, in her princess's regalia, she looks similarly fay-like, though decidedly more icy. Now, she looks, instead, like a snow princess - at least, she would...*

973
01:27:04,000 --> 01:27:10,000
Stephania: "I, um... This... Th-This is a bit hard for me to speak of, but... Um..."

974
01:27:10,000 --> 01:27:12,000
*If her face wasn't so very red.*

975
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:13,000
Hifumi: "My, my."

976
01:27:13,000 --> 01:27:18,000
*Hifumi looks at Stephania curiously, while cradling her cheek with one hand.*

977
01:27:18,000 --> 01:27:24,000
Hifumi: "Are you quite alright, dear? You haven't come down with some manner of fever, have you?"

978
01:27:24,000 --> 01:27:25,000
Hazel: "Egads!"

979
01:27:25,000 --> 01:27:29,000
*Hazel rises from the table, then takes a dramatic step backwards.*

980
01:27:29,000 --> 01:27:36,000
Hazel: "This couldn't be a result of that "lovesickness" Hifumin was talkin' about last night, could it?"

981
01:27:36,000 --> 01:27:39,000
Hazel: "Don't tell me it really is contagious!"

982
01:27:39,000 --> 01:27:43,000
Stephania: "Lovesick", a-am I? Well, I wonder... Um..."

983
01:27:43,000 --> 01:27:46,000
*Stephania shyly toys with her index fingers.*

984
01:27:46,000 --> 01:27:52,000
Stephania: "A-As you all know, last  night, I, um... I-I went on a d-d-date with Hiroki."

985
01:27:52,000 --> 01:27:53,000
Marina: "Yes, and?"

986
01:27:53,000 --> 01:27:55,000
*Marina raises an eyebrow.*

987
01:27:55,000 --> 01:28:01,000
Marina: "Did something occur between you during this date that we ought to be aware of?"

988
01:28:01,000 --> 01:28:08,000
Hazel: "Don't tell me the pair of you progressed to, like, holdin' hands! That really would be lewd!"

989
01:28:08,000 --> 01:28:14,000
*I know Hazel's teasing Stephania, but Stephania doesn't seem to have cottoned onto that fact.*

990
01:28:14,000 --> 01:28:19,000
*I swear, Astoria's princess is way too sweet-natured for her own good.*

991
01:28:19,000 --> 01:28:25,000
*With a violent blush that now occupies more than half of her face, Stephania says...*

992
01:28:25,000 --> 01:28:29,000
Stephania: "W-We, um, m-might have held hands yes..."

993
01:28:29,000 --> 01:28:31,000
Hazel: "Whew! How scandalous!"

994
01:28:31,000 --> 01:28:36,000
Stephania: "B-But my d-dealings with Hiroki didn't end there. Y-You see, um..."

995
01:28:36,000 --> 01:28:46,000
Stephania: "H-He gave me a cute nickname - "Steffy" - a-and we went on a Ferris wheel together, a-and then, when we were alone together, we, um... He..."

996
01:28:46,000 --> 01:28:48,000
Stephania: "Th-That is to say..."

997
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:49,000
Hazel: "Didja kiss?"

998
01:28:49,000 --> 01:28:50,000
Stephania: "...!"

999
01:28:50,000 --> 01:29:00,000
*Stephania doesn't reply to Hazel's query - not verbally, at least. I think she's so overcome by all we've done, she can't muster up the words.*

1000
01:29:00,000 --> 01:29:04,000
*Instead, she starts, then looks down at her thighs.*

1001
01:29:04,000 --> 01:29:09,000
*Her cheeks are so red, I wouldn't be surprised if she expired upon the spot.*

1002
01:29:09,000 --> 01:29:16,000
*Hazel, Marina, and Hifumi, meanwhile, all seem intrigued by the violence of Stephania's reaction.*

1003
01:29:16,000 --> 01:29:23,000
*Hazel laughs and says "I knew it! Hiroki just can't help himself!", while Marina tuts and says, "Goodness me".*

1004
01:29:23,000 --> 01:29:30,000
*Hifumi, meanwhile, crosses the dining room, then rests a consolatory hand on Stephania's shoulder.*

1005
01:29:30,000 --> 01:29:32,000
Hifumi: "There, there, dear."

1006
01:29:32,000 --> 01:29:35,000
*She soothes Stephania, her voice gentle.*

1007
01:29:35,000 --> 01:29:40,000
Hifumi: "Don't be so embarrassed. You've done nothing to be ashamed of."

1008
01:29:40,000 --> 01:29:51,000
Hifumi: "It is only natural, I think, that men and women will indulge in their passions while they are together, particularly if there is a mutual attraction."

1009
01:29:51,000 --> 01:29:52,000
Stephania: "H-Huh...?"

1010
01:29:52,000 --> 01:29:56,000
*Stephania looks at Hifumi shyly, her face still smoldering.*

1011
01:29:56,000 --> 01:29:59,000
Stephania: "I-Is that really alright?"

1012
01:29:59,000 --> 01:30:01,000
Hifumi: "But of course!"

1013
01:30:01,000 --> 01:30:13,000
Hifumi: "I realize, as a princess, you mustn't have much experience with the opposite sex. As such, sharing a kiss with Hiroki must have been quite the momentous occasion for you."

1014
01:30:13,000 --> 01:30:19,000
Hifumi: "I understand that you must be feeling unnerved, but please, try to compose yourself."

1015
01:30:19,000 --> 01:30:27,000
Hifumi: "As a woman older than you, and with far more experience, I would rather you enjoy your first love as it unfolds."

1016
01:30:27,000 --> 01:30:31,000
Hifumi: "Don't feel guilty about it. You've done nothing wrong."

1017
01:30:31,000 --> 01:30:40,000
Stephania: "B-But Hiroki is your fiancé, mistress! H-How can you be alright with this?! Surely you should be jealous; horribly so!"

1018
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:45,000
Stephania: "I don't regret what I did, but doesn't that make it even worse?!"

1019
01:30:45,000 --> 01:30:55,000
Stephania: "I never once imagined myself as the kind of shameless woman who would try to ensnare an engaged man, but that's exactly what I have done!"

1020
01:30:55,000 --> 01:31:03,000
Stephania: "I enticed Hiroki to kiss me, though I knew it was wrong - and, later on, the pair of us even consummated our love!"

1021
01:31:03,000 --> 01:31:05,000
Hazel: "Consummated? Well, I never!"

1022
01:31:05,000 --> 01:31:08,000
*Hazel grins, then kicks me underneath the table.*

1023
01:31:08,000 --> 01:31:13,000
Hazel: "You really do get around, you sly dog, you - not that I can blame you!"

1024
01:31:13,000 --> 01:31:20,000
Hazel: "I still prefer Lady Yue, of course, but Steffy here's no slacker when it comes to her looks!"

1025
01:31:20,000 --> 01:31:31,000
Hazel: "She's well-proportioned, her eyes are all wide and glassy, and while she's not super endowed in the chest department, there's enough there to appreciate!"

1026
01:31:31,000 --> 01:31:35,000
Hazel: "She's kind, gentle, considerate, and super inexperienced!"

1027
01:31:35,000 --> 01:31:39,000
Hazel: "Who wouldn't wanna show a girl like this a good time?"

1028
01:31:39,000 --> 01:31:44,000
Hazel: "I'd be more'n willin' to take the role on myself, if I wasn't so busy!"

1029
01:31:44,000 --> 01:31:47,000
Stephania: "Huh? I-I don't, um... I mean..."

1030
01:31:47,000 --> 01:31:48,000
*Stephania whimpers.*

1031
01:31:48,000 --> 01:31:57,000
Stephania: "I-I appreciate your kind words, b-but please, d-don't look at me like that. Y-You're eyeing me up like a slab of meat."

1032
01:31:57,000 --> 01:31:59,000
Stephania: "I-It's kind of scary..."

1033
01:31:59,000 --> 01:32:11,000
Elizabeth: "With all due respect, Miss Williams, I would watch your tongue if I were you. Milady has a delicate constitution, and your scurrilous remarks will only unnerve her."

1034
01:32:11,000 --> 01:32:12,000
Hazel: "Ahaha..."

1035
01:32:12,000 --> 01:32:17,000
*Hazel laughs awkwardly, suitably chastened, and slumps back in her chair.*

1036
01:32:17,000 --> 01:32:21,000
Hazel: "Sorry, sorry. I guess I got a lil carried away there."

1037
01:32:21,000 --> 01:32:31,000
Hazel: "I was just tryin' to say, I think you're plenty cute, Steffy! I don't begrudge Hiroki for wanting to get to know you better; not at all!"

1038
01:32:31,000 --> 01:32:35,000
Stephania: "I, um, appreciate that, I suppose... B-But mistress..."

1039
01:32:35,000 --> 01:32:39,000
*Stephania looks back at Hifumi, her green eyes imploring.*

1040
01:32:39,000 --> 01:32:43,000
Stephania: "Y-You don't despise me for what I've done, do you?"

1041
01:32:43,000 --> 01:32:52,000
Stephania: "I-If you're upset with me, I will understand, of course. I hardly deserve your forgiveness; not after ensnaring your fiancé."

1042
01:32:52,000 --> 01:33:03,000
Stephania: "If you want to leave Astoria, and to abandon our upcoming karuta match, I  would understand. I would deserve it, even, for being so very underhanded."

1043
01:33:03,000 --> 01:33:13,000
Stephania: "As much as I've grown to care for Hiroki, I do realize that skulking about in the shadows with other women's fiancés is in poor form indeed!"

1044
01:33:13,000 --> 01:33:19,000
Stephania: "My own inexperience when it comes to matters of love is hardly an excuse!"

1045
01:33:19,000 --> 01:33:22,000
Stephania: "I do like Hiroki, it's true..."

1046
01:33:22,000 --> 01:33:30,000
Stephania: "B-But you're also important to me, mistress! You've been nothing but kind to me, and I've betrayed your trust!"

1047
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:41,000
Stephania: "I thought of keeping what occurred to myself - I didn't want to cause you any undue pain - but that, I think, would have made me feel even guiltier."

1048
01:33:41,000 --> 01:33:47,000
Stephania: "I couldn't live with myself, keeping so heavy a secret shut away within my heart!"

1049
01:33:47,000 --> 01:33:52,000
Stephania: "It seemed paramount to tell you this, so that you can judge me!"

1050
01:33:52,000 --> 01:33:59,000
Stephania: "Hiroki said that everything would be fine, but I can't believe that! I still feel guilty!"

1051
01:33:59,000 --> 01:34:09,000
Stephania: "If you want me to cut my own hair off in penance for my sins, I'd be prepared to do it! That's how very aggrieved I feel about all this!"

1052
01:34:09,000 --> 01:34:15,000
Stephania: "I will accept any punishment you might see fit to bestow upon me, so please..."

1053
01:34:15,000 --> 01:34:20,000
Stephania: "Judge me as you will! I deserve nothing less, for being so very vile!"

1054
01:34:20,000 --> 01:34:21,000
Hifumi: "..."

1055
01:34:21,000 --> 01:34:27,000
*A brief silence passes, during which Hifumi observes the crown of Stephania's blonde head.*

1056
01:34:27,000 --> 01:34:31,000
*She looks at the princess, her brow furrowed, and then...*

1057
01:34:31,000 --> 01:34:32,000
Hifumi: "My, my."

1058
01:34:32,000 --> 01:34:43,000
Hifumi: "I can tell that you're very serious about this, dear Stephania - but please, do not worry. You don't need to bow before me, and you don't need to tremble in fear."

1059
01:34:43,000 --> 01:34:47,000
Hifumi: "Dry your damp eyes. I'm not at all upset with you."

1060
01:34:47,000 --> 01:34:51,000
Hifumi: "How could I be, when you are so very sweet?"

1061
01:34:51,000 --> 01:34:57,000
Stephania: "Wh-What? But, mistress...! Surely you don't forgive me for my sins, do you?!"

1062
01:34:57,000 --> 01:34:59,000
Hifumi: "No, I do not forgive you-"

1063
01:34:59,000 --> 01:35:01,000
Stephania: "I-I knew it..."

1064
01:35:01,000 --> 01:35:09,000
Hifumi: "-largely because I don't believe that you have committed a sin that needs forgiving in the first place."

1065
01:35:09,000 --> 01:35:10,000
Stephania: "H-Huh...?"

1066
01:35:10,000 --> 01:35:12,000
*Stephania blinks, taken aback.*

1067
01:35:12,000 --> 01:35:14,000
Stephania: "You don't...?"

1068
01:35:14,000 --> 01:35:21,000
Hifumi: "No, I don't. As I have said, I can't fault you for wanting to explore your feelings with Hiroki."

1069
01:35:21,000 --> 01:35:29,000
Hifumi: "I fear you've been stuck inside this palace for too long. For many years, you have known nothing of romance."

1070
01:35:29,000 --> 01:35:37,000
Hifumi: "I think it's only natural that, upon being presented with the opportunity to learn, you would want to take it."

1071
01:35:37,000 --> 01:35:40,000
Hifumi: "How can I fault you for that?"

1072
01:35:40,000 --> 01:35:51,000
Hifumi: "I know, after observing you during our karuta matches, that you are a very passionate woman. I am sure that passion extends to matters of the heart, too."

1073
01:35:51,000 --> 01:35:58,000
Hifumi: "I don't want you to deprive yourself. Life is short, and we must take our amusements where we can."

1074
01:35:58,000 --> 01:36:02,000
Hifumi: "Foregoing our heart's desires only makes us unhappy!"

1075
01:36:02,000 --> 01:36:09,000
Hifumi: "I wish for you to smile, dear Stephania. Please, do not fret. I bear no animosity towards you."

1076
01:36:09,000 --> 01:36:10,000
Hifumi: "Moreover..."

1077
01:36:10,000 --> 01:36:11,000
*Hifumi smiles coyly.*

1078
01:36:11,000 --> 01:36:17,000
Hifumi: "I don't know if Hiroki has told you this, but he and I have an open relationship."

1079
01:36:17,000 --> 01:36:26,000
Stephania: "He did mention it, but I'm unsure about what, precisely that entrails. What does it mean to have an "open" relationship?"

1080
01:36:26,000 --> 01:36:29,000
Hazel: "It means, he's actually seein' me as well!"

1081
01:36:29,000 --> 01:36:30,000
Stephania: "H-Huh?"

1082
01:36:30,000 --> 01:36:31,000
Stephania: "H-He is?"

1083
01:36:31,000 --> 01:36:36,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed - and me, too, and several other women into the bargain."

1084
01:36:36,000 --> 01:36:41,000
Marina: "Hiroki is quite the stud, in case you haven't realized it."

1085
01:36:41,000 --> 01:36:50,000
Marina: "We have all shared Hiroki between us for several months, and it has been quite the pleasant arrangement for everyone involved."

1086
01:36:50,000 --> 01:37:01,000
Marina: "I don't mind overly if another woman wishes to indulge in Hiroki's affections, though I do insist he continue to pay me attention from time to time."

1087
01:37:01,000 --> 01:37:07,000
Hazel: "Samesies! I'm, like, not jelly at all, so don't worry! Everything's just swell!"

1088
01:37:07,000 --> 01:37:13,000
*A beaming Hazel gives Stephania a thumbs up - then, glancing at the clock, she starts.*

1089
01:37:13,000 --> 01:37:19,000
Hazel: "Oh! I can't hang 'round here, though, consoling you, as much as I'd like to!"

1090
01:37:19,000 --> 01:37:26,000
Hazel: "My tennis tournament's comin' up, and I've gotta be there in double quick time! I don't wanna be late!"

1091
01:37:26,000 --> 01:37:28,000
Hazel: "Sorry, but I've gotta jet!"

1092
01:37:28,000 --> 01:37:32,000
*Hazel takes off, her ponytail fluttering behind her.*

1093
01:37:32,000 --> 01:37:38,000
Hazel: "I hope you guys'll come and watch me while I play! I'm gonna do my best out there!"

1094
01:37:38,000 --> 01:37:41,000
*So saying, Hazel departs, in a flurry of activity.*

1095
01:37:41,000 --> 01:37:49,000
*She slams the dining room door in her wake (a gesture with makes Elizabeth tut), and silence once more descends.*

1096
01:37:49,000 --> 01:37:52,000
*Stephania looks at Hifumi, Marina, and me.*

1097
01:37:52,000 --> 01:37:53,000
*She blinks.*

1098
01:37:53,000 --> 01:37:56,000
*Then, with eyes full of wonderment, she says...*

1099
01:37:56,000 --> 01:38:02,000
Stephania: "I-I had no idea you were seeing quite this many women! This is quite the surprise!"

1100
01:38:02,000 --> 01:38:11,000
Stephania: "Now, I feel even more blessed, knowing that you chose me, despite having so many other gorgeous women at your beck and call."

1101
01:38:11,000 --> 01:38:17,000
Stephania: "I doubt I can hold a candle to my mistress here, or Marina, or even Hazel..."

1102
01:38:17,000 --> 01:38:19,000
Stephania: "But you know me!"

1103
01:38:19,000 --> 01:38:22,000
*Stephania clenches her hands into fists.*

1104
01:38:22,000 --> 01:38:28,000
Stephania: "I'm not one to give up! I will continue to fight, even if all seems hopeless!"

1105
01:38:28,000 --> 01:38:32,000
Stephania: "I won't let myself flag behind all the others!"

1106
01:38:32,000 --> 01:38:41,000
Stephania: "Now I know that the competition for your heart is so fierce, I'll give it everything I have to hold your attention!"

1107
01:38:41,000 --> 01:38:42,000
Stephania: "Ohohoho!"

1108
01:38:42,000 --> 01:38:47,000
Elizabeth: "That's the spirit. Do your best, milady. I will cheer for you."

1109
01:38:47,000 --> 01:38:52,000
Hifumi: "Me too! I do enjoy seeing you so fired up, my cute disciple."

1110
01:38:52,000 --> 01:39:01,000
Hifumi: "Now, it would seem you are not only my competitor when it comes to karuta, but when it comes to Hiroki's affections, too!"

1111
01:39:01,000 --> 01:39:06,000
Hifumi: "I wonder which of us will emerge the victor in this heated bout..."

1112
01:39:06,000 --> 01:39:07,000
Hifumi: "Ufufufu~"

1113
01:39:07,000 --> 01:39:16,000
*I excuse myself from the parlor, after my awkward exchange with Stephania and Hifumi, and go for a walk around the palace's gardens.*

1114
01:39:16,000 --> 01:39:25,000
*I suppose I should be used to attractive women throwing themselves at me at this point, but it's still a lot for me to deal with.*

1115
01:39:25,000 --> 01:39:30,000
*It doesn't quite feel like I'm inhabiting the same reality as everybody else.*

1116
01:39:30,000 --> 01:39:39,000
*Geez. It's no wonder my work colleagues hate me so much, what with my popularity. If I was on the outside looking in, I'd hate me, too.*

1117
01:39:39,000 --> 01:39:40,000
*Sigh.*

1118
01:39:40,000 --> 01:39:43,000
*Oh well. I guess I shouldn't bemoan my good luck.*

1119
01:39:43,000 --> 01:39:48,000
*I should consider myself fortunate that Stephania is so fond of me.*

1120
01:39:48,000 --> 01:39:55,000
*She's a cutie, and, based on what I've heard about her upbringing, she's led quite the sheltered existence.*

1121
01:39:55,000 --> 01:40:02,000
*I think it'll be good for her if we can go out on more dates. She could certainly use the experience.*

1122
01:40:02,000 --> 01:40:07,000
*Spending hours and hours cooped up inside the palace can't have been much fun.*

1123
01:40:07,000 --> 01:40:15,000
*Sure, I'm benefiting from the newfound attention she's lavishing upon me, but I think Stephania's benefiting from it, too.*

1124
01:40:15,000 --> 01:40:20,000
*She looks happy about our newfound relationship, which puts me at my ease.*

1125
01:40:20,000 --> 01:40:27,000
*Naïve though she might be, I don't think I'm taking advantage of her. I'd never want to do that.*

1126
01:40:27,000 --> 01:40:30,000
*I only want to see Stephania smile - and she is.*

1127
01:40:30,000 --> 01:40:41,000
*Elizabeth, too, seems pleased by Stephania's good mood, as was Hifumi. I wasn't able to detect any hint of jealousy upon her face, after she learned of our recent affair.*

1128
01:40:41,000 --> 01:40:43,000
*As for Hazel, meanwhile...*

1129
01:40:43,000 --> 01:40:48,000
*Well. Hazel's such a chipper, cheery girl, I doubt anything would faze her.*

1130
01:40:48,000 --> 01:40:57,000
*Since she's a lover of pretty girls herself, it'd be pretty hypocritical of her if she castigated me for my newfound affections.*

1131
01:40:57,000 --> 01:41:03,000
*Hazel sounded 100%% supportive about our relationship at the breakfast table, in fact.*

1132
01:41:03,000 --> 01:41:07,000
*...Speaking of Hazel, she said her tennis tournament was today.*

1133
01:41:07,000 --> 01:41:12,000
*I bet she'll be at the large sports center at Rosenberg right now, practicing.*

1134
01:41:12,000 --> 01:41:14,000
*I wonder how she's holding up?*

1135
01:41:14,000 --> 01:41:24,000
*I haven't talked to Hazel very much over the last week - and, upbeat though she is, I wouldn't be surprised if she's feeling some pre-match anxiety.*

1136
01:41:24,000 --> 01:41:29,000
*All of a sudden, I've a real desire to spend some time with her, one-on-one.*

1137
01:41:29,000 --> 01:41:37,000
*I want Hazel to do her very best on the court today - and, for that to happen, I should probably pay her some more attention.*

1138
01:41:37,000 --> 01:41:38,000
Hiroki: "Right."

1139
01:41:38,000 --> 01:41:47,000
*I nod my head, filled with newfound determination, and clench my right hand into a fist - not, of course, that anybody's around to see it.*

1140
01:41:47,000 --> 01:41:54,000
*The palace's gardens are pretty chilly, and there's nobody around; not even a few scurrying, nameless maids.*

1141
01:41:54,000 --> 01:41:56,000
Hiroki: "I'd best go to Rosenberg."

1142
01:41:56,000 --> 01:42:04,000
Hiroki: "Hazel always acts like she can manage everything on her own, but I think even she could use a bit of support."

1143
01:42:04,000 --> 01:42:09,000
*Hazel's supported me so much herself, after all, that I think I owe her.*

1144
01:42:09,000 --> 01:42:12,000
*I'm her partner, so I've got to be there for her.*

1145
01:42:12,000 --> 01:42:14,000
*It's as simple as that.*

1146
01:42:14,000 --> 01:42:24,000
*My mind made up, I catch a lift to Rosenberg with one of Stephania's chauffeurs, who drops me off outside the tennis courts where Hazel'll be playing.*

1147
01:42:24,000 --> 01:42:36,000
*I confirmed Hazel's location with her beforehand, and she gave me the A-OK to stop on by to speak to her; though Hazel did tell me, over a text message, that she'd be fine without me.*

1148
01:42:36,000 --> 01:42:43,000
Hazel: "You don't need to worry so much, Hiroki! I'm at the top of my game, really! I'll be A-OK..."

1149
01:42:43,000 --> 01:42:47,000
Hazel: "But if you really wanna see me, I won't turn you down! :p"

1150
01:42:47,000 --> 01:42:55,000
*When I do arrive at the tennis courts, I'm greeted with suspicion by the receptionist, but Hazel hastens to vouch for me.*

1151
01:42:55,000 --> 01:43:04,000
Hazel: "You don't need to worry one jot about Hiroki, Lily! He's not a crazy fan who's come here to steal one of my towels! He's with me!"

1152
01:43:04,000 --> 01:43:07,000
Hazel: "The two of us are as thick as thieves!"

1153
01:43:07,000 --> 01:43:15,000
Hazel: "In fact, if Hiroki did wanna get hold of one of my old, sweaty towels, I might just let him! That's how close we are!"

1154
01:43:15,000 --> 01:43:18,000
Hazel: "There aren't any secrets between us!"

1155
01:43:18,000 --> 01:43:28,000
*I think Hazel means to reassure the receptionist (Lily, did Hazel call her?), but, rather than looking consoled, she, instead appears annoyed.*

1156
01:43:28,000 --> 01:43:40,000
*Maybe Hazel's insistences that she would, in fact, let me borrow one of her sweaty towels, should I ask for it (not that I would!) have made her even more suspicious of me.*

1157
01:43:40,000 --> 01:43:48,000
*Lily glowers at me, her blue-eyed gaze cooler than bone china - but, after a brief pause, she eventually relents.*

1158
01:43:48,000 --> 01:43:57,000
*I guess she must speak Japanese (that's awfully convenient), because I can understand her reply, even though it sounds somewhat stilted.*

1159
01:43:57,000 --> 01:44:00,000
*I wonder if she, like Stephania, is a Japanophile?*

1160
01:44:00,000 --> 01:44:04,000
*I had no idea so many people in Astoria could speak my language!*

1161
01:44:04,000 --> 01:44:16,000
Lily: "Oh, very well. You can spend some time with Miss Williams if you so desire - she seems fond of you, for whatever reason - but I must ask that you maintain some decorum."

1162
01:44:16,000 --> 01:44:28,000
Lily: "Please keep your hands to yourself, and don't distract her unnecessarily. The tournament will begin in a few hours, and Miss Williams needs to be in peak physical condition."

1163
01:44:28,000 --> 01:44:34,000
Lily: "I would never forgive you if she performed poorly because of your interference!"

1164
01:44:34,000 --> 01:44:48,000
*I reassure the stern, over-protective Lily that I have no desire to screw Hazel over - why would I, when I've come to cheer her on? - then enter the indoor courts with Hazel, where she's been practicing.*

1165
01:44:48,000 --> 01:44:53,000
*Once there, Hazel sits on the floor, then launches into a series of sit-ups.*

1166
01:44:53,000 --> 01:45:02,000
*Hazel's body is pretty toned in general, owing to all the athletics she's involved in, but her thighs in particular look incredible.*

1167
01:45:02,000 --> 01:45:10,000
*Forget going gaga over one of Hazel's old, sweat-soaked towels; I'd far rather spend my time ogling her thighs!*

1168
01:45:10,000 --> 01:45:13,000
*...Not that I should be ogling her at all, really.*

1169
01:45:13,000 --> 01:45:18,000
*If Lily knew I was staring at Hazel so unabashedly, I think she'd be annoyed.*

1170
01:45:18,000 --> 01:45:19,000
*Speaking of which...*

1171
01:45:19,000 --> 01:45:23,000
Hiroki: "The receptionist here seems pretty fond of you."

1172
01:45:23,000 --> 01:45:24,000
Hazel: "Lily does?"

1173
01:45:24,000 --> 01:45:30,000
*Hazel sits up, beads of sweat beginning to form upon her flushed brow, and beams.*

1174
01:45:30,000 --> 01:45:38,000
Hazel: "She's gotten kinda attached, yeah. I've only been training here for, like, a week, but she's taken a real shine to me!"

1175
01:45:38,000 --> 01:45:41,000
Hazel: "She's a real sweetheart, don't'cha think?"

1176
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:43,000
Hiroki: "Maybe she's sweet on you..."

1177
01:45:43,000 --> 01:45:44,000
*I frown.*

1178
01:45:44,000 --> 01:45:48,000
Hiroki: "But she didn't seem to care for me very much."

1179
01:45:48,000 --> 01:45:49,000
Hazel: "Y'think?"

1180
01:45:49,000 --> 01:45:59,000
Hiroki: "I don't just think that: I know that. She made her disdain for me quite apparent. It couldn't've been more obvious that she hated me if she tried."

1181
01:45:59,000 --> 01:46:03,000
Hiroki: "She was looking at me like I was some kind of sewer rat!"

1182
01:46:03,000 --> 01:46:04,000
Hazel: "Haha! Well!"

1183
01:46:04,000 --> 01:46:05,000
*Hazel giggles.*

1184
01:46:05,000 --> 01:46:10,000
Hazel: "Lily's a little like Yuriko in that regard. You remember her, right?"

1185
01:46:10,000 --> 01:46:12,000
Hiroki: "How could I not?"

1186
01:46:12,000 --> 01:46:20,000
*Yuriko was (and I think she still is) the receptionist at the Ookawa Sports Center, which Hazel frequents back in Tokyo.*

1187
01:46:20,000 --> 01:46:25,000
*Yuriko took against me the moment we met, largely, I think, out of jealousy.*

1188
01:46:25,000 --> 01:46:34,000
*I didn't know it at the time, upon our first meeting, but Hazel soon 'fessed up that she and Yuriko were engaged in a romantic relationship.*

1189
01:46:34,000 --> 01:46:46,000
*Their relationship wasn't exclusive - Hazel had been pretty plain about that - but Yuriko was the jealous type, and she resented me for spending time with Hazel in any capacity.*

1190
01:46:46,000 --> 01:46:56,000
*It was because of Yuriko's intense clinginess that Hazel wound up breaking things off with her. They've not been an item for a few months now.*

1191
01:46:56,000 --> 01:47:05,000
*I have wondered (albeit, idly) how Yuriko's been dealing with the sting of rejection, but I've never thought to bring the subject up.*

1192
01:47:05,000 --> 01:47:14,000
*I've not been back to the Ookawa Sports Center myself, so I haven't seen Yuriko since our initial encounter - and thank goodness for that.*

1193
01:47:14,000 --> 01:47:18,000
*If she saw me again, I think she might eviscerate me.*

1194
01:47:18,000 --> 01:47:27,000
*Lily reminded me of Yuriko quite a lot, not in the least because they both work as receptionists, and they both have flowery names.*

1195
01:47:27,000 --> 01:47:29,000
*Now, I'm starting to wonder...*

1196
01:47:29,000 --> 01:47:32,000
Hiroki: "You aren't dating Lily, are you?"

1197
01:47:32,000 --> 01:47:33,000
Hazel: "Dating?"

1198
01:47:33,000 --> 01:47:34,000
*Hazel grins.*

1199
01:47:34,000 --> 01:47:44,000
Hazel: "I dunno if that's quite the right word for it! I wouldn't wanna lead her on like that; not when I'll be going back to Japan soon enough!"

1200
01:47:44,000 --> 01:47:54,000
Hazel: "It's not like Lily's gonna come back to Tokyo with me. She's happy staying in Astoria, and I don't have the time for a long-distance relationship!"

1201
01:47:54,000 --> 01:48:02,000
Hazel: "I made it super clear to her, from the get-go, that I wasn't looking for love! This isn't anything serious!"

1202
01:48:02,000 --> 01:48:09,000
Hiroki: "Alright, maybe that was a poor choice of words. You're not dating, then - but have you... Y'know..."

1203
01:48:09,000 --> 01:48:11,000
Hazel: "Gotten frisky with her?"

1204
01:48:11,000 --> 01:48:12,000
*Hazel smirks.*

1205
01:48:12,000 --> 01:48:14,000
Hazel: "Well, what do you think?"

1206
01:48:14,000 --> 01:48:24,000
*Hazel looks so proud of herself, like a teen boy who's just asked out the most popular girl in school, I know there's only one right answer to her query.*

1207
01:48:24,000 --> 01:48:28,000
Hiroki: "I think that you, Miss Williams, are a scoundrel."

1208
01:48:28,000 --> 01:48:29,000
Hazel: "A scoundrel?!"

1209
01:48:29,000 --> 01:48:32,000
*Hazel stands up, then pouts at me, affronted.*

1210
01:48:32,000 --> 01:48:34,000
Hazel: "How'd you figure?!"

1211
01:48:34,000 --> 01:48:42,000
Hiroki: "You know exactly why I think that. You just can't help yourself. You see a pretty girl, and you go crazy over her!"

1212
01:48:42,000 --> 01:48:45,000
Hiroki: "You didn't need to seduce Lily, did you?"

1213
01:48:45,000 --> 01:48:52,000
Hazel: "I didn't need to, no, but I wanted to! I mean, geez, haven't you seen her?! She's super cute!"

1214
01:48:52,000 --> 01:48:55,000
Hazel: "She's, like, a solid 7/10 at least!"

1215
01:48:55,000 --> 01:49:04,000
Hazel: "She's no Lady Yue, of course, but I like how haughty and aloof she acts - and how very sweet she is, once you get to know her!"

1216
01:49:04,000 --> 01:49:08,000
Hazel: "How could I not wanna kiss her, just a little?!"

1217
01:49:08,000 --> 01:49:16,000
Hiroki: "I bet, based on the nasty look she shot me, you've done more than kiss her - and I bet it was more than "a little"."

1218
01:49:16,000 --> 01:49:28,000
*It makes sense, now, why Hazel's been so very busy during our stay in Astoria. She's only attended dinner at the palace a couple of times, despite the cook's food being delectable.*

1219
01:49:28,000 --> 01:49:34,000
*Hazel must've been busy wandering Rosenberg in the evenings, taking Lily out on dates.*

1220
01:49:34,000 --> 01:49:38,000
*She probably sampled a few of Rosenberg's hotels with her, too.*

1221
01:49:38,000 --> 01:49:46,000
*That would certainly explain why Hazel knew exactly where to go a few days prior, when she escorted Marina and I to a hotel.*

1222
01:49:46,000 --> 01:49:49,000
*Hazel sure has been enjoying herself.*

1223
01:49:49,000 --> 01:50:00,000
*I'm not jealous of her conquests - it'd be hypocritical of me to be jealous, given the ever-expanding nature of my harem - but I do feel a little bad for Lily.*

1224
01:50:00,000 --> 01:50:03,000
Hiroki: "She likes you a lot, you know?"

1225
01:50:03,000 --> 01:50:04,000
Hazel: "You think?!"

1226
01:50:04,000 --> 01:50:05,000
*Hazel beams.*

1227
01:50:05,000 --> 01:50:09,000
Hazel: "I'm happy to hear that! I like her a lot, too!"

1228
01:50:09,000 --> 01:50:16,000
Hiroki: "No, I mean, I think she likes you a bit too much. She'll be sad when you have to go back to Japan."

1229
01:50:16,000 --> 01:50:18,000
Hazel: "Ahaha, yeah..."

1230
01:50:18,000 --> 01:50:21,000
Hazel: "Maybe I did let things get a bit too far."

1231
01:50:21,000 --> 01:50:32,000
Hazel: "I told her not to expect too much, but Lily's, like, a total romantic. I've only known her for a little while, but I think she's already fallen for me."

1232
01:50:32,000 --> 01:50:39,000
Hazel: "Curse me for being so irresistible! If only my face wasn't so pretty, and my body wasn't so banging!"

1233
01:50:39,000 --> 01:50:44,000
Hazel: "It's hard being bisexual while being this irresistible, y'know?"

1234
01:50:44,000 --> 01:50:52,000
Hiroki: "Yes, it must be awful for you, having to date so many pretty women. My heart is positively breaking on your behalf."

1235
01:50:52,000 --> 01:51:03,000
Hazel: "Aw, c'mon, Hiroki! You've gotta know what it's like for me, better'n anybody else! You have a bunch of pretty women swooning over you, too; myself included!"

1236
01:51:03,000 --> 01:51:06,000
Hazel: "Don't you ever find it exhausting?"

1237
01:51:06,000 --> 01:51:08,000
Hiroki: "Sometimes, I guess..."

1238
01:51:08,000 --> 01:51:17,000
*I can't deny, it can be difficult, trying to divvy my attention up between so many women: particularly when Ayu and Yue are so clingy.*

1239
01:51:17,000 --> 01:51:21,000
Hiroki: "...but there's a crucial difference between me and you."

1240
01:51:21,000 --> 01:51:22,000
Hazel: "Like what?"

1241
01:51:22,000 --> 01:51:33,000
Hiroki: "I don't go around trying to seduce women indiscriminately; not like you. If you have too many women to juggle, it's because you have no self-control."

1242
01:51:33,000 --> 01:51:42,000
Hiroki: "I, meanwhile, just so happen to have women falling over me. I can't go two steps outside my house without being accosted!"

1243
01:51:42,000 --> 01:51:46,000
Hiroki: "I'm not even trying to be this popular! It just happened!"

1244
01:51:46,000 --> 01:51:47,000
Hazel: "Hehe, well..."

1245
01:51:47,000 --> 01:51:48,000
*Hazel giggles.*

1246
01:51:48,000 --> 01:51:56,000
Hazel: "You'll forgive me if I ain't too sorry for you, Hiroki, my guy. There're worse fates, y'know, than being beloved!"

1247
01:51:56,000 --> 01:52:02,000
Hiroki: "I know, I know. I just think you ought to try and be more circumspect in your affairs."

1248
01:52:02,000 --> 01:52:07,000
Hazel: "I was tryin', believe me, but Lily's too cute not to flirt with!"

1249
01:52:07,000 --> 01:52:10,000
Hiroki: "I'll take your word for it..."

1250
01:52:10,000 --> 01:52:21,000
*Lily is quite pretty, I suppose, but I don't know if I'd much like to add her to my harem - not, I think, that she'd want to be a member of my harem to begin with.*

1251
01:52:21,000 --> 01:52:26,000
*The look she shot me in the reception area was downright withering.*

1252
01:52:26,000 --> 01:52:27,000
*Sigh.*

1253
01:52:27,000 --> 01:52:30,000
*Why do all of Hazel's girlfriends hate me so much?*

1254
01:52:30,000 --> 01:52:42,000
*Having a bi partner with a lot of pretty women at her beck and call might sound nice in theory, I guess, but it's less so when your partner's girlfriends all seem to despise you!*

1255
01:52:42,000 --> 01:52:43,000
Hazel: "Anyways!"

1256
01:52:43,000 --> 01:52:46,000
*Hazel resumes her sit-ups, smiling all the while.*

1257
01:52:46,000 --> 01:52:51,000
Hazel: "I don't s'pose you came here to talk to me about Lily, didja?"

1258
01:52:51,000 --> 01:52:59,000
Hiroki: "No, I didn't. I actually came here because I want to cheer you on. The tournament's starting soon, isn't it?"

1259
01:52:59,000 --> 01:53:00,000
Hazel: "That's right!"

1260
01:53:00,000 --> 01:53:07,000
Hiroki: "Then I hope you do well. I'm sure you will, of course - you always do - but I'll be rooting for you."

1261
01:53:07,000 --> 01:53:11,000
Hiroki: "Knock them dead out there - but not literally, of course."

1262
01:53:11,000 --> 01:53:12,000
Hazel: "Of course!"

1263
01:53:12,000 --> 01:53:13,000
*Hazel laughs.*

1264
01:53:13,000 --> 01:53:20,000
Hazel: "Don't worry, Hiroki! I'm not gonna make too much of a nuisance out of myself on the courts!"

1265
01:53:20,000 --> 01:53:27,000
Hazel: "I draw the line at picking up pretty, innocent young women with suspiciously floral names, hehe!"

1266
01:53:27,000 --> 01:53:37,000
Hazel: "I won't crack any of my opponents' skulls in with my tennis racquet - though I reckon that would be a pretty sure-fire way of winning, hehe!"

1267
01:53:37,000 --> 01:53:38,000
Hiroki: "Maybe so..."

1268
01:53:38,000 --> 01:53:41,000
*I smile, amused at Hazel's lust for blood.*

1269
01:53:41,000 --> 01:53:50,000
Hiroki: "But you practice pretty hard when it comes to tennis. I've no doubts you'll be able to win without resorting to underhanded tactics."

1270
01:53:50,000 --> 01:53:53,000
Hazel: "I think so, too! That's the plan, at least!"

1271
01:53:53,000 --> 01:53:59,000
Hazel: "I'm gonna do my very best out there, so don't you fret! I've got this in the bag!"

1272
01:53:59,000 --> 01:54:04,000
Hazel: "I only hope you're lookin' forward to my killer performance!"

1273
01:54:04,000 --> 01:54:09,000
Hiroki: "Of course I am. I always look forward to your performances."

1274
01:54:09,000 --> 01:54:16,000
Hiroki: "I'll be watching you from the stands - and so will Stephania, and Elizabeth, and the others."

1275
01:54:16,000 --> 01:54:19,000
Hiroki: "We all want to see you do well!"

1276
01:54:19,000 --> 01:54:22,000
Hazel: "I'm not so sure that Marina does..."

1277
01:54:22,000 --> 01:54:25,000
*Hazel demurs, while smiling awkwardly.*

1278
01:54:25,000 --> 01:54:31,000
Hazel: "She's a meanie, so I bet she'll wanna see me falling flat on my cute, plush posterior..."

1279
01:54:31,000 --> 01:54:39,000
Hazel: "But if Steffy's gonna be in attendance, that'll give me even more of an incentive to do my gosh-darned best!"

1280
01:54:39,000 --> 01:54:41,000
Hiroki: "You want to impress her?"

1281
01:54:41,000 --> 01:54:46,000
Hazel: "Of course I do! She's a princess! Why wouldn't I wanna impress her?"

1282
01:54:46,000 --> 01:54:50,000
Hazel: "It doesn't hurt, either, that she's super adorbs, hehe."

1283
01:54:50,000 --> 01:55:00,000
Hazel: "If Steffy didn't have eyes for you, and I didn't have my hands full with Lily, maybe I would've tried flirting with her myself - but alas!"

1284
01:55:00,000 --> 01:55:04,000
Hazel: "I get the feeling Steffy wouldn't return my feelings!"

1285
01:55:04,000 --> 01:55:07,000
Hiroki: "Maybe not. She seems quite sheltered..."

1286
01:55:07,000 --> 01:55:21,000
*She's so sheltered, in fact, I wouldn't be surprised if Stephania is wholly ignorant about the finer points of lesbianism. I can't imagine it's something her parents, the King and Queen, would have educated her on.*

1287
01:55:21,000 --> 01:55:28,000
Hazel: "Hehe, well, that's fine. I won't make any moves on Steffy. I know you've already called dibs on her."

1288
01:55:28,000 --> 01:55:34,000
Hazel: "I ain't gonna try and steal her from under your nose, though you might wanna watch it."

1289
01:55:34,000 --> 01:55:42,000
Hazel: "I'll be workin' so hard out there, on the courts, Steffy might wind up falling for me anyways! You never know!"

1290
01:55:42,000 --> 01:55:50,000
Hazel: "I've heard it said I'm a goddess on the courts, and I think goddesses are even more impressive than princesses!"

1291
01:55:50,000 --> 01:55:55,000
Hazel: "Just don't cry too much, 'kay, if I do wind up making her swoon!"

1292
01:55:55,000 --> 01:55:59,000
Hazel: "I'm so incredible, I sometimes scare even myself!"

1293
01:55:59,000 --> 01:56:00,000
*Later that day...*

1294
01:56:00,000 --> 01:56:06,000
Announcer: "<Williams has taken the point! She's in the lead, with a score of 3-1!>"

1295
01:56:06,000 --> 01:56:11,000
Announcer: "<Svitolina, meanwhile, is flagging. How will she respond?>"

1296
01:56:11,000 --> 01:56:18,000
Announcer: "<It's Svitolina to serve. It's a powerful one, but - ooh! Williams returns it with ease!>"

1297
01:56:18,000 --> 01:56:22,000
*I watch, enraptured, as Hazel runs about on the tennis court.*

1298
01:56:22,000 --> 01:56:28,000
*Her pleated skirt swishes about her tanned thighs, and her long ponytail flutters behind her.*

1299
01:56:28,000 --> 01:56:34,000
*Hazel's green eyes are narrowed with concentration, but she doesn't look at all anxious.*

1300
01:56:34,000 --> 01:56:41,000
*Her lips are pulled back in a confident smile, and her teeth seem to shine in the weak, wintry sunlight.*

1301
01:56:41,000 --> 01:56:46,000
*Hazel looks so cool and composed, I can hardly take my eyes off her.*

1302
01:56:46,000 --> 01:56:53,000
*I sometimes forget this, given how carelessly she speaks, but she really is an impressive athlete.*

1303
01:56:53,000 --> 01:57:00,000
*Hazel makes each of her motions appear effortless, but I know she trained hard to reach those heights.*

1304
01:57:00,000 --> 01:57:08,000
*Her opponent - a blonde woman called Svitolina - is having a hard time merely matching Hazel's pace, much less besting it.*

1305
01:57:08,000 --> 01:57:14,000
*I don't want to count my chickens pre-emptively, but it looks like Hazel has this in the bag.*

1306
01:57:14,000 --> 01:57:21,000
*The announcer certainly seems to think so, because their commentary has become incredibly pro-Hazel.*

1307
01:57:21,000 --> 01:57:32,000
*I can't understand what they're saying, exactly, given they're giving their narration in German (it is Astoria's national language), but I can get the general gist of it.*

1308
01:57:32,000 --> 01:57:39,000
*The announcer's voice is excitable. It sounds like they're having a blast, not that I can blame them.*

1309
01:57:39,000 --> 01:57:44,000
*I'm getting pumped too, watching Hazel, and I hardly know a thing about tennis.*

1310
01:57:44,000 --> 01:57:50,000
*There's something enchanting about Hazel, while she's in motion, which demands attention.*

1311
01:57:50,000 --> 01:57:54,000
*My eyes are drawn to her helplessly, as though magnetized.*

1312
01:57:54,000 --> 01:57:56,000
*I can't stop staring.*

1313
01:57:56,000 --> 01:57:59,000
*I feel a bit sorry for Svitolina, but...*

1314
01:57:59,000 --> 01:58:06,000
Announcer: "<It's another point to Williams! The score is 4-1, and the gap seems likely to keep increasing!>"

1315
01:58:06,000 --> 01:58:11,000
Announcer: "<Does Svitolina have any chance of pulling this back?!>"

1316
01:58:11,000 --> 01:58:19,000
Announcer: "<It's not over just yet, but Williams seems to have hit her stride! She's not even breaking a sweat!>"

1317
01:58:19,000 --> 01:58:22,000
Announcer: "<This all looks like a game to her!>"

1318
01:58:22,000 --> 01:58:24,000
Stephania: "Goodness..."

1319
01:58:24,000 --> 01:58:33,000
*Stephania, who's sitting beside me in the spectator's stands, exhales. She sounds enchanted; her gaze fixed unwaveringly upon Hazel.*

1320
01:58:33,000 --> 01:58:38,000
Stephania: "This is awfully impressive. I didn't know Hazel was so very talented!"

1321
01:58:38,000 --> 01:58:41,000
Marina: "I cannot fault you for that."

1322
01:58:41,000 --> 01:58:44,000
*Marina, who's sitting alongside us, snorts.*

1323
01:58:44,000 --> 01:58:52,000
Marina: "Goodness knows she doesn't act like it. She seems content to have everybody believe she is a perfect dunce."

1324
01:58:52,000 --> 01:58:57,000
Marina: "She is not quite as stupid, however, as she acts - or, indeed, looks."

1325
01:58:57,000 --> 01:59:03,000
Stephania: "I don't think she's stupid at all! She's positively glowing, like a diamond!"

1326
01:59:03,000 --> 01:59:12,000
Stephania: "She reminds me of my mistress, during our karuta matches - though tennis and karuta are, of course, very different sports."

1327
01:59:12,000 --> 01:59:15,000
Hifumi: "Well, I can agree with you there."

1328
01:59:15,000 --> 01:59:25,000
Hifumi: "The two sports do not share very much in common. I doubt I'd be very good at tennis, though both require a certain degree of precision."

1329
01:59:25,000 --> 01:59:31,000
Stephania: "They require willpower, too, and I think Hazel's focus is very much like your own!"

1330
01:59:31,000 --> 01:59:34,000
Hifumi: "My, my. Do you really think so?"

1331
01:59:34,000 --> 01:59:39,000
Stephania: "Yes, I do! It's obvious that Hazel takes tennis very seriously."

1332
01:59:39,000 --> 01:59:41,000
Stephania: "I wonder..."

1333
01:59:41,000 --> 01:59:44,000
*Stephania presses her lips together.*

1334
01:59:44,000 --> 01:59:48,000
Stephania: "Perhaps I'm not taking karuta seriously enough myself."

1335
01:59:48,000 --> 01:59:55,000
Stephania: "If I wish to improve, I need to dedicate myself to it, body and soul! Then, one day..."

1336
01:59:55,000 --> 01:59:58,000
*Stephania clenches her hands into fists.*

1337
01:59:58,000 --> 02:00:01,000
Stephania: "...maybe even I can shine."

1338
02:00:01,000 --> 02:00:06,000
*Stephania sounds so earnest, I feel obliged to reply - but what should I say...?*

1339
02:00:06,000 --> 02:00:08,000
*A little while later...*

1340
02:00:08,000 --> 02:00:14,000
Announcer: "<And here we can see Hazel Williams, our reigning champion, accepting her trophy!>"

1341
02:00:14,000 --> 02:00:22,000
Announcer: "<She did great out there on the courts today! Her performance is one that won't be forgotten in a hurry!>"

1342
02:00:22,000 --> 02:00:29,000
Announcer: "<How do you feel about today's events, Miss Williams? Are you satisfied with your performance?!>"

1343
02:00:29,000 --> 02:00:37,000
*The announcer - a well-dressed man with slicked-back hair - holds the microphone up to Hazel's face, in front of her mouth.*

1344
02:00:37,000 --> 02:00:44,000
*Hazel is standing on a plinth in the middle of the tennis courts, holding a golden trophy tight to her chest.*

1345
02:00:44,000 --> 02:00:58,000
*Her opponent, the blonde, muscular Svitolina, meanwhile, is standing to her left, holding a silver trophy, while a competitor who was knocked out in a previous round stands to her right, with a bronze trophy.*

1346
02:00:58,000 --> 02:01:02,000
*All three of these winners are damp with sweat; Hazel included.*

1347
02:01:02,000 --> 02:01:11,000
*Though I can only view her from a distance, I can see that Hazel's hair is stuck to her cheeks, and her whole face is flustered.*

1348
02:01:11,000 --> 02:01:18,000
*Hazel's ample chest rises up and down as she inhales, and her striped vest clings to her curves.*

1349
02:01:18,000 --> 02:01:27,000
*Hazel looked like she was utterly in control of the course of her last tennis match, but now I can see that, perhaps, wasn't the case.*

1350
02:01:27,000 --> 02:01:34,000
*Hazel might've beaten Svitolina soundly, but it wasn't an easy victory for her: not by any means.*

1351
02:01:34,000 --> 02:01:37,000
*Svitolina must've put Hazel through her paces.*

1352
02:01:37,000 --> 02:01:44,000
*Hazel's muscular legs are trembling, as is the arm which clutches her trophy tightly to her chest.*

1353
02:01:44,000 --> 02:01:53,000
*She looks ready to collapse at any moment - but, given Hazel's obvious state of exhaustion, her face is illuminated by a bright smile.*

1354
02:01:53,000 --> 02:02:04,000
*Hazel's obviously in her element, standing as she is on the winner's podium. Her face is positively glowing - and, no, that isn't just because of the sweat.*

1355
02:02:04,000 --> 02:02:08,000
*I don't know if I've ever seen her look more enthused.*

1356
02:02:08,000 --> 02:02:16,000
*An interpreter standing beside Hazel translates the announcer's question for her, and she responds in Japanese.*

1357
02:02:16,000 --> 02:02:19,000
Hazel: "Well, I'm very glad you asked!"

1358
02:02:19,000 --> 02:02:25,000
Hazel: "I had a blast out there today; really, I did! The day couldn't've gone any better!"

1359
02:02:25,000 --> 02:02:32,000
Hazel: "I felt like I was at the top of my game, but that's only 'cause my opponents were all tryin' so hard!"

1360
02:02:32,000 --> 02:02:37,000
Hazel: "They were giving it their all, so I felt obliged to step up the plate!"

1361
02:02:37,000 --> 02:02:45,000
Hazel: "I wanted to give them a good game, y'see! It'd be rude if I didn't meet their efforts with all I've got!"

1362
02:02:45,000 --> 02:02:51,000
*The interpreter relays Hazel's response back to the announcer in German, who laughs.*

1363
02:02:51,000 --> 02:02:54,000
Announcer: "<Well, you certainly did that!>"

1364
02:02:54,000 --> 02:03:00,000
*Hazel grins alongside the announcer, as the interpreter once more translates his reply.*

1365
02:03:00,000 --> 02:03:06,000
*Hazel, I can't help but think, as I watch her from the stands, is a very energetic woman.*

1366
02:03:06,000 --> 02:03:12,000
*She puts her all into every single one of her pursuits, and she has no shortage of passion.*

1367
02:03:12,000 --> 02:03:17,000
*It's obvious, just to observe her, that she really does love tennis.*

1368
02:03:17,000 --> 02:03:23,000
*I think she adores it, in fact - and it's because of this adoration that I admire her so much.*

1369
02:03:23,000 --> 02:03:30,000
*I think the announcer must be experiencing similar feelings to my own, as he continues to interview Hazel.*

1370
02:03:30,000 --> 02:03:40,000
*She's so amenable, even when she's dripping in sweat, it's hard not to get swept up in her pace; even when her responses are delayed by a language barrier.*

1371
02:03:40,000 --> 02:03:50,000
Announcer: "<Your matches out there were positively electrifying: especially that last one with Svitolina! I've never seen anything like it before!>"

1372
02:03:50,000 --> 02:03:55,000
Hazel: "Well, thank you very much! I always strive to do my best, hehe!"

1373
02:03:55,000 --> 02:04:03,000
Hazel: "I want each of my tournaments to be more excitin' than the last - and, of course, I want my fans to have fun!"

1374
02:04:03,000 --> 02:04:11,000
Hazel: "A lot of people came to Astoria to cheer me on, and I wanna show them that their efforts weren't in vain!"

1375
02:04:11,000 --> 02:04:16,000
Hazel: "I wanna answer to all of their expectations, and make them proud of me!"

1376
02:04:16,000 --> 02:04:22,000
Announcer: "<I'm sure they are! You've made all of Japan very proud with today's performance...>"

1377
02:04:22,000 --> 02:04:33,000
Announcer: "<But - and please, forgive me if this question is too personal - is there anybody in particular you were thinking of while you were playing today?>"

1378
02:04:33,000 --> 02:04:35,000
Hazel: "Anybody in particular, huh?"

1379
02:04:35,000 --> 02:04:46,000
*Hazel smiles coyly at this, then, roughly 0.2 seconds later, glances at the private box where I'm sitting, alongside Stephania, Elizabeth, Marina, and Hifumi.*

1380
02:04:46,000 --> 02:04:47,000
Hiroki: "Ulp..."

1381
02:04:47,000 --> 02:04:51,000
*All of a sudden, I can feel myself beginning to sweat.*

1382
02:04:51,000 --> 02:04:58,000
*I think I've a decent idea of what Hazel's about to say, long before the words escape her lips, but...*

1383
02:04:58,000 --> 02:05:05,000
Hazel: "I meant to keep it hush-hush, but y'know what? I guess I don't mind spilling the beans, hehe!"

1384
02:05:05,000 --> 02:05:08,000
Hazel: "I'm not ashamed of any of my relationships!"

1385
02:05:08,000 --> 02:05:17,000
Hazel: "The papers can print what they want, and I won't care! I'm proud, in fact, to be dating such a great guy, who cares for me so much!"

1386
02:05:17,000 --> 02:05:24,000
Hazel: "It's partially 'cause of him that I've been able to push myself so much lately, after all!"

1387
02:05:24,000 --> 02:05:30,000
Hazel: "He came to see me before today's performance, and that gave me a real boost!"

1388
02:05:30,000 --> 02:05:45,000
Hazel: "I knew he'd be watchin' me - he's still watchin', in fact - so I really, really wanted to give it my all; not that I wouldn't've if I didn't have a boyfriend, mind, but I feel like I can be my best self when we're together!"

1389
02:05:45,000 --> 02:05:47,000
Hazel: "He gives me strength!"

1390
02:05:47,000 --> 02:05:48,000
Announcer: "<Oh...?>"

1391
02:05:48,000 --> 02:05:53,000
*The announcer, obviously intrigued by Hazel's words, looks at her askance.*

1392
02:05:53,000 --> 02:06:00,000
Announcer: "<And who, might I ask, is this mysterious partner of yours, to whom you attribute your success?>"

1393
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:08,000
*Once more, the interpreter translates the question for Hazel, who ponders it for a few moments before replying.*

1394
02:06:08,000 --> 02:06:17,000
Hazel: "Well, I'll tell you! I'm sure he'll be a lil' bit bashful - he's kinda shy, hehe - but I'm sure he'll get over it quickly enough!"

1395
02:06:17,000 --> 02:06:18,000
Hazel: "Ahem..."

1396
02:06:18,000 --> 02:06:24,000
*Hazel clears her throat - and, when she does, a silence seems to pass through the stadium.*

1397
02:06:24,000 --> 02:06:35,000
*The spectators still sitting in their seats lean in, their eyes trained on Hazel, as though nothing could be more important than the secret she's about to share.*

1398
02:06:35,000 --> 02:06:38,000
*It's so quiet, you could hear a pin drop.*

1399
02:06:38,000 --> 02:06:48,000
*A few anxious, awkward moments pass - moments Hazel seems to savor, being a connoisseur of chaos - before, embracing her trophy tightly, Hazel says...*

1400
02:06:48,000 --> 02:06:54,000
Hazel: "I've been dating a real sweet guy called Ogasawara Hiroki for these last few months!"

1401
02:06:54,000 --> 02:06:59,000
Hazel: "We've spent a lot of time together, an' I'm really crazy about him!"

1402
02:06:59,000 --> 02:07:04,000
Hazel: "He's super cute, he's fun to tease, an' he always cheers me on!"

1403
02:07:04,000 --> 02:07:17,000
Hazel: "Sometimes, he tells me I'm a bit too much - I've hauled him out jogging with me during the early hours of the morning one too many times, I think! - but he's never, ever given up on me!"

1404
02:07:17,000 --> 02:07:21,000
Hazel: "He believes in me, which helps me believe in myself!"

1405
02:07:21,000 --> 02:07:25,000
Hazel: "That's why I love Hiroki so much! He really is the best!"

1406
02:07:25,000 --> 02:07:27,000
Announcer: "<Hiroki...?>"

1407
02:07:27,000 --> 02:07:34,000
*The announcer, who must be clued into more than just the latest news in the sporting world, frowns.*

1408
02:07:34,000 --> 02:07:39,000
Announcer: "<That name sounds familiar. It isn't particularly common.>"

1409
02:07:39,000 --> 02:07:45,000
Announcer: "<Is he a celebrity in his own rights? A sporting star himself, perhaps?>"

1410
02:07:45,000 --> 02:07:56,000
Hazel: "Oh, no! It's nothin' like that. Hiroki's not the best at sports - he always flags behind me when we go jogging - but he has a huge heart to make up for it!"

1411
02:07:56,000 --> 02:07:59,000
*Huh. Now, that's an interesting compliment.*

1412
02:07:59,000 --> 02:08:12,000
*I've heard Hazel tell me, during our more... steamy interactions, shall we say, that a certain part of my anatomy's huge, but I've not heard her lavish the same praise upon my cardiac muscle.*

1413
02:08:12,000 --> 02:08:14,000
*I guess I'm flattered?*

1414
02:08:14,000 --> 02:08:18,000
*I would be, at least, if this didn't feel so awkward...*

1415
02:08:18,000 --> 02:08:28,000
*I'd wanted to keep the truth about my myriad relationships hushed up, but it feels like the members of my succubus harem are revolting against me.*

1416
02:08:28,000 --> 02:08:38,000
*First, Hifumi announced her feelings for me live on TV, then Marina and Hazel clung to me at the airport in front of the paparazzi, and now...*

1417
02:08:38,000 --> 02:08:47,000
Hazel: "Hiroki's actually dating the super famous actress, Yamamoto Hifumi, and the very mature, incredibly scary CEO, Wakatsuki Marina..."

1418
02:08:47,000 --> 02:08:55,000
Hazel: "But, despite having all these wonderful women at his beck and call, he still makes a lot of time for me, too!"

1419
02:08:55,000 --> 02:08:57,000
Announcer: "<I beg your pardon...?>"

1420
02:08:57,000 --> 02:09:10,000
*The announcer looks floored by this unexpected announcement, as well he might. I wouldn't believe the words spilling from Hazel's mouth either, if she didn't look so very earnest about it all.*

1421
02:09:10,000 --> 02:09:19,000
*It's crazy enough that there's a man out there who could win the heart of Yamamoto Hifumi, but Wakatsuki Marina? Hazel Williams?*

1422
02:09:19,000 --> 02:09:22,000
*That really does sound like too much!*

1423
02:09:22,000 --> 02:09:26,000
*Isn't one incredibly famous, beautiful woman enough for this man?*

1424
02:09:26,000 --> 02:09:31,000
*If I wasn't Ogasawara Hiroki, I'd want to tear out his throat with my teeth!*

1425
02:09:31,000 --> 02:09:32,000
*I'm such a jerk!*

1426
02:09:32,000 --> 02:09:36,000
Announcer: "<Is this "Hiroki" really as popular as all that?>"

1427
02:09:36,000 --> 02:09:37,000
Hazel: "He really is!"

1428
02:09:37,000 --> 02:09:47,000
Hazel: "He's very, very popular, and it's well-deserved! He has this way of talkin' to people, y'see, that makes them feel so... I dunno. Loved, I guess?"

1429
02:09:47,000 --> 02:09:55,000
Hazel: "When we're together, I really do feel like I matter - and it doesn't hurt that he smells so good, either!"

1430
02:09:55,000 --> 02:09:59,000
Announcer: "<H-He does? That is, um, truly interesting...>"

1431
02:09:59,000 --> 02:10:09,000
*Ah, geez. Since Hazel's replies are being translated by the bemused-looking interpreter, the whole stadium's going to know about my supposed "scent" now.*

1432
02:10:09,000 --> 02:10:10,000
*This is just great.*

1433
02:10:10,000 --> 02:10:15,000
*If it were possible to die from embarrassment, I think I'd keel over.*

1434
02:10:15,000 --> 02:10:22,000
*There's only so much public praise I can take before it starts feeling like an exercise in public humiliation!*

1435
02:10:22,000 --> 02:10:28,000
*Is Hazel enjoying all of this? Does she know how awkward this is making me feel!?*

1436
02:10:28,000 --> 02:10:34,000
*Part of me thinks that she does know this, full well, and she simply doesn't care.*

1437
02:10:34,000 --> 02:10:39,000
*Hazel's not a sadist like Marina, but she's always enjoyed making me squirm.*

1438
02:10:39,000 --> 02:10:49,000
Hazel: "Hiroki smells really nice, yeah! He's better'n a scented candle, hehe~ When we're together, and I get a good sniff of him, I go weak at the knees!"

1439
02:10:49,000 --> 02:10:52,000
Hazel: "Maybe that's why I like him so much...?"

1440
02:10:52,000 --> 02:10:58,000
*Hazel seems to ponder this for a few moments, while the audience murmurs amongst themselves.*

1441
02:10:58,000 --> 02:11:07,000
*I can't hear what they're all saying, but I'd be prepared to bet good money the words "what", "the", and "fuck" will be seeing a lot of use.*

1442
02:11:07,000 --> 02:11:18,000
*I think this event is being publicly televised, too: not just in Astoria, but internationally. This tennis tournament's a big deal, and a lot of famous names are here.*

1443
02:11:18,000 --> 02:11:24,000
*Will people be listening to this all across Europe? America? Hell, what about Japan?*

1444
02:11:24,000 --> 02:11:26,000
*Will my dad see this?*

1445
02:11:26,000 --> 02:11:32,000
*I know he's a big fan of Hazel Williams. He's more into tennis, in fact, that I am.*

1446
02:11:32,000 --> 02:11:34,000
*Urgh. This is so awkward...*

1447
02:11:34,000 --> 02:11:44,000
*I stare at Hazel, willing her to stop talking, but alas! I'm no telepath, and there's nothing I can do to shut her up: not now she's on a roll.*

1448
02:11:44,000 --> 02:11:46,000
*She's out of control!*

1449
02:11:46,000 --> 02:11:53,000
Hazel: "I've never been super serious about any of my past relationships, but I am serious about Hiroki!"

1450
02:11:53,000 --> 02:11:59,000
Hazel: "I like him a whole bunch, and I hope we can stay together for a real long time!"

1451
02:11:59,000 --> 02:12:01,000
Hazel: "He's super cute, y'see..."

1452
02:12:01,000 --> 02:12:06,000
Hazel: "And, when we're together, I really do feel like I can do anything!!!"

1453
02:12:06,000 --> 02:12:07,000
*Later that night...*

1454
02:12:07,000 --> 02:12:12,000
Hazel: "Whoo! Today's tournament was, like, so much fun! I'm still buzzing!"

1455
02:12:12,000 --> 02:12:15,000
Hazel: "I'm so hyped, I just can't sit still!"

1456
02:12:15,000 --> 02:12:19,000
Marina: "I can see that, yes. You don't need to tell me as much."

1457
02:12:19,000 --> 02:12:30,000
Marina: "You were fiddling with your cutlery something fierce at the dinner table, like a small child - and now we've retreated to our rooms, you keep jiggling about."

1458
02:12:30,000 --> 02:12:33,000
Marina: "Watching you is tiring me out."

1459
02:12:33,000 --> 02:12:34,000
Hazel: "Heh!"

1460
02:12:34,000 --> 02:12:40,000
Hazel: "Are you sure you don't feel tired, Marina, 'cause you're gettin' on in years?"

1461
02:12:40,000 --> 02:12:45,000
Hazel: "Maybe I'm too young and spry and energetic for you to deal with, haha!"

1462
02:12:45,000 --> 02:12:47,000
Marina: "Wh-Why, you..."

1463
02:12:47,000 --> 02:12:53,000
*Marina's right eye twitches, as it so often does when the taboo topic of her age comes up.*

1464
02:12:53,000 --> 02:13:00,000
Marina: "I'm used to Ayu making thoughtless comments about me, but this is new low coming from you."

1465
02:13:00,000 --> 02:13:04,000
Marina: "Is this a roundabout way of asking to be punished, Hazel?"

1466
02:13:04,000 --> 02:13:05,000
Hazel: "O-Oh, no..."

1467
02:13:05,000 --> 02:13:13,000
*Hazel demurs at this, her fingers curled together at her front; a visible droplet of sweat forming on her brow.*

1468
02:13:13,000 --> 02:13:23,000
Hazel: "I-I'm good on the punishment front, really. You've already made your point, Marina, so you don't gotta discipline me; not now, nor ever!"

1469
02:13:23,000 --> 02:13:24,000
Marina: "Good."

1470
02:13:24,000 --> 02:13:27,000
*Marina cracks her knuckles ominously.*

1471
02:13:27,000 --> 02:13:31,000
Marina: "Let us hope, for both our sakes, it remains that way."

1472
02:13:31,000 --> 02:13:35,000
Marina: "I don't enjoy being cruel to you; I hope you know that."

1473
02:13:35,000 --> 02:13:38,000
Hazel: "Heh... You sure could've fooled me..."

1474
02:13:38,000 --> 02:13:45,000
Marina: "If I'm harsh on you, it's because you invite it, by failing to behave as an adult ought to."

1475
02:13:45,000 --> 02:13:48,000
Marina: "You need to learn some decorum."

1476
02:13:48,000 --> 02:13:52,000
*Marina sighs, while toying with a strand of her pale hair.*

1477
02:13:52,000 --> 02:14:00,000
Marina: "I had hoped staying in a palace might drum some respectability into you, but you seem every bit a wild as always."

1478
02:14:00,000 --> 02:14:05,000
Marina: "The princess's manners haven't rubbed off on you in the slightest!"

1479
02:14:05,000 --> 02:14:15,000
Hiroki: "That'll be because, rather than spending time with Steffy, Hazel's been too busy going on dates with this haughty receptionist instead..."

1480
02:14:15,000 --> 02:14:21,000
*I murmur this under my breath so quietly nobody seems to notice; nobody except Hifumi, that is.*

1481
02:14:21,000 --> 02:14:27,000
*Her interest piqued, Hifumi examines me, while resting a finger against her lower lip.*

1482
02:14:27,000 --> 02:14:29,000
Hifumi: "What receptionist?"

1483
02:14:29,000 --> 02:14:31,000
Hiroki: "...Never mind."

1484
02:14:31,000 --> 02:14:40,000
*I'm guessing Hazel's been keeping her affair with Lily a secret, most likely because Marina would chastise her about it if she knew.*

1485
02:14:40,000 --> 02:14:49,000
*As a succubus, Hazel is supposed to keep her true identity hidden - but, as an incorrigible blabbermouth, she isn't the best at this.*

1486
02:14:49,000 --> 02:15:01,000
*Marina's probably worried (and rightly so, I think) that the more pretty girls Hazel seduces, the higher the chances are that she'll out the true nature of her existence to them.*

1487
02:15:01,000 --> 02:15:06,000
*I don't think this has happened just yet, but it never hurts to be careful.*

1488
02:15:06,000 --> 02:15:13,000
*It's a shame "careful" isn't a word that seems to exist in Hazel's vocabulary. She's always been so brazen.*

1489
02:15:13,000 --> 02:15:26,000
*Hazel's brazen when she plays tennis sans underwear, and her succubus attire is the skimpiest of all the succubi I know - which, given how much skin they expose, is quite the accomplishment.*

1490
02:15:26,000 --> 02:15:32,000
*Hazel is wearing her succubus attire right now, in fact - as are Marina and Hifumi.*

1491
02:15:32,000 --> 02:15:43,000
*It's been a few hours since Hazel stepped off the tennis courts, and she's taken on her succubus form to relax, but Hazel looks full of energy all the same.*

1492
02:15:43,000 --> 02:15:49,000
*The adrenaline hit which came from her unquestioned victory mustn't have faded away just yet.*

1493
02:15:49,000 --> 02:15:50,000
Hazel: "Aaah..."

1494
02:15:50,000 --> 02:15:54,000
*Hazel sighs and stretches; her toned arms raised above her head.*

1495
02:15:54,000 --> 02:15:58,000
Hazel: "Today really was a blast, though! I had such a great time!"

1496
02:15:58,000 --> 02:16:06,000
Hazel: "I feel like we've gotta celebrate my victory just a little! I don't wanna spend the night cooped up indoors!"

1497
02:16:06,000 --> 02:16:07,000
Hifumi: "Celebrate?"

1498
02:16:07,000 --> 02:16:08,000
*Hifumi blinks.*

1499
02:16:08,000 --> 02:16:11,000
Hifumi: "And how do you plan to do that, exactly?"

1500
02:16:11,000 --> 02:16:15,000
Marina: "If you want to drink, I would have to veto that idea."

1501
02:16:15,000 --> 02:16:17,000
Hazel: "Huh?! But why?!"

1502
02:16:17,000 --> 02:16:22,000
Hazel: "Why can't I drink if I wanna? You and Hifumin do it all the time!"

1503
02:16:22,000 --> 02:16:30,000
Marina: "I know we do, but Hifumi and I are, unlike you, mature adults. We know our own tolerances, and when to call it quits."

1504
02:16:30,000 --> 02:16:32,000
Marina: "You, on the other hand..."

1505
02:16:32,000 --> 02:16:35,000
*Marina looks Hazel up and down, her lip curling.*

1506
02:16:35,000 --> 02:16:37,000
Marina: "Are a menace."

1507
02:16:37,000 --> 02:16:38,000
Hazel: "A menace...?!"

1508
02:16:38,000 --> 02:16:39,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed."

1509
02:16:39,000 --> 02:16:44,000
Marina: "You're difficult enough to deal with sober, let alone drunk."

1510
02:16:44,000 --> 02:16:54,000
Marina: "If you drink too much, you would probably begin to assault Stephania's maids, and then we would be cast out of the palace in disgrace."

1511
02:16:54,000 --> 02:17:01,000
Marina: "I do not want to spend my night prizing you away from a bunch of frilly-skirted innocents."

1512
02:17:01,000 --> 02:17:02,000
Hazel: "Boo!"

1513
02:17:02,000 --> 02:17:06,000
*Hazel pouts, her fingers curling into fists upon the sheets.*

1514
02:17:06,000 --> 02:17:10,000
Hazel: "Does that really sound like something I would do?!"

1515
02:17:10,000 --> 02:17:13,000
Marina: "Yes, it does. You know it does."

1516
02:17:13,000 --> 02:17:21,000
Marina: "You already have trouble keeping your hands to yourself. Your inhibitions don't need to be lowered further still!"

1517
02:17:21,000 --> 02:17:24,000
Hifumi: "I'm afraid I must agree with Marina here."

1518
02:17:24,000 --> 02:17:31,000
Hifumi: "While I do not condemn you for your excess energy, Hazel, I don't want you getting into trouble."

1519
02:17:31,000 --> 02:17:36,000
Hifumi: "It would be a poor way to cap off your success today, don't you think?"

1520
02:17:36,000 --> 02:17:41,000
Hazel: "Urgh. You two're, like, so boring. You don't let me have any fun!"

1521
02:17:41,000 --> 02:17:49,000
Marina: "On the contrary, I let you have just a much fun as is permissible. I stop short, however, on condoning assault."

1522
02:17:49,000 --> 02:17:50,000
Hazel: "Hmph..."

1523
02:17:50,000 --> 02:17:52,000
*Hazel's pout deepens.*

1524
02:17:52,000 --> 02:17:56,000
Hazel: "I guess you're tryin' to look out for me, in your own way-"

1525
02:17:56,000 --> 02:18:02,000
Marina: "Indeed, I am. You may say whatever you wish about me, but I do, at least, care."

1526
02:18:02,000 --> 02:18:09,000
Hazel: "-but I'm starting to think I'd have more fun hanging out with Ayu and Cosmos. They're not so stuffy!"

1527
02:18:09,000 --> 02:18:13,000
Marina: "That's because Ayu and Cosmos are still children."

1528
02:18:13,000 --> 02:18:18,000
Hifumi: "Ayu, in particular, can be awfully immature, though she is very sweet."

1529
02:18:18,000 --> 02:18:26,000
Hifumi: "I've been wondering, actually, how she's been getting along in our absence. I hope she isn't missing us too much!"

1530
02:18:26,000 --> 02:18:39,000
*Hifumi might be none the wiser as to Cosmos and Ayu's feelings, but I'm pretty clued in on them. Cosmos told me herself, in that dream she sent me, that Ayu had been missing me, and badly.*

1531
02:18:39,000 --> 02:18:44,000
*Ayu tried to refute this, but her flushed face made the truth readily apparent.*

1532
02:18:44,000 --> 02:18:48,000
*Ayu's a lot more sensitive than she likes to let on.*

1533
02:18:48,000 --> 02:18:53,000
*I think she might be the most delicate member of my whole harem, in fact.*

1534
02:18:53,000 --> 02:18:56,000
Hazel: "Well, since drinking's out..."

1535
02:18:56,000 --> 02:19:06,000
*Hazel rises from the bed, stretching, and transforms; her succubus attire melting away, to be replaced with her black pants and her puffy coat.*

1536
02:19:06,000 --> 02:19:12,000
Hazel: "Maybe we could go for a walk; just you an' me. Whaddaya think about that, Hiroki?"

1537
02:19:12,000 --> 02:19:15,000
Hiroki: "You want to spend some time together?"

1538
02:19:15,000 --> 02:19:22,000
Hazel: "Well, why not? You are my beloved, y'know - as I believe I made quite plain back at the stadium, hehe!"

1539
02:19:22,000 --> 02:19:25,000
Hiroki: "You did make it quite plain, yes..."

1540
02:19:25,000 --> 02:19:33,000
*I sigh as I recall the passion of Hazel's earlier address; my shoulders slumping beneath the pressure of it all.*

1541
02:19:33,000 --> 02:19:38,000
Hiroki: "I wonder what Lily made of all that. She must've been pissed."

1542
02:19:38,000 --> 02:19:44,000
Hazel: "Oh, I'm sure she'll get over it! I told her I didn't want anything exclusive!"

1543
02:19:44,000 --> 02:19:45,000
Hazel: "Now..."

1544
02:19:45,000 --> 02:19:49,000
*Hazel bounds over to me, then twines her arm through my own.*

1545
02:19:49,000 --> 02:20:00,000
Hazel: "D'you wanna come with me? It's pretty chilly out there, but I can always warm you up - and the moon does look very pretty! It's way too nice to just sit indoors!"

1546
02:20:00,000 --> 02:20:03,000
Hazel: "I wanna live my life, darn it!"

1547
02:20:03,000 --> 02:20:08,000
Hiroki: "You have so much energy, I think you live enough for five people."

1548
02:20:08,000 --> 02:20:13,000
*I shoot Hazel a sideways glance, an amused smile playing about my lips.*

1549
02:20:13,000 --> 02:20:19,000
Hiroki: "But sure. I suppose going for a walk is better than harassing Steffy's maids."

1550
02:20:19,000 --> 02:20:20,000
Hazel: "Hey!"

1551
02:20:20,000 --> 02:20:23,000
*Hazel nudges me in the side with her elbow.*

1552
02:20:23,000 --> 02:20:26,000
Hazel: "Why'd you think I'd harass Steffy's maids?!"

1553
02:20:26,000 --> 02:20:33,000
Hiroki: "Oh, I don't know. It seems like the kind of scurrilous pursuit you might get involved in."

1554
02:20:33,000 --> 02:20:37,000
Marina: "I concur. You have no sense of propriety, Hazel."

1555
02:20:37,000 --> 02:20:44,000
Hifumi: "If any member of our retinue was to harass dear Stephania's maids, it would, most likely, be you..."

1556
02:20:44,000 --> 02:20:50,000
Hifumi: "Not, of course, that I think you would stoop so low; not with Hiroki around, at least!"

1557
02:20:50,000 --> 02:20:53,000
Hifumi: "He should be able to hold you back!"

1558
02:20:53,000 --> 02:20:54,000
Hazel: "Geez..."

1559
02:20:54,000 --> 02:20:59,000
Hazel: "You guys are all so mean to me! It's like you don't trust me at all!"

1560
02:20:59,000 --> 02:21:02,000
Hazel: "Who's side are you even on, Hiroki?!"

1561
02:21:02,000 --> 02:21:05,000
Hiroki: "I don't know. The side of justice, maybe?"

1562
02:21:05,000 --> 02:21:07,000
Hazel: "Are you saying I'm unjust?!"

1563
02:21:07,000 --> 02:21:12,000
Hiroki: "You would be, if you started making moves on Steffy's maids..."

1564
02:21:12,000 --> 02:21:15,000
Hazel: "I am not gonna make any moves on any maids!"

1565
02:21:15,000 --> 02:21:16,000
*Hazel scowls.*

1566
02:21:16,000 --> 02:21:25,000
Hazel: "That's grossly hypocritical, anyways, given everything you've been up to with Elizabeth! You're the real philanderer here, not me!"

1567
02:21:25,000 --> 02:21:28,000
*Urk. I guess Hazel's not wrong on that score.*

1568
02:21:28,000 --> 02:21:36,000
*I have gotten pretty up close and personal with Elizabeth - not that Hazel knows about all of the finer details.*

1569
02:21:36,000 --> 02:21:38,000
*Maybe I really am a hypocrite.*

1570
02:21:38,000 --> 02:21:39,000
*...Geez.*

1571
02:21:39,000 --> 02:21:44,000
*Not for the first time, I find myself pondering how hard being popular is.*

1572
02:21:44,000 --> 02:21:50,000
*My company is in near-constant demand - not, I suppose, that it's inherently a bad thing.*

1573
02:21:50,000 --> 02:21:56,000
*It can be pretty exhausting, but there's something soothing, too, about being so adored.*

1574
02:21:56,000 --> 02:22:01,000
*At least I never have cause to feel lonely. I don't have the time for it.*

1575
02:22:01,000 --> 02:22:03,000
*I really have become quite beloved.*

1576
02:22:03,000 --> 02:22:08,000
Hazel: "Aah! The night air is so cool and refreshing! Don't'cha think so, Hiroki?"

1577
02:22:08,000 --> 02:22:13,000
Hiroki: "I'm not sure if "refreshing" is quite the right word for it..."

1578
02:22:13,000 --> 02:22:18,000
*I glance about the palace's gardens, my teeth chattering all the while.*

1579
02:22:18,000 --> 02:22:24,000
*It was at Hazel's continued insistences that I came outdoors, but I'm starting to regret it.*

1580
02:22:24,000 --> 02:22:31,000
*It's pretty late at night, and the sky overhead is dark as pitch; spattered here and there with stars.*

1581
02:22:31,000 --> 02:22:36,000
*The moon, meanwhile, is large and full, just like a saucer full of milk.*

1582
02:22:36,000 --> 02:22:50,000
*The way the ghostly moonlight plays upon the treetops, all shifting in the breeze, is quite pretty, I suppose - but not even the prettiness of the night sky is enough to distract me from how cold it is.*

1583
02:22:50,000 --> 02:22:59,000
*I don't know what the precise temperature is, but it's cold enough that I can feel gooseflesh beginning to ripple along my arms.*

1584
02:22:59,000 --> 02:23:05,000
*There's a bit of a breeze, too, which tugs at the hem of my shirt and tousles my hair.*

1585
02:23:05,000 --> 02:23:11,000
*I'm afraid, if we don't cut our night-time meandering short, I'll wind up catching a cold.*

1586
02:23:11,000 --> 02:23:18,000
*I am but a feeble human, weak in flesh and in spirit, and I can only endure so much of this Arctic weather!*

1587
02:23:18,000 --> 02:23:25,000
*Hazel, for her part, seems completely heedless of the cold, though she's wearing far fewer layers than I am.*

1588
02:23:25,000 --> 02:23:34,000
*Hazel might be clad in a pair of pants, but they ride low about her hips, and they reveal an awful lot of her smooth, toned stomach.*

1589
02:23:34,000 --> 02:23:38,000
*How can she bear to wander around with so much skin on display?*

1590
02:23:38,000 --> 02:23:39,000
*I'm baffled.*

1591
02:23:39,000 --> 02:23:48,000
*...Then again, I'm similarly baffled by her staunch, stalwart refusal to wear underwear, even while playing professional tennis matches.*

1592
02:23:48,000 --> 02:23:52,000
*As a succubus, she might be somewhat beyond my comprehension.*

1593
02:23:52,000 --> 02:23:54,000
Hazel: "Hey, Hiroki..."

1594
02:23:54,000 --> 02:24:00,000
*Smiling deviously, Hazel sidles up to me, then winds one of her arms through mine.*

1595
02:24:00,000 --> 02:24:04,000
Hazel: "The moon looks super pretty tonight, don't'cha think?"

1596
02:24:04,000 --> 02:24:05,000
Hiroki: "Oh...?"

1597
02:24:05,000 --> 02:24:10,000
*I look up at the night sky, and the moon which hangs in it; large and celestial.*

1598
02:24:10,000 --> 02:24:17,000
*I was so caught up with how bitingly cold the weather is, I wasn't paying the moon too much heed.*

1599
02:24:17,000 --> 02:24:26,000
*Now that Hazel mentions it, though, the moon does look rather pretty. It's the sort of moon you'd expect a poet to devote an epic to...*

1600
02:24:26,000 --> 02:24:27,000
*Or something.*

1601
02:24:27,000 --> 02:24:31,000
*I'm no poet, so I wouldn't know - and neither is Hazel.*

1602
02:24:31,000 --> 02:24:34,000
*Poetry seems more like Hifumi's domain.*

1603
02:24:34,000 --> 02:24:41,000
Hiroki: "It's pretty, yeah, but I didn't expect you, of all people, to come out with a line like that."

1604
02:24:41,000 --> 02:24:42,000
Hazel: "No?"

1605
02:24:42,000 --> 02:24:49,000
Hiroki: "No way. I didn't think you were the sort to get all sappy about the beauties of the natural world?"

1606
02:24:49,000 --> 02:24:50,000
Hazel: "Oh, yeah?"

1607
02:24:50,000 --> 02:24:53,000
*Pouting, Hazel nudges me in side with her elbow.*

1608
02:24:53,000 --> 02:25:01,000
Hazel: "What sort of philistine d'you take me for, anyway? I can too appreciate the moonlight, when I'm in the right mood!"

1609
02:25:01,000 --> 02:25:05,000
Hiroki: "And you're in the mood for it tonight, I guess?"

1610
02:25:05,000 --> 02:25:07,000
Hazel: "I'm in the best of moods!"

1611
02:25:07,000 --> 02:25:13,000
Hazel: "Playing in that tournament earlier was, like, so much fun! I had a real blast!"

1612
02:25:13,000 --> 02:25:22,000
Hazel: "Svitolina was a pretty fierce opponent! She didn't make things easy for me out there! I really had my work cut out for me!"

1613
02:25:22,000 --> 02:25:24,000
Hiroki: "Did you, now?"

1614
02:25:24,000 --> 02:25:25,000
*My brow furrows.*

1615
02:25:25,000 --> 02:25:33,000
Hiroki: "From what I saw, you looked like you had the tournament in the bag. You seemed totally cool and in control."

1616
02:25:33,000 --> 02:25:40,000
Hazel: "Maybe I seemed that way, but it was pretty intense. She had me runnin' all around the court!"

1617
02:25:40,000 --> 02:25:42,000
Hazel: "She was no pushover!"

1618
02:25:42,000 --> 02:25:49,000
Hiroki: "Maybe not, but you gave as good as you got, and then some. Your victory was rather decisive."

1619
02:25:49,000 --> 02:25:58,000
Hazel: "Well, of course! I don't push myself day after day to just roll over and lose! When I play, I play to win, in all aspects of life..."

1620
02:25:58,000 --> 02:26:04,000
Hazel: "Though I always have the most fun when I'm faced with a real challenge, hehe."

1621
02:26:04,000 --> 02:26:13,000
Hazel: "It's no fun, y'know, fightin' against opponents who can't make me sweat just a little. It makes me feel kinda guilty, in fact."

1622
02:26:13,000 --> 02:26:16,000
Hazel: "I like my foes to have a bit of gumption!"

1623
02:26:16,000 --> 02:26:19,000
Hiroki: "So victory feels even sweeter, you mean?"

1624
02:26:19,000 --> 02:26:26,000
Hazel: "Exactly! I like a bit of challenge! The struggle's part of the appeal when it comes to sports!"

1625
02:26:26,000 --> 02:26:28,000
Hiroki: "You find struggling "fun"?"

1626
02:26:28,000 --> 02:26:32,000
Hiroki: "Now you're starting to sound like a masochist!"

1627
02:26:32,000 --> 02:26:41,000
Hazel: "Hehe, well, y'know what they say: no pain, no gain. If you aren't prepared to push yourself, you won't be able to reap any rewards."

1628
02:26:41,000 --> 02:26:48,000
Hazel: "Life'd be boring if everything was just handed to us. The work's more important than the results..."

1629
02:26:48,000 --> 02:26:54,000
Hazel: "Though, of course, I'm very happy that I won – and that you were around to watch me."

1630
02:26:54,000 --> 02:26:59,000
Hazel: "Thank you, Hiroki, for always rootin' for me. I really do appreciate it."

1631
02:26:59,000 --> 02:27:03,000
Hazel: "You're a great wingman, and an even better partner."

1632
02:27:03,000 --> 02:27:04,000
Hiroki: "No problem."

1633
02:27:04,000 --> 02:27:07,000
*I smile, touched by Hazel's sincerity.*

1634
02:27:07,000 --> 02:27:18,000
Hiroki: "We are partners, like you said, so I want to be there for you. It seemed only fitting that I'd stop by to offer you some moral support before your tournament."

1635
02:27:18,000 --> 02:27:24,000
Hiroki: "I know how seriously you take tennis, even though you might act to the contrary."

1636
02:27:24,000 --> 02:27:27,000
Hiroki: "It's important to you, isn't it?"

1637
02:27:27,000 --> 02:27:32,000
Hazel: "But of course! Tennis is my passion! I love it a whole bunch!"

1638
02:27:32,000 --> 02:27:35,000
Hazel: "If I didn't, I wouldn't work at it so hard!"

1639
02:27:35,000 --> 02:27:43,000
Hazel: "I love the thrill I get from runnin' around the court - 'specially when I'm not wearing anything under my skirt!"

1640
02:27:43,000 --> 02:27:45,000
Hazel: "It's really liberating!"

1641
02:27:45,000 --> 02:27:53,000
*Of course. I should've known, Hazel being the way she is, she would steer this heartfelt conversation into lewd territory.*

1642
02:27:53,000 --> 02:27:59,000
*In that sense, Hazel's rather predictable - though she's predictable in an amusing way.*

1643
02:27:59,000 --> 02:28:02,000
Hiroki: "I guess I'll take your word for it."

1644
02:28:02,000 --> 02:28:06,000
Hazel: "Huh? Don't you ever wanna give it a go yourself, Hiroki?"

1645
02:28:06,000 --> 02:28:08,000
Hiroki: "Going commando?"

1646
02:28:08,000 --> 02:28:20,000
Hazel: "Yeah! There's, like, no better feeling in the world than dashing through the tennis courts, racquet in hand, anticipatin' a serve, while the breeze blows against your thighs!"

1647
02:28:20,000 --> 02:28:24,000
Hazel: "It's my favorite sensation in the whole wide world!"

1648
02:28:24,000 --> 02:28:30,000
Hazel: "It seems a real shame you've never had a chance to experience it for yourself!"

1649
02:28:30,000 --> 02:28:42,000
Hiroki: "I think I'll pass on that, if it's all the same to you. I don't need to strip off my underwear to have a good time - and nobody would want to see me in a tennis skirt."

1650
02:28:42,000 --> 02:28:44,000
Hiroki: "I don't think it'd suit me."

1651
02:28:44,000 --> 02:28:48,000
Hazel: "I beg to differ! I think you'd look good in anything!"

1652
02:28:48,000 --> 02:28:51,000
Hiroki: "Are you sure you're not just saying that?"

1653
02:28:51,000 --> 02:28:52,000
*I frown.*

1654
02:28:52,000 --> 02:28:58,000
Hiroki: "Maybe the adrenaline from the tournament's gone to your head. It's addled you."

1655
02:28:58,000 --> 02:29:02,000
Hiroki: "There's no way I would ever look good in a skirt."

1656
02:29:02,000 --> 02:29:11,000
*And, even if, on the very unlikely off-chance a pleated tennis skirt did suit me, I don't know if I'd feel wholly comfortable wearing one.*

1657
02:29:11,000 --> 02:29:18,000
*I'm pretty tall, and I have an awful lot of leg. I wouldn't want to put my thighs on display like that.*

1658
02:29:18,000 --> 02:29:23,000
*'Sides, if my mother ever got wind of these proclivities of mine, she'd...*

1659
02:29:23,000 --> 02:29:24,000
*Well.*

1660
02:29:24,000 --> 02:29:33,000
*I was going to say "disinherit me", but after learning how A-OK she was at the prospect of me being gay, maybe I'm jumping the gun.*

1661
02:29:33,000 --> 02:29:38,000
*For all I know, my mother might be totally fine with me wearing skirts.*

1662
02:29:38,000 --> 02:29:41,000
*She's more open-minded than I'd thought.*

1663
02:29:41,000 --> 02:29:45,000
Hazel: "Well, we'll just have to see about that, hehe~"

1664
02:29:45,000 --> 02:29:50,000
Hiroki: "Don't tell me you want to put me in a skirt one of these days..."

1665
02:29:50,000 --> 02:29:53,000
Hazel: "It'd be an interestin' experiment, I guess-"

1666
02:29:53,000 --> 02:29:56,000
*Yeah, I figured she'd say something like that.*

1667
02:29:56,000 --> 02:29:57,000
*Sigh.*

1668
02:29:57,000 --> 02:30:09,000
*As much as I like the attention, I can't say I want to be thought of a dress-up doll (or, indeed, a dress-up darling). I'd rather be Hazel's wingman - or, heck, even Ayu's cameraman.*

1669
02:30:09,000 --> 02:30:12,000
Hazel: "-but maybe we can leave it for now, hehe~"

1670
02:30:12,000 --> 02:30:15,000
Hiroki: "That sounds like a good idea, yeah..."

1671
02:30:15,000 --> 02:30:24,000
*The world isn't ready for the sight of my bare thighs just yet. Sorry, universe, for robbing you of something so scintillating.*

1672
02:30:24,000 --> 02:30:26,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Hazel..."

1673
02:30:26,000 --> 02:30:29,000
*I shiver as another gust of wind hits me.*

1674
02:30:29,000 --> 02:30:35,000
Hiroki: "Maybe we should go back indoors soon? I think it's getting even chillier."

1675
02:30:35,000 --> 02:30:40,000
Hazel: "Just a sec! I've not had my fill of the great outdoors just yet!"

1676
02:30:40,000 --> 02:30:41,000
Hiroki: "No?"

1677
02:30:41,000 --> 02:30:48,000
*I frown, then fish my phone out of my pocket. A quick glance tells me it's 23:48: almost midnight.*

1678
02:30:48,000 --> 02:30:58,000
*If this was Cinderella, I'd be desperately shooing Hazel away from the palace, before the magic can wear off and her clothes can turn back into rags...*

1679
02:30:58,000 --> 02:31:02,000
*Not that Hazel's wearing a dress, or a pair of crystal slippers.*

1680
02:31:02,000 --> 02:31:05,000
*I don't think they'd really suit her.*

1681
02:31:05,000 --> 02:31:09,000
*Hazel's pretty, but she's not a girly-girl: not like Stephania.*

1682
02:31:09,000 --> 02:31:13,000
Hiroki: "It's getting late, though. Aren't you tired?"

1683
02:31:13,000 --> 02:31:19,000
Hazel: "As if I can sleep, after everything that happened today! I'm, like, way too keyed up!"

1684
02:31:19,000 --> 02:31:26,000
Hazel: "I need to work out some of this nervous energy a'fore I go back inside, else I'll explode!"

1685
02:31:26,000 --> 02:31:28,000
Hiroki: "Explode, huh...?"

1686
02:31:28,000 --> 02:31:29,000
*I frown.*

1687
02:31:29,000 --> 02:31:31,000
Hiroki: "That sounds serious..."

1688
02:31:31,000 --> 02:31:39,000
Hazel: "It is serious! That's why you've gotta stay with me, Hiroki, all through the night, so I don't go crazy!"

1689
02:31:39,000 --> 02:31:41,000
Hazel: "I need somebody to talk to!"

1690
02:31:41,000 --> 02:31:44,000
Hazel: "I just wanna cut loose and have some fun!"

1691
02:31:44,000 --> 02:31:48,000
Hazel: "I'm a free spirit, and I can't be constrained!"

1692
02:31:48,000 --> 02:31:52,000
Hiroki: "I think you might be a bit too free, if you ask me..."

1693
02:31:52,000 --> 02:32:03,000
*I murmur under my breath, more for my benefit than Hazel's (I still think she could stand to give underwear a fair shot every once in a while), as Hazel darts off.*

1694
02:32:03,000 --> 02:32:13,000
*She flits through the garden, examining some of the night-blossoming plants that fill the flowerbeds, before coming to a pause by the water fountain.*

1695
02:32:13,000 --> 02:32:15,000
Hazel: "Ooh! This is so pretty!"

1696
02:32:15,000 --> 02:32:22,000
*Hazel eyes the fountain approvingly - then, after a pause, steps upon the stone wall which fringes it.*

1697
02:32:22,000 --> 02:32:28,000
*She stands before the streaming water, her hands on her hips, and laughs triumphally.*

1698
02:32:28,000 --> 02:32:32,000
Hazel: "I'm so high up now! I feel like the queen of the world!"

1699
02:32:32,000 --> 02:32:36,000
Hazel: "Right now, I think I could do almost anything!"

1700
02:32:36,000 --> 02:32:42,000
Hiroki: "I'm sure you could - if, by "almost anything", you mean "catch a cold"..."

1701
02:32:42,000 --> 02:32:46,000
*I shiver, as yet another unforgiving gust of wind buffets me.*

1702
02:32:46,000 --> 02:32:58,000
*I can't bring myself to approach the perimeter of the fountain like Hazel has. The sound of the water drumming against the stone basin is enough to make my blood turn cold.*

1703
02:32:58,000 --> 02:33:02,000
*If the air is this frigid, the water must be colder still.*

1704
02:33:02,000 --> 02:33:07,000
Hiroki: "I think you should step away from the fountain. What if you fall in?"

1705
02:33:07,000 --> 02:33:11,000
Hazel: "Oh, I'll be fine! Don't fuss so much, Hiroki!"

1706
02:33:11,000 --> 02:33:20,000
Hiroki: "How can I help but fuss? You're acting like an excitable toddler. I feel like I need to keep an eye on you, for your own sake!"

1707
02:33:20,000 --> 02:33:26,000
Hazel: "Well, geez. I dunno if I should find your concern touching, or mildly annoying..."

1708
02:33:26,000 --> 02:33:27,000
*Hazel beams.*

1709
02:33:27,000 --> 02:33:31,000
Hazel: "But, like I said, it'll be fine. I know what I'm doing!"

1710
02:33:31,000 --> 02:33:35,000
Hazel: "You saw me playing against Svitolina, right?"

1711
02:33:35,000 --> 02:33:37,000
Hiroki: "Right, and...?"

1712
02:33:37,000 --> 02:33:44,000
Hazel: "You should know that my reflexes are second-to-none! I'm lithe and athletic, and super limber, too!"

1713
02:33:44,000 --> 02:33:48,000
Hazel: "I'm not so clumsy I'd lose my footing! Hahaha-"

1714
02:33:48,000 --> 02:33:49,000
Hazel: "Aaah?!"

1715
02:33:49,000 --> 02:33:53,000
*But, of course, contrary to Hazel's reassurances...*

1716
02:33:53,000 --> 02:33:54,000
Hiroki: "Hazel...!"

1717
02:33:54,000 --> 02:34:00,000
*Her laughter is far too raucous - and, in the end, she does just what she said she wouldn't.*

1718
02:34:00,000 --> 02:34:09,000
*Her sneaker-clad foot slips on the stone rim of the fountain, and she falls. Her body arcs backwards, backlit by the moonlight, and then...*

1719
02:34:09,000 --> 02:34:10,000
*SPLASH!*

1720
02:34:10,000 --> 02:34:18,000
*With an almighty burst of noise that tears through the stillness of the night, Hazel tumbles into the fountain.*

1721
02:34:18,000 --> 02:34:25,000
*Droplets of crystalline water scatter in the wake of Hazel's tumble, all shimmering prismatic rainbow colors.*

1722
02:34:25,000 --> 02:34:28,000
*I start forwards, alarmed, my eyes wide.*

1723
02:34:28,000 --> 02:34:40,000
*What if Hazel's cracked her head against the basin of the fountain? She could be in real pain, for all I know. That looked like a nasty fall - and it sounded like one, too.*

1724
02:34:40,000 --> 02:34:42,000
Hiroki: "Hazel! Hey, Hazel...?!"

1725
02:34:42,000 --> 02:34:46,000
*I call Hazel's name, my voice constrained with concern, but...*

1726
02:34:46,000 --> 02:34:48,000
Hazel: "Pfft... Urgh, blah..."

1727
02:34:48,000 --> 02:34:49,000
Hazel: "Koff, koff..."

1728
02:34:49,000 --> 02:34:55,000
*I can see Hazel sitting upright in the basin of the fountain, one hand pressed to her head.*

1729
02:34:55,000 --> 02:35:04,000
*Locks of her hair stick wetly to her cheeks, and even more droplets sluice down her cheeks; the taut planes of her exposed stomach.*

1730
02:35:04,000 --> 02:35:11,000
*Hazel spits out mouthfuls of water into the fountain, then, a dazed expression on her face, observes me.*

1731
02:35:11,000 --> 02:35:13,000
*She smiles coyly, and says...*

1732
02:35:13,000 --> 02:35:21,000
Hazel: "I wouldn't recommend the water in here, Hiroki. It tastes gross - kinda like something's been swimming around in it."

1733
02:35:21,000 --> 02:35:28,000
Hazel: "I dunno if it's the best for human consumption - or succubus consumption, for that matter."

1734
02:35:28,000 --> 02:35:30,000
Hazel: "S'kinda nasty, hehe."

1735
02:35:30,000 --> 02:35:36,000
Hiroki: "Well, I figured as much. The water in these fountains isn't supposed to be drunk..."

1736
02:35:36,000 --> 02:35:41,000
Hazel: "I can see that now! That's my lesson learned, I s'ppose, hehe!"

1737
02:35:41,000 --> 02:35:44,000
Hiroki: "And it's not for swimming in, either."

1738
02:35:44,000 --> 02:35:47,000
*I survey Hazel impassively, my arms folded.*

1739
02:35:47,000 --> 02:35:58,000
*Now I've gathered Hazel's alright, despite her tumble - her head doesn't appear to be split open, and she's smiling - I feel a little more inclined to scold her.*

1740
02:35:58,000 --> 02:36:07,000
Hiroki: "Why didn't you listen to me? I knew something like this was going to happen the moment you got so close to the fountain!"

1741
02:36:07,000 --> 02:36:09,000
Hazel: "Why, indeed? Hehe..."

1742
02:36:09,000 --> 02:36:11,000
Hazel: "I guess I'm kinda a dummy?"

1743
02:36:11,000 --> 02:36:13,000
Hiroki: "Geez, d'you think?"

1744
02:36:13,000 --> 02:36:19,000
Hazel: "OK, OK, Mr. Grumpy! I guess I really must be a dummy, to lose my footing like that!"

1745
02:36:19,000 --> 02:36:24,000
Hazel: "It's a little too late for regrets now, though! Please, go easy on me!"

1746
02:36:24,000 --> 02:36:27,000
Hiroki: "I'm not about to get on your case..."

1747
02:36:27,000 --> 02:36:31,000
*I'll save that for later, when Hazel isn't quite so waterlogged.*

1748
02:36:31,000 --> 02:36:35,000
Hiroki: "But you could try being more careful in the future."

1749
02:36:35,000 --> 02:36:43,000
*I think I'm being plenty reasonable, but Hazel doesn't seem to agree. She pouts, one hand still pressed against her head.*

1750
02:36:43,000 --> 02:36:46,000
Hazel: "Careful"? But that's so boooring!"

1751
02:36:46,000 --> 02:36:49,000
Hazel: "I'd rather live my life to its fullest!"

1752
02:36:49,000 --> 02:36:56,000
Hiroki: "And does "living life to its fullest" entail falling in a fountain, and getting soaked to the bone?"

1753
02:36:56,000 --> 02:37:04,000
Hazel: "Well, maybe. It's a new experience, at least! I can't say I've ever taken a dip in a palace's fountain before, hehe!"

1754
02:37:04,000 --> 02:37:11,000
Hiroki: "I don't think most people would want to say they've done that. It's not a bragging right."

1755
02:37:11,000 --> 02:37:15,000
Hazel: "Oh, I dunno. I like new experiences. They keep me young!"

1756
02:37:15,000 --> 02:37:21,000
Hiroki: "So you say - but it really is cold tonight. Aren't you worried about catching a cold?"

1757
02:37:21,000 --> 02:37:22,000
Hazel: "A cold? Me?"

1758
02:37:22,000 --> 02:37:23,000
*Hazel grins.*

1759
02:37:23,000 --> 02:37:28,000
Hazel: "I'll be just fine! Don't you worry! Idiots don't catch colds!"

1760
02:37:28,000 --> 02:37:38,000
*So, she admits she's an idiot. I guess it's good she's aware of her shortcomings - though this admittance won't help dry her out any more quickly.*

1761
02:37:38,000 --> 02:37:43,000
Hazel: "'Sides, though the water's cold, it's actually kinda refreshin'!"

1762
02:37:43,000 --> 02:37:44,000
Hiroki: "Is it...?"

1763
02:37:44,000 --> 02:37:49,000
Hazel: "Oh, yeah! I feel like it's cleared all the cobwebs clean outta my head!"

1764
02:37:49,000 --> 02:37:54,000
Hazel: "I feel like I've been reborn as a brand new woman... or something!"

1765
02:37:54,000 --> 02:38:01,000
Hazel: "D'you wanna join me in the fountain? It really ain't that bad in here, and there's room for two!"

1766
02:38:01,000 --> 02:38:05,000
Hazel: "We could get all up close an' personal, hehe~"

1767
02:38:05,000 --> 02:38:13,000
*Normally, I wouldn't balk at an invitation to get "up close and personal" with Hazel, but I have a few doubts right now.*

1768
02:38:13,000 --> 02:38:20,000
*I'm already freezing. I don't want to invite the cold to soak into my bones more deeply than it already has.*

1769
02:38:20,000 --> 02:38:24,000
Hiroki: "...Sorry, but I think I'll have to pass right now."

1770
02:38:24,000 --> 02:38:29,000
Hazel: "Huh?! But why? Aren't'cha excited to see me lookin' all damp?"

1771
02:38:29,000 --> 02:38:36,000
Hiroki: "I'd be more excited if my teeth weren't chattering. Now, we really should go back indoors."

1772
02:38:36,000 --> 02:38:42,000
*Hazel might be confident that she's immune from catching colds, but I'm less than convinced.*

1773
02:38:42,000 --> 02:38:49,000
Hazel: "Oh... Alright, fine. I guess I can come back inside with you, if you're that worried about me."

1774
02:38:49,000 --> 02:38:56,000
Hiroki: "I am worried - and so should you be! You're a sporting star, so you need to look after your body!"

1775
02:38:56,000 --> 02:38:58,000
Hazel: "I know that, but geez."

1776
02:38:58,000 --> 02:39:00,000
*Hazel rolls her eyes.*

1777
02:39:00,000 --> 02:39:07,000
Hazel: "I'll be totally fine. You're getting, like, waaay too worked up! I'm way tougher'n you might think!"

1778
02:39:07,000 --> 02:39:10,000
Hazel: "In fact, I'm havin' a bunch of fun!"

1779
02:39:10,000 --> 02:39:13,000
Hiroki: "You like languishing in a fountain?"

1780
02:39:13,000 --> 02:39:19,000
Hazel: "It's something to do, at least - and don't say I'm "languishing"! I'm not the sort!"

1781
02:39:19,000 --> 02:39:28,000
Hazel: "I know I'm not scary like Marina, but I can look after myself! I'm a strong, independent woman, and we don't get colds: you'll see!"

1782
02:39:28,000 --> 02:39:36,000
Hazel: "I'm stronger'n any germs out there! They can do their worst, but they won't be able to lay a finger on me!"

1783
02:39:36,000 --> 02:39:37,000
Hazel: "Hahahaha!"

1784
02:39:37,000 --> 02:39:41,000
*She sure sounds positive, but I'm a little more pessimistic.*

1785
02:39:41,000 --> 02:39:44,000
Hiroki: "Sure, sure. Whatever you say..."

1786
02:39:44,000 --> 02:39:45,000
*I sigh.*

1787
02:39:45,000 --> 02:39:49,000
Hiroki: "Just don't blame me if you get sick, you dummy."

1788
02:39:49,000 --> 02:39:50,000
*The next day...*

1789
02:39:50,000 --> 02:39:52,000
Hazel: "Aa... Aa... Achoo...!"

1790
02:39:52,000 --> 02:39:57,000
Hifumi: "Oh dear me! That was quite the sneeze! Are you alright, Hazel, dear?"

1791
02:39:57,000 --> 02:40:02,000
Hiroki: "She'd be fine, if she hadn't decided to take a dip in the fountain..."

1792
02:40:02,000 --> 02:40:06,000
*I sigh, while massaging my temple with my fingertips.*

1793
02:40:06,000 --> 02:40:14,000
*I did think last night, after Hazel's sojourn in the fountain, that this might happen, despite her protests to the contrary.*

1794
02:40:14,000 --> 02:40:23,000
*Hazel reassured me that "idiots don't catch colds", which is a pretty popular aphorism, but Hazel isn't as stupid as she lets on.*

1795
02:40:23,000 --> 02:40:30,000
*She's pretty canny, in actual fact, and she's good at reading her opponents when she plays tennis.*

1796
02:40:30,000 --> 02:40:37,000
*She wasn't smart enough, however, to predict that she would, after getting soaked, catch a cold.*

1797
02:40:37,000 --> 02:40:44,000
*I could say "I told you so", but that'd be a bit of a jerk move; especially when Hazel looks so shame-faced.*

1798
02:40:44,000 --> 02:40:47,000
*I guess I'll let her off the hook, although...*

1799
02:40:47,000 --> 02:40:54,000
Hiroki: "You should be more careful. You might be a succubus, but you're not immune from getting sick."

1800
02:40:54,000 --> 02:40:55,000
Hazel: "Ehehe..."

1801
02:40:55,000 --> 02:41:00,000
*Hazel giggles coyly, while pressing the tips of her fingers together.*

1802
02:41:00,000 --> 02:41:02,000
Hazel: "Now you sound like Hifumin."

1803
02:41:02,000 --> 02:41:04,000
Hifumi: "Is that a bad thing?"

1804
02:41:04,000 --> 02:41:13,000
Hazel: "Not really, I guess. It's just kinda funny, is all. I didn't know you were so maternal, Hiroki - or that you cared so much!"

1805
02:41:13,000 --> 02:41:17,000
Hiroki: "Of course I care about you. You're important to me."

1806
02:41:17,000 --> 02:41:19,000
Hazel: "I-Important, huh...?"

1807
02:41:19,000 --> 02:41:25,000
*Hazel dips her head, her face flushing, which is rare for her. She doesn't often blush.*

1808
02:41:25,000 --> 02:41:31,000
*I thought Hazel was immune to shame, given her fondness for going commando, but maybe not.*

1809
02:41:31,000 --> 02:41:34,000
*Having a cold must've lowered her defenses.*

1810
02:41:34,000 --> 02:41:38,000
*That, or her face was flushed already, owing to her fever.*

1811
02:41:38,000 --> 02:41:42,000
*Maybe it's a bit of column A, and a bit of column B?*

1812
02:41:42,000 --> 02:41:47,000
*Hazel isn't so unwell she can't sit up in bed, but she looks worse for wear.*

1813
02:41:47,000 --> 02:41:55,000
*She doesn't even have the energy to assume her human form, so she's clad in the attire of a succubus right now.*

1814
02:41:55,000 --> 02:42:01,000
*Her horns are protruding from her scalp, and her tail is twitching against the sheets.*

1815
02:42:01,000 --> 02:42:08,000
*Hifumi, meanwhile, is kneeling behind Hazel on the bed, while wiping her back down with a sponge.*

1816
02:42:08,000 --> 02:42:20,000
*Since Hazel's sick, she's a little sweaty. Her toned skin, a lot of which is on display, is damp and slick; her hair, freed from its usual ponytail, hanging loosely about her shoulders.*

1817
02:42:20,000 --> 02:42:26,000
*She looks more girlish, somehow, than usual, and less energetic; more vulnerable, maybe.*

1818
02:42:26,000 --> 02:42:32,000
*It's quite sweet, in a way - at least, it would be, if I wasn't so worried about her.*

1819
02:42:32,000 --> 02:42:39,000
Hazel: "Y-You're quite the charmer, Hiroki. You really know how to make a girl's heart flutter, hehe~"

1820
02:42:39,000 --> 02:42:46,000
Hiroki: "Well, thanks. I'm not trying to woo you, though; not while you're sick. I'm just being honest."

1821
02:42:46,000 --> 02:42:51,000
Hiroki: "I really do care for you, and I don't like to see you so rundown."

1822
02:42:51,000 --> 02:42:52,000
Hazel: "You don't?"

1823
02:42:52,000 --> 02:42:55,000
Hiroki: "No. I prefer your energetic self."

1824
02:42:55,000 --> 02:42:57,000
Hazel: "Well, I'll be..."

1825
02:42:57,000 --> 02:42:58,000
*Hazel giggles.*

1826
02:42:58,000 --> 02:43:02,000
Hazel: "I thought you might be into the whole "delicate" shtick."

1827
02:43:02,000 --> 02:43:14,000
Hazel: "I know some guys - some girls, too - think I'm too much of a handful. They say I'm hard to deal with. Even Yuriko got on my case, from time to time, and she was crazy about me."

1828
02:43:14,000 --> 02:43:21,000
Hazel: "Didn't it bug you, too, when I asked you to go jogging with me super early in the morning?"

1829
02:43:21,000 --> 02:43:23,000
Hiroki: "It bothered me a bit, yeah-"

1830
02:43:23,000 --> 02:43:25,000
Hazel: "Ha! I knew it!"

1831
02:43:25,000 --> 02:43:31,000
Hiroki: "-but seeing you having fun made me happy... in a self-defeating kind of way, I guess."

1832
02:43:31,000 --> 02:43:40,000
Hiroki: "It's so rare to see you laid up in bed, it's kind of alarming - even if the peace and quiet might be appreciated, from time to time."

1833
02:43:40,000 --> 02:43:47,000
Hiroki: "I'd never be happy at you being ill, though. That's why I want you to hurry up and get better."

1834
02:43:47,000 --> 02:43:52,000
Hifumi: "And she shall, if she listens to me, and gets plenty of rest!"

1835
02:43:52,000 --> 02:43:58,000
Hifumi: "Now, would you lift your arms up, Hazel, dear, so I can sponge them down?"

1836
02:43:58,000 --> 02:44:00,000
Hazel: "Right. Sure thing, Mommy."

1837
02:44:00,000 --> 02:44:01,000
Hifumi: "Mommy"?"

1838
02:44:01,000 --> 02:44:03,000
*Hifumi smiles, amused.*

1839
02:44:03,000 --> 02:44:14,000
Hifumi: "I am unsure how to feel about that. I am hardly old enough to be your mother, Hazel - though I suppose I do enjoy doting upon you! It is rather diverting!"

1840
02:44:14,000 --> 02:44:20,000
Hazel: "Well, I'm glad you're - koff, koff - havin' fun, even if it is at my expense..."

1841
02:44:20,000 --> 02:44:23,000
Hifumi: "Oh, you know me. I like to be of service!"

1842
02:44:23,000 --> 02:44:28,000
Hiroki: "I know. That's why I asked you to look after Hazel, rather than Marina."

1843
02:44:28,000 --> 02:44:29,000
Hazel: "Ah, Marina..."

1844
02:44:29,000 --> 02:44:30,000
*Hazel shivers.*

1845
02:44:30,000 --> 02:44:39,000
Hazel: "I find her hard enough to deal with as it is, let alone when I'm coughing! I'm more than happy to keep my distance from her!"

1846
02:44:39,000 --> 02:44:44,000
Hiroki: "I doubt she would want to risk catching your germs, either."

1847
02:44:44,000 --> 02:44:48,000
Hazel: "Hehe. Good point. She's, like, such a neat freak!"

1848
02:44:48,000 --> 02:44:54,000
Hazel: "The inside of her apartment's so pristine, it kinda scares me, hehe... koff, koff!"

1849
02:44:54,000 --> 02:44:55,000
Hifumi: "Dear me."

1850
02:44:55,000 --> 02:45:01,000
*Hifumi tuts, while continuing to wipe down the sweat from Hazel's flustered skin.*

1851
02:45:01,000 --> 02:45:06,000
Hifumi: "Perhaps you ought to talk less, dear. You'll only make yourself cough."

1852
02:45:06,000 --> 02:45:13,000
Hifumi: "Once I've finished wiping you down, would you like to take a nap? I think you could use some sleep."

1853
02:45:13,000 --> 02:45:21,000
Hazel: "That might be a good idea, actually. I wouldn't wanna tax myself. That'd only make you an' Hiroki worry."

1854
02:45:21,000 --> 02:45:23,000
Hazel: "You're both such fusspots!"

1855
02:45:23,000 --> 02:45:26,000
Hifumi: "We only fuss because we care."

1856
02:45:26,000 --> 02:45:35,000
Hiroki: "Indeed. I'm just glad you only caught a common cold. It's been so frigid lately, it's a good thing you didn't get pneumonia."

1857
02:45:35,000 --> 02:45:38,000
Hazel: "I guess I got lucky, hehe... koff, koff!"

1858
02:45:38,000 --> 02:45:46,000
*And now Hazel's back to coughing. Her shoulders convulse from the strain of it, and her face looks pretty flustered.*

1859
02:45:46,000 --> 02:45:48,000
Hifumi: "You poor thing."

1860
02:45:48,000 --> 02:45:49,000
*Hifumi sighs.*

1861
02:45:49,000 --> 02:45:55,000
Hifumi: "Just try to take it easy. Know that, as long as I am here, you will be in safe hands."

1862
02:45:55,000 --> 02:46:00,000
Hifumi: "I would never let one of my cute succubus siblings get hurt."

1863
02:46:00,000 --> 02:46:10,000
Hiroki: "And I don't want see you get hurt, either - which means, from now on, there'll be no more diving into fountains. Am I making myself plain?"

1864
02:46:10,000 --> 02:46:12,000
Hazel: "I get it, I get it..."

1865
02:46:12,000 --> 02:46:14,000
*Hazel smiles, abashed.*

1866
02:46:14,000 --> 02:46:19,000
Hazel: "I'll be on my best behavior from now on, so don't worry - and..."

1867
02:46:19,000 --> 02:46:25,000
*Hazel looks between Hifumi and I, while toying with a strand of her hair, then says...*

1868
02:46:25,000 --> 02:46:31,000
Hazel: "Thanks for lookin' out for me, even if I'm a dummy. I really do appreciate it."

1869
02:46:31,000 --> 02:46:34,000
Hazel: "You're the bestest pals a gal could have!"

1870
02:46:34,000 --> 02:46:39,000
*Time passes, and in a few scant days, Hazel makes a full recovery.*

1871
02:46:39,000 --> 02:46:45,000
*She was coughing a lot, but she looks just fine now: as upbeat and energetic as ever before.*

1872
02:46:45,000 --> 02:46:48,000
*I guess succubi are made of strong stuff.*

1873
02:46:48,000 --> 02:46:54,000
*As the days go by, almost in a blur, my penultimate day in Astoria eventually arrives.*

1874
02:46:54,000 --> 02:47:05,000
*With my inevitable return to Japan looming on the horizon, Stephania decides to set her plans into motion: namely, her televised karuta competition with Hifumi.*

1875
02:47:05,000 --> 02:47:12,000
*Elizabeth spends the day preparing the parlor, in anticipation of the camera crew who will be arriving.*

1876
02:47:12,000 --> 02:47:20,000
*She dusts and polishes, mops and waxes, and - in short - does all she can to ensure every single surface is sparkling.*

1877
02:47:20,000 --> 02:47:29,000
*Once the parlor has been prepared, the karuta cards for Stephania and Hifumi's ultimate showdown are arranged thus so upon the carpet.*

1878
02:47:29,000 --> 02:47:33,000
*The camera crew arrive around 18:30, to film the proceedings.*

1879
02:47:33,000 --> 02:47:43,000
*When they arrive, Hifumi and Stephania have already taken their positions in the parlor; both facing the other from across their respective play areas.*

1880
02:47:43,000 --> 02:47:55,000
*Hifumi is attired, as per usual, in her elegant kimono. Her dark, straight hair cascades about her shoulders like a waterfall, and upon her face is painted a small, tranquil smile.*

1881
02:47:55,000 --> 02:48:08,000
*Stephania, for her part, looks similarly well-groomed. She's attired in the dark blue gown she often wears while gadding about the palace; her blonde hair fixed back in two loose ponytails.*

1882
02:48:08,000 --> 02:48:15,000
*Stephania's green eyes are bright and alert, and when the camera crew arrive, she turns to greet them thus.*

1883
02:48:15,000 --> 02:48:20,000
Stephania: "Thank you very much, everybody, for agreeing to this whim of mine."

1884
02:48:20,000 --> 02:48:22,000
Stephania: "Are the cameras rolling?"

1885
02:48:22,000 --> 02:48:29,000
Cameraman: "They are now, your majesty. We wouldn't want to miss a single second of your performance!"

1886
02:48:29,000 --> 02:48:30,000
Stephania: "Splendid!"

1887
02:48:30,000 --> 02:48:39,000
*Stephania beams, then addresses the faceless masses directly; her gaze trained, unflinchingly, upon the staring lens of the camera.*

1888
02:48:39,000 --> 02:48:46,000
Stephania: "Greetings, people of Astoria. I am Stephania Sofia Maria Isabella of Astoria; your humble princess."

1889
02:48:46,000 --> 02:48:56,000
Stephania: "Though I know this is awfully short notice, I hope you delight in watching my karuta competition with the reigning queen, Yamamoto Hifumi."

1890
02:48:56,000 --> 02:49:01,000
Stephania: "Miss Yamamoto has come all the way from Japan to play against me."

1891
02:49:01,000 --> 02:49:11,000
Stephania: "She is a very busy woman, but she was considerate enough to set aside a good deal of time for my sake - and for that, I can only thank her."

1892
02:49:11,000 --> 02:49:15,000
Hifumi: "Oh, don't mention it. I'm happy to be here!"

1893
02:49:15,000 --> 02:49:18,000
*A smiling Hifumi waves at the camera.*

1894
02:49:18,000 --> 02:49:24,000
Hifumi: "Hello, citizens of Astoria. Like Stephania said, I hope you enjoy the spectacle."

1895
02:49:24,000 --> 02:49:33,000
Hifumi: "A princess though Stephania may be, I will do my best to emerge the victor regardless. I do not intend to go easy on her."

1896
02:49:33,000 --> 02:49:36,000
Hifumi: "I take karuta very seriously indeed!"

1897
02:49:36,000 --> 02:49:40,000
Hifumi: "If you watch on, you might just see sparks fly... Ehehe~"

1898
02:49:40,000 --> 02:49:46,000
Stephania: "Well, that should go without saying! Both of us are going to do our very best!"

1899
02:49:46,000 --> 02:49:56,000
Stephania: "I did not spend the last two weeks training under your tutelage, mistress, for you to throw in the towel for the sake of my reputation!"

1900
02:49:56,000 --> 02:50:00,000
Stephania: "I want you to come at me with everything you have!"

1901
02:50:00,000 --> 02:50:08,000
Hifumi: "That was, indeed, the plan. To face you with nothing but the utmost seriousness would be an insult to your good name."

1902
02:50:08,000 --> 02:50:09,000
Stephania: "I concur!"

1903
02:50:09,000 --> 02:50:12,000
*A grinning Stephania looks back at the camera.*

1904
02:50:12,000 --> 02:50:19,000
Stephania: "I realize karuta is a little-known sport in this land, but I hope I will be able to publicize it."

1905
02:50:19,000 --> 02:50:27,000
Stephania: "It is a dear pastime of mine, steeped in rich Japanese culture, and it is elegant while being competitive."

1906
02:50:27,000 --> 02:50:35,000
Stephania: "I am still a novice in the art, but my mistress - I mean, Miss Yamamoto - is a seasoned professional."

1907
02:50:35,000 --> 02:50:42,000
Stephania: "I'm sure, if you observe her graceful form, you will grow to fall in love with karuta as I have."

1908
02:50:42,000 --> 02:50:53,000
Stephania: "If you could garner just a bit of appreciation for this sport, I will consider today's competition a victory, regardless of whether I win or not."

1909
02:50:53,000 --> 02:51:00,000
Stephania: "There is nothing I want more than to spread my love of Japan and its customs across my country!"

1910
02:51:00,000 --> 02:51:04,000
Hifumi: "Well said! Japanese culture is truly charming, ufufu~"

1911
02:51:04,000 --> 02:51:07,000
Hifumi: "I am beginning to feel rather patriotic!"

1912
02:51:07,000 --> 02:51:19,000
*You and me both, Hifumi. Stephania's effusive interest in our national pastimes is charming, to say the least - though I'd hesitate to call karuta a huge point of cultural interest.*

1913
02:51:19,000 --> 02:51:27,000
*It's a uniquely Japanese sport, yeah, but it's not widely played, even in its country of origin. It's pretty niche.*

1914
02:51:27,000 --> 02:51:34,000
*Most kids nowadays don't have an interest in slapping cards around. They'd rather play phone games.*

1915
02:51:34,000 --> 02:51:36,000
*As for me, meanwhile...*

1916
02:51:36,000 --> 02:51:42,000
Stephania: "Of course, I did not stage this contest solely to champion a Japanese card game."

1917
02:51:42,000 --> 02:51:45,000
Stephania: "When I play karuta, I do so to win."

1918
02:51:45,000 --> 02:51:49,000
*Stephania stabs a finger in Hifumi's direction, then cries...*

1919
02:51:49,000 --> 02:51:56,000
Stephania: "As much as I respect you, mistress, I will do my very best to oust you from your position!"

1920
02:51:56,000 --> 02:52:03,000
Stephania: "I'm aiming to be the queen of karuta one day myself! As such, I cannot afford to hold back!"

1921
02:52:03,000 --> 02:52:05,000
Hifumi: "Goodness me! How fiery!"

1922
02:52:05,000 --> 02:52:11,000
Hifumi: "I almost feel like cheering you on myself! I love how very enthusiastic you are!"

1923
02:52:11,000 --> 02:52:14,000
Hifumi: "This should be a lot of fun!"

1924
02:52:14,000 --> 02:52:19,000
Stephania: "I am certain it will be! How could it not, when I will be facing you?"

1925
02:52:19,000 --> 02:52:21,000
Stephania: "Now, let us begin!!!"

1926
02:52:21,000 --> 02:52:29,000
*And so, a fierce competition soon unfolds between both these women, before the ever-watchful eye of an impartial camera lens.*

1927
02:52:29,000 --> 02:52:37,000
*They face one another as a master and her disciple: Hifumi, the clear superior; Stephania, the plucky young challenger.*

1928
02:52:37,000 --> 02:52:45,000
*Elizabeth reads out the cards, which the pair scramble split seconds after she's able to announce the first few syllables.*

1929
02:52:45,000 --> 02:52:56,000
*Hifumi's motions are exceedingly elegant, as is to be expected. She moves with the grace of a swan on the water, her long kimono sleeves fluttering behind her.*

1930
02:52:56,000 --> 02:53:06,000
*Stephania, meanwhile, is much clumsier. She scatters cards when she moves, and commits a handful of faults, which puts her at a significant disadvantage.*

1931
02:53:06,000 --> 02:53:12,000
*Still, Stephania doesn't falter, despite the gulf which grows between her and Hifumi.*

1932
02:53:12,000 --> 02:53:18,000
*She pays no attention at all to the cameras focused upon her. They don't even make her pause.*

1933
02:53:18,000 --> 02:53:23,000
*Stephania is too focused on her karuta to pay any outside distractions any heed.*

1934
02:53:23,000 --> 02:53:31,000
*At one point during their long, protracted game, she's able to score a series of consecutive points against Hifumi, but...*

1935
02:53:31,000 --> 02:53:33,000
Elizabeth: "Though I would hide-"

1936
02:53:33,000 --> 02:53:34,000
Hifumi: "Ei!"

1937
02:53:34,000 --> 02:53:40,000
*Hifumi is able to take one card from Stephania's side of the field - then another, and another.*

1938
02:53:40,000 --> 02:53:48,000
*This series of losses shakes Stephania, and Hifumi is soon able to re-establish her dominance of the playing field.*

1939
02:53:48,000 --> 02:53:51,000
*The minutes which pass by seem to do so in a blur.*

1940
02:53:51,000 --> 02:54:05,000
*I've never really gotten the hype around karuta (it's a hopelessly slow-paced sort of "sport", and I've never been too enamored with classical poetry), but I feel myself getting sucked into the match regardless.*

1941
02:54:05,000 --> 02:54:12,000
*The atmosphere in the parlor is so dense, it feels almost electric. The air seems to crackle with adrenaline.*

1942
02:54:12,000 --> 02:54:17,000
*I wonder what the viewers back home are thinking of this spectacle?*

1943
02:54:17,000 --> 02:54:28,000
*Karuta might seem an inscrutable sport to those who don't care for classic Japanese poetry, but at its heart, it's a raw battle of wills between its competitors.*

1944
02:54:28,000 --> 02:54:34,000
*I feel like I've finally understood the appeal of the game, after all these years.*

1945
02:54:34,000 --> 02:54:39,000
*This is why people continue to play karuta, despite it being such an old sport.*

1946
02:54:39,000 --> 02:54:51,000
*There's a certain thrill to it that's comparable to chess, or shogi, but it feels even more intense - maybe because the competitors have to physically lunge forwards to seize the cards.*

1947
02:54:51,000 --> 02:54:56,000
*The game is based around memory, precision, and just a bit of luck.*

1948
02:54:56,000 --> 02:55:01,000
*Those with the faster reflexes are favored, but they aren't guaranteed to win.*

1949
02:55:01,000 --> 02:55:06,000
*To be good at competitive karuta, one has to put in a huge amount of work.*

1950
02:55:06,000 --> 02:55:10,000
*As the match unfolds, I find myself rooting, inevitably, for...*

1951
02:55:10,000 --> 02:55:16,000
*Both Hifumi and Stephania have labored for many, many hours to reach this point, but alas...!*

1952
02:55:16,000 --> 02:55:19,000
Elizabeth: "Although in deep distress-"

1953
02:55:19,000 --> 02:55:20,000
Stephania: "Ha...!"

1954
02:55:20,000 --> 02:55:22,000
Elizabeth: "Through a swift stream-"

1955
02:55:22,000 --> 02:55:23,000
Hifumi: "Ya...!"

1956
02:55:23,000 --> 02:55:25,000
Elizabeth: "We pledged our vows-"

1957
02:55:25,000 --> 02:55:26,000
Stephania: "Here...!"

1958
02:55:26,000 --> 02:55:32,000
*As with most games of this ilk, there can only be one victor - and, in the end...*

1959
02:55:32,000 --> 02:55:34,000
Stephania: "N-No way..."

1960
02:55:34,000 --> 02:55:41,000
*Stephania stares down at the floor, utterly defeated. Her shoulders shake, and her pale eyelashes tremble.*

1961
02:55:41,000 --> 02:55:47,000
*Hifumi has taken such an overwhelming lead, there can be no coming back for Stephania.*

1962
02:55:47,000 --> 02:55:55,000
*There are still three cards left on the field, but securing all of these wouldn't be enough for Stephania to best her.*

1963
02:55:55,000 --> 02:56:01,000
*Her loss is immediately apparent, even to a guy with as little knowledge about karuta as me.*

1964
02:56:01,000 --> 02:56:03,000
*Continuing would be pointless.*

1965
02:56:03,000 --> 02:56:05,000
*Hifumi has emerged the victor.*

1966
02:56:05,000 --> 02:56:16,000
*I wonder how Stephania will take this. It was her idea to stage this competition, and to broadcast it across Astoria. Her pride must be smarting because of it.*

1967
02:56:16,000 --> 02:56:27,000
*She's the representative of karuta in Astoria - I wouldn't be at all surprised if she's the most accomplished player in the whole country - but she still lost.*

1968
02:56:27,000 --> 02:56:32,000
*Now, her defeat has been broadcast for thousands of people to see.*

1969
02:56:32,000 --> 02:56:41,000
*This isn't the first time Stephania's lost against Hifumi, either. This marks her second defeat, despite her lofty proclamations.*

1970
02:56:41,000 --> 02:56:47,000
*Stephania poured a huge amount of energy into perfecting her craft, but she was still bested.*

1971
02:56:47,000 --> 02:56:51,000
*I bet she must be experiencing a myriad of emotions right now.*

1972
02:56:51,000 --> 02:56:55,000
*I've half a mind to approach her, and to console her, but...*

1973
02:56:55,000 --> 02:56:58,000
Stephania: "That was... really amazing...!!!"

1974
02:56:58,000 --> 02:57:04,000
*With wide eyes, Stephania raises her head, and affixes Hifumi with a bright grin.*

1975
02:57:04,000 --> 02:57:10,000
*She isn't whimpering, as I feared she might, and her green eyes are quite devoid of tears.*

1976
02:57:10,000 --> 02:57:17,000
*Instead, Stephania looks simply, blissfully happy; so much so, I feel purified upon regarding her.*

1977
02:57:17,000 --> 02:57:20,000
*Stephania's made of sterner stuff than I thought.*

1978
02:57:20,000 --> 02:57:25,000
*She isn't the sort to burst into tears over a little loss like this.*

1979
02:57:25,000 --> 02:57:27,000
*She's far too strong.*

1980
02:57:27,000 --> 02:57:38,000
Stephania: "You were wonderful, mistress! The way you smacked the cards was so forceful, yet so elegant, it was almost as though we were engaged in a sword fight!"

1981
02:57:38,000 --> 02:57:40,000
Hifumi: "A sword fight, is it?"

1982
02:57:40,000 --> 02:57:41,000
*Hifumi giggles.*

1983
02:57:41,000 --> 02:57:50,000
Hifumi: "That sounds a touch too violent for my tastes - I like karuta because it's a peaceful sport! - but I appreciate the compliment."

1984
02:57:50,000 --> 02:58:00,000
Hifumi: "I do not like to waste my movements while I play. Each shift of the body, no matter how subtle, must be considered when one reaches for the cards."

1985
02:58:00,000 --> 02:58:04,000
Hifumi: "It can spell the difference between victory and defeat."

1986
02:58:04,000 --> 02:58:11,000
Stephania: "Yes, I understand that now! A few split seconds are all it takes for your opponent to best you!"

1987
02:58:11,000 --> 02:58:15,000
Stephania: "In the future, I shall not let my guard down!"

1988
02:58:15,000 --> 02:58:27,000
Stephania: "While I could not defeat you this time, I think I made some progress. I did not lose by quite so large a margin as I have in our previous games! I think I'm improving!"

1989
02:58:27,000 --> 02:58:32,000
Hifumi: "Indeed, you are! You have shown much promise, my dear Stephania."

1990
02:58:32,000 --> 02:58:35,000
Hifumi: "I couldn't be prouder of you!"

1991
02:58:35,000 --> 02:58:39,000
Stephania: "Thank you for being so kind, mistress, but alas...!"

1992
02:58:39,000 --> 02:58:40,000
*Stephania sighs.*

1993
02:58:40,000 --> 02:58:43,000
Stephania: " I fear I have a lot to learn."

1994
02:58:43,000 --> 02:58:52,000
Stephania: "It is frustrating, I will admit, to flag behind you so - but knowing how talented you are gives me a goal to work towards!"

1995
02:58:52,000 --> 02:59:01,000
Stephania: "I'm sure, if I continue to work hard, I'll one day be able to surpass you! That is my dream, and I won't let go of it!"

1996
02:59:01,000 --> 02:59:06,000
Stephania: "Prepare yourself, mistress! This won't be the last you see of me!"

1997
02:59:06,000 --> 02:59:08,000
Stephania: "Ohohohoho!"

1998
02:59:08,000 --> 02:59:17,000
Hifumi: "I shall be waiting. You are very dear to me, Stephania, and I shall always be ready to challenge you, should you want me to."

1999
02:59:17,000 --> 02:59:19,000
Hifumi: "Now, come here."

2000
02:59:19,000 --> 02:59:24,000
*Hifumi opens her arms wide, then folds Stephania gently to her bosom.*

2001
02:59:24,000 --> 02:59:27,000
Hifumi: "I had a lot of fun playing against you."

2002
02:59:27,000 --> 02:59:29,000
Stephania: "Did you truly?"

2003
02:59:29,000 --> 02:59:38,000
Stephania: "I know I've been imposing upon you horribly this last fortnight. I wouldn't be surprised if you've grown tired of me..."

2004
02:59:38,000 --> 02:59:39,000
Hifumi: "Hardly!"

2005
02:59:39,000 --> 02:59:43,000
*Hifumi pets the top of Stephania's blonde head reassuringly.*

2006
02:59:43,000 --> 02:59:51,000
Hifumi: "It was an honor, really, to be invited to your palace. You've rather spoiled me, Stephania, with your hospitality!"

2007
02:59:51,000 --> 02:59:57,000
Hifumi: "You have been a kind, gracious hostess, and I enjoyed my time here immensely."

2008
02:59:57,000 --> 03:00:06,000
Hifumi: "While I must return to Japan tomorrow, I would have no qualms in visiting you again - provide, of course, you wouldn't mind that?"

2009
03:00:06,000 --> 03:00:11,000
Stephania: "N-No, of course I wouldn't! I'd love to see you again, mistress!"

2010
03:00:11,000 --> 03:00:17,000
Stephania: "Playing karuta with you has been one of the most incredible experiences of my life!"

2011
03:00:17,000 --> 03:00:22,000
Hifumi: "I am glad to hear it, hehe~ You certainly know how to flatter a woman!"

2012
03:00:22,000 --> 03:00:29,000
Hifumi: "You are an eager pupil who is keen to learn. Teaching you has been rewarding for me, too."

2013
03:00:29,000 --> 03:00:35,000
Hifumi: "Why, through our many games, I was even able to perfect some of my own techniques!"

2014
03:00:35,000 --> 03:00:44,000
Hifumi: "You have pushed me like nobody else has. You were a formidable foe - and I am sure, in time, you will be able to best me."

2015
03:00:44,000 --> 03:00:50,000
Hifumi: "There is no opponent I would like to be defeated by more than you, my dear Stephania."

2016
03:00:50,000 --> 03:00:55,000
Hifumi: "If anybody is worthy of being the queen of the karuta world, you are."

2017
03:00:55,000 --> 03:01:02,000
Hifumi: "You are full of passion, vitality, and determination - and it really is impossible not to adore you."

2018
03:01:02,000 --> 03:01:09,000
*I find myself pondering Hifumi's words, as an impartial observer to Hifumi and Stephania's embrace.*

2019
03:01:09,000 --> 03:01:12,000
*I wonder how I, exactly, feel about Stephania?*

2020
03:01:12,000 --> 03:01:13,000
*Do I adore her...?*

2021
03:01:13,000 --> 03:01:14,000
*Later that night...*

2022
03:01:14,000 --> 03:01:16,000
Hifumi: "Ah! Today was quite tiring."

2023
03:01:16,000 --> 03:01:20,000
*Hifumi sighs, while sitting upon the edge of my bed.*

2024
03:01:20,000 --> 03:01:31,000
*After her undisputed victory in her karuta match against Stephania, she asked whether she could retreat to my bedchamber, so we could spend some quality time together.*

2025
03:01:31,000 --> 03:01:38,000
Hifumi: "I've been so busy schooling Stephania, I've scarcely had any time to speak to you, just the two of us."

2026
03:01:38,000 --> 03:01:48,000
Hifumi: "I hope you do not consider this an imposition upon your time, but I was wondering whether you would care to indulge me in my selfish wish?"

2027
03:01:48,000 --> 03:01:54,000
Hifumi: "Given I was the victor in today's tournament, I would appreciate some manner of reward."

2028
03:01:54,000 --> 03:02:00,000
*That was the request Hifumi made of me earlier; a request I was only too happy to fulfill.*

2029
03:02:00,000 --> 03:02:07,000
*Now, the pair of us are together in my bedroom, just the two of us, as Hifumi so ardently desired.*

2030
03:02:07,000 --> 03:02:16,000
*Hifumi, sitting upon my bed as she is, is framed by the moonlight. It glimmers in her long hair, black as ink, so it shimmers.*

2031
03:02:16,000 --> 03:02:19,000
*Inclining her head towards me, Hifumi says...*

2032
03:02:19,000 --> 03:02:21,000
Hifumi: "Hiroki, darling..."

2033
03:02:21,000 --> 03:02:23,000
Hiroki: "Yes? What is it, Hifumi?"

2034
03:02:23,000 --> 03:02:33,000
Hifumi: "It might be unseemly for me to ask for a further reward, when you have already been good enough to permit me entrance to your bedchamber, but..."

2035
03:02:33,000 --> 03:02:38,000
Hifumi: "If you would not mind too terribly, would you care to kiss me?"

2036
03:02:38,000 --> 03:02:44,000
Hifumi: "I feel tired at the present, but your caress ought to help invigorate my spirits."

2037
03:02:44,000 --> 03:02:48,000
Hiroki: "Heh. I could say the same thing about myself."

2038
03:02:48,000 --> 03:02:52,000
*I shuffle closer to Hifumi, then take her hand in mine.*

2039
03:02:52,000 --> 03:02:55,000
*Giving her fingers a comforting squeeze, I say...*

2040
03:02:55,000 --> 03:02:57,000
Hiroki: "I thought you'd never ask."

2041
03:02:57,000 --> 03:03:02,000
Hifumi: "You were waiting for me to demand a kiss from you, before acting?"

2042
03:03:02,000 --> 03:03:04,000
*Hifumi's brow furrows.*

2043
03:03:04,000 --> 03:03:12,000
Hifumi: "My, but that is very cruel of you! You ought to know, Hiroki, that women prefer it when men take the lead."

2044
03:03:12,000 --> 03:03:20,000
Hifumi: "It is embarrassing for me to make such demands upon you; particularly where your affection is concerned."

2045
03:03:20,000 --> 03:03:24,000
Hifumi: "I wouldn't wish to come across as a desperate woman."

2046
03:03:24,000 --> 03:03:29,000
Hiroki: "Maybe not, but some guys like it when women take the initiative."

2047
03:03:29,000 --> 03:03:38,000
Hiroki: "I know it's not how things are done, in a traditional sense, but who cares about tradition? We're living in the 21st century now."

2048
03:03:38,000 --> 03:03:44,000
Hifumi: "So you say, but you ought to be more aware of whom it is you are addressing."

2049
03:03:44,000 --> 03:03:53,000
Hifumi: "One need only observe my mode of dress, and my manner of speech, to know that I am a traditional woman in all aspects!"

2050
03:03:53,000 --> 03:03:57,000
Hiroki: "You're traditional in most aspects, I agree..."

2051
03:03:57,000 --> 03:04:04,000
*Hifumi's fondness for karuta, which is a very old-fashioned game, further adds to her antiquated charms.*

2052
03:04:04,000 --> 03:04:08,000
Hiroki: "...but don't think I don't know what's up, Hifumi."

2053
03:04:08,000 --> 03:04:20,000
Hiroki: "As pliant and as delicate as you like to act, I know the truth. You're actually a succubus. You're no stranger at all when it comes to intoxicating men, or ensnaring them."

2054
03:04:20,000 --> 03:04:26,000
Hiroki: "Why, when we met back at that ryokan, you were doing your level best to seduce me!"

2055
03:04:26,000 --> 03:04:32,000
Hiroki: "I haven't forgotten how you let me walk in on you in the springs while you were naked!"

2056
03:04:32,000 --> 03:04:34,000
Hifumi: "You remember that?"

2057
03:04:34,000 --> 03:04:38,000
Hiroki: "Of course. It made a pretty big impression."

2058
03:04:38,000 --> 03:04:51,000
*Two pretty big impressions, I should say, given how comely Hifumi's body is. Even in her kimono, her assets are pronounced, given they swell out from beneath the fabric which covers her.*

2059
03:04:51,000 --> 03:04:52,000
Hifumi: "My, my..."

2060
03:04:52,000 --> 03:04:53,000
*Hifumi giggles.*

2061
03:04:53,000 --> 03:04:57,000
Hifumi: "Did you like it when I acted aggressive, then?"

2062
03:04:57,000 --> 03:04:59,000
Hiroki: "I might've, yeah."

2063
03:04:59,000 --> 03:05:02,000
Hifumi: "Would you like me to do it more?"

2064
03:05:02,000 --> 03:05:05,000
Hiroki: "I wouldn't be opposed to the idea."

2065
03:05:05,000 --> 03:05:17,000
Hifumi: "Very well then. Rather than asking you for kisses in the future, as a dutiful housewife would, I shall take them by force - provided we are alone together, of course."

2066
03:05:17,000 --> 03:05:21,000
Hifumi: "I would not wish to cause a scandal in public-"

2067
03:05:21,000 --> 03:05:25,000
Hiroki: "I think you've done enough of that already!"

2068
03:05:25,000 --> 03:05:31,000
Hifumi: "-but, as we are not in public right now, I shall rightfully take what is mine."

2069
03:05:31,000 --> 03:05:37,000
Hifumi: "As a victor, I've every right to claim my reward - and I believe I shall claim you."

2070
03:05:37,000 --> 03:05:41,000
Hifumi: "Now, come here, darling, and surrender to my caresses."

2071
03:05:41,000 --> 03:05:50,000
Hifumi: "No matter what I might look like, I am a succubus... and, when I have set my eyes upon a target, I shan't let them escape from me."

2072
03:05:50,000 --> 03:05:55,000
Hifumi: "I want you, so I shall have you. You have no say in the matter at all..."

2073
03:05:55,000 --> 03:05:56,000
Hifumi: "Ufufufu~"

2074
03:05:56,000 --> 03:06:05,000
*And so it is, with a musical giggle, that Hifumi leans in. She presses my lips to my own to claim them, her mouth wet and wanting.*

2075
03:06:05,000 --> 03:06:10,000
*I sigh against the kiss, then pull Hifumi's body more closely against mine.*

2076
03:06:10,000 --> 03:06:20,000
*I rest one hand against the back of her head, my fingers splayed through her inky hair, while my other hand rests against the small of her back.*

2077
03:06:20,000 --> 03:06:29,000
*Hifumi's kimono slips from about her shoulders when I shift her, and her chest presses against me more firmly than ever before.*

2078
03:06:29,000 --> 03:06:33,000
*I can feel her softness even through the fabric of my clothes.*

2079
03:06:33,000 --> 03:06:36,000
*She feels amazing - and she smells amazing, too.*

2080
03:06:36,000 --> 03:06:40,000
*The sounds she's making, meanwhile, as she kisses me...*

2081
03:06:40,000 --> 03:06:42,000
Hifumi: "Mm... Mm, nn, cchh..."

2082
03:06:42,000 --> 03:06:51,000
*They're so incredibly seductive, it's all I can do to stop myself from stripping her of her cumbersome kimono right here, right now.*

2083
03:06:51,000 --> 03:06:55,000
*Her tongue tangles with mine, and I can taste her saliva.*

2084
03:06:55,000 --> 03:07:05,000
*Hifumi's moans are heady (they certainly can't be called demure), and her flushed face suggests she's looking for something more than a few kisses.*

2085
03:07:05,000 --> 03:07:11,000
*As mild-mannered as Hifumi might appear, I know she has a not-so-secret wild side.*

2086
03:07:11,000 --> 03:07:18,000
*She can be pretty pushy when she wants, but I think her unbridled passion makes her even more appealing.*

2087
03:07:18,000 --> 03:07:20,000
*I love both sides of Hifumi.*

2088
03:07:20,000 --> 03:07:26,000
*It feels like it's been a long time since last I was able to indulge in my feelings for her.*

2089
03:07:26,000 --> 03:07:33,000
*Now I've been afforded the opportunity, I don't want to ever let her go; not until we're both fully satisfied.*

2090
03:07:33,000 --> 03:07:43,000
*The six of us - Stephania, Elizabeth, Marina, Hazel, Hifumi, and I - are assembled in the dining room, at our respective places at the overlong table.*

2091
03:07:43,000 --> 03:07:50,000
*Wintry sunlight filters in through the windows, which illuminates the silverware that's been laid out.*

2092
03:07:50,000 --> 03:08:03,000
*The table is already set with breakfast, and groans beneath the weight of it all - fruits in tureens; piles of freshly-baked croissants; all sorts of preserves - but none of us are doing much eating.*

2093
03:08:03,000 --> 03:08:09,000
Hazel: "This is really good! This croissant is baked to perfection! It's so flaky, and - ooh!"

2094
03:08:09,000 --> 03:08:15,000
Hazel: "These bananas are just right! They're firm, but not too firm, and they're so flavorful!"

2095
03:08:15,000 --> 03:08:20,000
Hazel: "This food is amazing! You wealthy young ladies sure know how to live!"

2096
03:08:20,000 --> 03:08:26,000
Hazel: "I might not act much like a princess, but I'll never get tired of eating like one!"

2097
03:08:26,000 --> 03:08:27,000
Hazel: "Om nom nom!"

2098
03:08:27,000 --> 03:08:28,000
*...Ahem.*

2099
03:08:28,000 --> 03:08:29,000
*I stand corrected.*

2100
03:08:29,000 --> 03:08:38,000
*Hazel's eating plenty (she's never been one to get bogged down by sentiment), but the rest of us are exercising a bit more restraint.*

2101
03:08:38,000 --> 03:08:41,000
*I feel a bit despondent myself, to tell the truth.*

2102
03:08:41,000 --> 03:08:45,000
*This will be the last morning I spend in Stephania's company.*

2103
03:08:45,000 --> 03:08:54,000
*My flight is scheduled later today. In a couple of hours, I'll be whisked away to the airport, alongside my succubus companions.*

2104
03:08:54,000 --> 03:08:58,000
*Then, we'll board our flight, and we'll return to Japan.*

2105
03:08:58,000 --> 03:09:07,000
*I've enjoyed my time in Astoria immensely, in no small part thanks to Stephania's company, but all good things have to come to an end.*

2106
03:09:07,000 --> 03:09:12,000
*I need to get back to my old life, and I need to get back to work.*

2107
03:09:12,000 --> 03:09:21,000
*I'd like to meet up with Cosmos and Ayu again, too, to see how they're holding up, and I need to try and smooth things over with my mother.*

2108
03:09:21,000 --> 03:09:25,000
*Once I return to Japan, I'll have no excuse not to call her.*

2109
03:09:25,000 --> 03:09:32,000
*I can't exactly live on a perpetual vacation. Life's about more than fun, games, and going on dates.*

2110
03:09:32,000 --> 03:09:38,000
*I'll slip back into my day to day routine soon enough, and Stephania will return to hers.*

2111
03:09:38,000 --> 03:09:44,000
*I wonder if I'll ever see her again. It seems unlikely, given her status as a princess.*

2112
03:09:44,000 --> 03:09:54,000
*I don't know what princesses do, exactly (Yue, despite being so young, is a queen, not a princess), but I imagine Stephania's schedule must be packed.*

2113
03:09:54,000 --> 03:10:04,000
*She won't have any time, when I leave, to arrange another meeting with me. We'll be on different sides of the world; more than a thirteen hour flight away.*

2114
03:10:04,000 --> 03:10:06,000
*Now, how does that make me feel...?*

2115
03:10:06,000 --> 03:10:14,000
Hazel: "Aaah! These poached eggs are great, too! They're still all runny, just like I like 'em, and they taste great on toast!"

2116
03:10:14,000 --> 03:10:18,000
Hazel: "I just can't stop eating! It's all super yummy!"

2117
03:10:18,000 --> 03:10:23,000
Hazel: "I'm gonna have to hit the gym ASAP when I get back to Japan!"

2118
03:10:23,000 --> 03:10:24,000
Hazel: "Om nom nom!"

2119
03:10:24,000 --> 03:10:30,000
*...and it sounds pretty delicious, too, if Hazel's running commentary is anything to go by.*

2120
03:10:30,000 --> 03:10:36,000
*Maybe I could try at least one pastry. Perhaps it'll quell the anxious knot in my stomach.*

2121
03:10:36,000 --> 03:10:42,000
*It'd seem kind of thoughtless, though, to start digging in, given the gravity of the situation.*

2122
03:10:42,000 --> 03:10:50,000
*I don't want Stephania's last memory to be of me with pastry crumbs about my lips and strawberry jam smeared on my chin.*

2123
03:10:50,000 --> 03:10:51,000
*Hmm...*

2124
03:10:51,000 --> 03:11:00,000
*I ponder this for a few moments, weighing up the importance of a sorrowful goodbye against the growling of my stomach, when...*

2125
03:11:00,000 --> 03:11:01,000
Stephania: "Hiroki..."

2126
03:11:01,000 --> 03:11:02,000
Hiroki: "Oh?"

2127
03:11:02,000 --> 03:11:11,000
*I look at Stephania curiously, my fingertips falling away from the plate of croissants arranged artfully in the middle of the table.*

2128
03:11:11,000 --> 03:11:13,000
Hiroki: "What is it, Steffy?"

2129
03:11:13,000 --> 03:11:16,000
Stephania: "I was just thinking, um..."

2130
03:11:16,000 --> 03:11:27,000
Stephania: "I don't mean to ruin your breakfast - not when this will be your final meal in Astoria's palace - but on this subject, I fear I cannot remain silent."

2131
03:11:27,000 --> 03:11:33,000
Stephania: "I wish only for you to know that, in your absence, I will miss you dreadfully."

2132
03:11:33,000 --> 03:11:39,000
Stephania: "I have had so much fun with you all that I don't know how best to express it."

2133
03:11:39,000 --> 03:11:42,000
Stephania: "I must thank you, mistress..."

2134
03:11:42,000 --> 03:11:45,000
*Stephania inclines her head in Hifumi's direction.*

2135
03:11:45,000 --> 03:11:51,000
Stephania: "For teaching me so very much about karuta, and being so very patient with me."

2136
03:11:51,000 --> 03:11:55,000
Hifumi: "Oh, don't mention it, dear. I had a lot of fun myself!"

2137
03:11:55,000 --> 03:12:05,000
Stephania: "I would like to thank you as well, Marina and Hazel, for allowing me to grow so close to Hiroki. Your selflessness is truly wonderful."

2138
03:12:05,000 --> 03:12:14,000
Marina: "It's quite alright. I'm too old, you see, to indulge in petty jealousy. I've rather more important affairs upon my mind than that."

2139
03:12:14,000 --> 03:12:16,000
Hazel: "S'fine, s'fine!"

2140
03:12:16,000 --> 03:12:20,000
*Hazel reassures Stephania, through a mouthful of masticated food.*

2141
03:12:20,000 --> 03:12:28,000
Hazel: "You're cute, so I can forgive you anything, even murder! With a face like yours, it's impossible to hate you!"

2142
03:12:28,000 --> 03:12:34,000
Hazel: "'Fact, I'd love to cuddle with you myself, if I ever got the chance, hehe~"

2143
03:12:34,000 --> 03:12:36,000
Stephania: "Well, um..."

2144
03:12:36,000 --> 03:12:40,000
*Stephania blushes, while holding one hand to her chest.*

2145
03:12:40,000 --> 03:12:45,000
Stephania: "Thank you, um... I think? I will take that as a compliment."

2146
03:12:45,000 --> 03:12:48,000
Stephania: "And, as for you, Hiroki..."

2147
03:12:48,000 --> 03:12:55,000
*Stephania affixes her attention upon me once more; her green eyes shining brilliantly, like shooting stars.*

2148
03:12:55,000 --> 03:12:59,000
Stephania: "You have given me more than perhaps you realize."

2149
03:12:59,000 --> 03:13:07,000
Stephania: "Though we were together but a short while, you taught me what it feels like to live as an ordinary woman..."

2150
03:13:07,000 --> 03:13:15,000
Stephania: "I shall never forget the time we spent together, and I shall never not be grateful to you for your kindness."

2151
03:13:15,000 --> 03:13:18,000
Stephania: "Thank you, from the bottom of my heart."

2152
03:13:18,000 --> 03:13:24,000
*Stephania bows her head towards me deeply, in such a reverent motion I find myself flushing.*

2153
03:13:24,000 --> 03:13:29,000
Hiroki: "I-It's fine, Steffy. You don't need to be so complimentary."

2154
03:13:29,000 --> 03:13:37,000
Hiroki: "I'm your partner, not some feudal warlord. I'd rather you treat me like an equal - and I want you to be happy, too."

2155
03:13:37,000 --> 03:13:44,000
Stephania: "I'm aware of that, yes. You've made it blatantly apparent, in all you have said and done to me."

2156
03:13:44,000 --> 03:13:49,000
Stephania: "You're so kind and considerate, being with you makes my heart sing."

2157
03:13:49,000 --> 03:13:54,000
Stephania: "I never thought I would grow to love a man so intensely, but you..."

2158
03:13:54,000 --> 03:13:55,000
*Stephania sniffles.*

2159
03:13:55,000 --> 03:13:57,000
Stephania: "Y-You're special."

2160
03:13:57,000 --> 03:14:06,000
Stephania: "Being parted from you will be a difficult challenge for me to bear, b-but I shall endure it to the best of my abilities!"

2161
03:14:06,000 --> 03:14:11,000
Hiroki: "Please do. I can't stand the thought of you moping; not for my sake."

2162
03:14:11,000 --> 03:14:13,000
Hiroki: "I'd far rather you smile."

2163
03:14:13,000 --> 03:14:20,000
Stephania: "Y-Yes! I thought you might say that, so I've resolved to do my best. Worry not, Hiroki!"

2164
03:14:20,000 --> 03:14:31,000
Stephania: "I love challenges; the harder, the better. I'm not one to run away from a fight, even if love should prove to be the most difficult fight I've ever faced!"

2165
03:14:31,000 --> 03:14:38,000
Stephania: "I promise I won't succumb to loneliness or despair, no matter how far away we may be!"

2166
03:14:38,000 --> 03:14:43,000
Stephania: "I vow that, one day, I shall see you again, no matter what..."

2167
03:14:43,000 --> 03:14:51,000
Stephania: "And then we will make a brand new life together! That is what I want, more than anything in the world."

2168
03:14:51,000 --> 03:14:58,000
Stephania: "Being with you is my newfound dream, Hiroki, and I will do all in my power to make it come true."

2169
03:14:58,000 --> 03:15:02,000
Stephania: "I'm not going to give up! Just you wait!"

2170
03:15:02,000 --> 03:15:08,000
*And, in a manner truly in-keeping with her blue-blooded status, Stephania tips back her head...*

2171
03:15:08,000 --> 03:15:09,000
Stephania: "Ohohoho!"

2172
03:15:09,000 --> 03:15:10,000
*...and laughs.*

2173
03:15:10,000 --> 03:15:18,000
*It's a proud, haughty sort of laugh, which doesn't really suit Stephania, but hearing it consoles me all the same.*

2174
03:15:18,000 --> 03:15:22,000
*That laugh tells me that Stephania really will be fine.*

2175
03:15:22,000 --> 03:15:29,000
*It'll probably be a long time before we're next reunited, but I'm sure everything will work out for the best.*

2176
03:15:29,000 --> 03:15:38,000
*Stephania is a princess, after all - and, in all the fairytales I know, they always wind up achieving their happily ever afters.*

2177
03:15:38,000 --> 03:15:45,000
*After eating breakfast, I pack my belongings, then meet up with my succubus retinue in the palace gardens.*

2178
03:15:45,000 --> 03:15:54,000
*Once Elizabeth has confirmed we have all our possessions, we then clamber into a sleek black car, which is awaiting us outside the palace.*

2179
03:15:54,000 --> 03:16:02,000
*Transported by this expensive, luxurious vehicle, I make my journey back to the airport, alongside Hifumi, Hazel, and Marina.*

2180
03:16:02,000 --> 03:16:09,000
*Stephania and Elizabeth also accompany us on our journey, so they can see us off at the airport.*

2181
03:16:09,000 --> 03:16:18,000
*Upon arriving at the airport - a modern, sophisticated building, all smooth glass - Elizabeth helps us unload our luggage from the trunk.*

2182
03:16:18,000 --> 03:16:29,000
*Elizabeth carries our luggage into the airport proper, despite my protests (as a man, I feel like I ought to be doing more to help), then sets our cases down.*

2183
03:16:29,000 --> 03:16:39,000
*Once Elizabeth's finished with all this busywork, Stephania approaches us, and embraces us in turn: first Marina, then Hazel, then Hifumi, then me.*

2184
03:16:39,000 --> 03:16:42,000
Stephania: "I will miss you, my dear Hiroki."

2185
03:16:42,000 --> 03:16:48,000
*Stephania murmurs against my chest, as she holds me; her cheek pressed against me.*

2186
03:16:48,000 --> 03:16:54,000
Stephania: "Please, do not be a stranger. Write to me, if you can, and I will hasten to respond."

2187
03:16:54,000 --> 03:17:02,000
Stephania: "It might be some time until we're able to reunite, but I'll never forget the time we have spent together."

2188
03:17:02,000 --> 03:17:04,000
Stephania: "That is a promise."

2189
03:17:04,000 --> 03:17:11,000
Hiroki: "I promise, too. I had a great time with you, Steffy. Thanks for being such a great hostess..."

2190
03:17:11,000 --> 03:17:16,000
*I ruffle the top of her blonde head, and inhale a whiff of her fruity shampoo.*

2191
03:17:16,000 --> 03:17:19,000
Hiroki: "And such a great girlfriend, too."

2192
03:17:19,000 --> 03:17:21,000
Stephania: "O-Oh my..."

2193
03:17:21,000 --> 03:17:23,000
*Stephania draws back, flushing.*

2194
03:17:23,000 --> 03:17:29,000
Stephania: "I-I doubt I am such a great girlfriend, really. I don't have any prior experience."

2195
03:17:29,000 --> 03:17:37,000
Stephania: "I-I'm not a self-possessed woman like Marina, and I'm not confident like Hazel, or elegant like my mistress."

2196
03:17:37,000 --> 03:17:45,000
Stephania: "I-I still have much to learn when it comes to interacting with the opposite sex, but I mean to do my very best!"

2197
03:17:45,000 --> 03:17:49,000
Stephania: "I-I only hope you will continue to wait for me!"

2198
03:17:49,000 --> 03:17:56,000
Hiroki: "Of course I will. Don't you worry. You're cute enough that you're worth sticking around for."

2199
03:17:56,000 --> 03:17:57,000
Stephania: "Hiroki..."

2200
03:17:57,000 --> 03:18:01,000
*Stephania all-but swoons at my compliment, her face sunset pink.*

2201
03:18:01,000 --> 03:18:05,000
Stephania: "Y-You're so cool! I really am glad I met you...!"

2202
03:18:05,000 --> 03:18:15,000
*With the goodbyes said, it should be time for me to head into the airport - but, before I can, I feel fingers close about the back of my shirt.*

2203
03:18:15,000 --> 03:18:19,000
*Is it Stephania again, with a few more words of farewell?*

2204
03:18:19,000 --> 03:18:23,000
*I glance back behind my shoulder, intrigued, and...*

2205
03:18:23,000 --> 03:18:24,000
Hiroki: "Oh..."

2206
03:18:24,000 --> 03:18:30,000
*Rather than Stephania's green, earnest irises, I instead come face-to-face with Elizabeth.*

2207
03:18:30,000 --> 03:18:31,000
Hiroki: "Yes?"

2208
03:18:31,000 --> 03:18:33,000
*I frown at her, bemused.*

2209
03:18:33,000 --> 03:18:34,000
Hiroki: "What is it?"

2210
03:18:34,000 --> 03:18:44,000
*Elizabeth peers at me for a few moments, her gloved fingers still curled about the about the fabric of my shirt, before - at long last - she speaks.*

2211
03:18:44,000 --> 03:18:49,000
Elizabeth: "I know your plane will be arriving soon, so I will try to be brief."

2212
03:18:49,000 --> 03:19:00,000
Elizabeth: "I would like to thank you, on milady's behalf, for being so very nice to her. You truly are a kind man. I can see I was right to place milady in your care."

2213
03:19:00,000 --> 03:19:09,000
Elizabeth: "I only hope - both for milady's sake, and your own - that you meant all those sweet sentiments you dispensed so carelessly."

2214
03:19:09,000 --> 03:19:10,000
Elizabeth: "Do not-"

2215
03:19:10,000 --> 03:19:12,000
*Elizabeth's eyes flash warningly.*

2216
03:19:12,000 --> 03:19:22,000
Elizabeth: "-forget milady upon returning to Japan. You have made so deep an impression upon her, I fear she would be distraught if you were to abandon her."

2217
03:19:22,000 --> 03:19:25,000
Elizabeth: "Do try to be cognizant of her feelings."

2218
03:19:25,000 --> 03:19:32,000
Elizabeth: "If you upset her, then I shall have no choice but to make you very, very sorry indeed."

2219
03:19:32,000 --> 03:19:38,000
Elizabeth: "I know I look like an ordinary maid, but I promise you, this is no idle threat."

2220
03:19:38,000 --> 03:19:42,000
Elizabeth: "If I were you, I would not want to get on my bad side."

2221
03:19:42,000 --> 03:19:47,000
Elizabeth: "I have powers a puny mortal like you could only dream of..."

2222
03:19:47,000 --> 03:19:51,000
Elizabeth: "And some powers, I am sure, that you could not."

2223
03:19:51,000 --> 03:19:57,000
Elizabeth: "If you do not wish to meet a premature end, I would advise you to heed my words..."

2224
03:19:57,000 --> 03:19:58,000
Elizabeth: "Ufufu~"

2225
03:19:58,000 --> 03:20:07,000
*Elizabeth's grasp tightens upon my clothes. She's only pinching my shirt, not the skin beneath it, but her grip is alarmingly forceful.*

2226
03:20:07,000 --> 03:20:13,000
*Elizabeth might look prim and proper, but it's obvious she's not a woman to be trifled with.*

2227
03:20:13,000 --> 03:20:20,000
*This this how freshly-caught fish feel, I wonder, moments before they're sliced up and served as sashimi?*

2228
03:20:20,000 --> 03:20:23,000
*I feel like my own end is rapidly approaching.*

2229
03:20:23,000 --> 03:20:27,000
*If I upset Elizabeth, I don't doubt she'll make me regret it.*

2230
03:20:27,000 --> 03:20:36,000
*It's a pretty chilly day, and it's cold even inside the airport, but it feels like the temperature's dropped a good five degrees.*

2231
03:20:36,000 --> 03:20:40,000
*I swallow, and shivering, reply with an obedient...*

2232
03:20:40,000 --> 03:20:49,000
Hiroki: "I-I'll be good. Y-You don't need to fret over Steffy's welfare. I-I'm not the sort of guy who ghosts my partners; I-I promise!"

2233
03:20:49,000 --> 03:20:52,000
Hiroki: "I won't hurt her, so please, um..."

2234
03:20:52,000 --> 03:20:57,000
Hiroki: "W-Won't you let me go? I-I don't want to miss my flight..."

2235
03:20:57,000 --> 03:20:58,000
Elizabeth: "Hmmm..."

2236
03:20:58,000 --> 03:21:03,000
*Elizabeth continues to observe me for a few moments, unblinking, before...*

2237
03:21:03,000 --> 03:21:05,000
Elizabeth: "Very well."

2238
03:21:05,000 --> 03:21:08,000
*She draws back, a smile playing about her lips.*

2239
03:21:08,000 --> 03:21:13,000
Elizabeth: "I did imagine you were trustworthy, but I wanted to make quite sure."

2240
03:21:13,000 --> 03:21:19,000
Elizabeth: "You may go now, if you desire, though I have one further word of warning."

2241
03:21:19,000 --> 03:21:20,000
Hiroki: "What?"

2242
03:21:20,000 --> 03:21:27,000
*She isn't going to threaten to track me down and obliterate me, should I ever make Stephania cry, is she?*

2243
03:21:27,000 --> 03:21:37,000
*Elizabeth's devoted to Stephania enough, I wouldn't be surprised. She's so serious, I can easily imagine her wielding a sword, or maybe a knife.*

2244
03:21:37,000 --> 03:21:45,000
*Her maid dress is so frilly, she could be concealing any number of deadly weapons beneath the hem of her skirt!*

2245
03:21:45,000 --> 03:21:47,000
*An awkward moment passes, then...*

2246
03:21:47,000 --> 03:21:54,000
Elizabeth: "You must be aware of this already, but you really are very attractive to us succubi. Your scent..."

2247
03:21:54,000 --> 03:21:57,000
*Elizabeth runs her tongue against her lower lip.*

2248
03:21:57,000 --> 03:22:04,000
Elizabeth: "It is delectable; so much so, even I have had difficulties restraining myself in your presence."

2249
03:22:04,000 --> 03:22:15,000
Elizabeth: "I was able to temper my urges, for the sake of milady's budding romance - I did not wish to get in the way - but other succubi will be less circumspect."

2250
03:22:15,000 --> 03:22:25,000
Elizabeth: "You had best be careful, upon your return to Japan, else you may find yourself swamped by the affections of even more of our kind."

2251
03:22:25,000 --> 03:22:35,000
Elizabeth: "Try not to let yourself get drained dry. Even a virile man like you must have your limits - and there are only so many succubi you can satisfy."

2252
03:22:35,000 --> 03:22:42,000
Elizabeth: "We make for rather insistent lovers, and if you let us, we will consume all of your affections..."

2253
03:22:42,000 --> 03:22:43,000
Elizabeth: "Ufufu..."

2254
03:22:43,000 --> 03:22:49,000
*Elizabeth's warning, coupled with her eerie laughter, sends fresh shivers down my spine.*

2255
03:22:49,000 --> 03:22:53,000
*Is it just my imagination, or do her irises seem to be glowing?*

2256
03:22:53,000 --> 03:22:58,000
*I had some doubts about Elizabeth, but now I'm really beginning to wonder.*

2257
03:22:58,000 --> 03:23:03,000
Hiroki: "D-Don't tell me... Y-You're not a succubus yourself, a-are you?"

2258
03:23:03,000 --> 03:23:05,000
Elizabeth: "Well, I wonder..."

2259
03:23:05,000 --> 03:23:06,000
*Elizabeth grins.*

2260
03:23:06,000 --> 03:23:13,000
Elizabeth: "Perhaps I will show you my true self, at a later date, should our paths happen to cross again..."

2261
03:23:13,000 --> 03:23:17,000
Elizabeth: "But, until that day, I shall bid you adieu."

2262
03:23:17,000 --> 03:23:24,000
*Elizabeth takes her skirt between her gloved hands, then drops me a neat curtsy, as befitting of a maid.*

2263
03:23:24,000 --> 03:23:30,000
Elizabeth: "I hope you have a safe flight - and do remember to keep in touch with milady."

2264
03:23:30,000 --> 03:23:36,000
Elizabeth: "I was not joking when I said, if you were to upset her, I would never forgive you."

2265
03:23:36,000 --> 03:23:42,000
Elizabeth: "You had best watch out. Trifle with me, and I will make sure that you regret it."

2266
03:23:42,000 --> 03:23:44,000
*Eighteen hours later...*

2267
03:23:44,000 --> 03:23:47,000
Hiroki: "Aah. Home sweet home, at long last."

2268
03:23:47,000 --> 03:23:53,000
*It's with a sigh that I fling my suitcase down on the floor, then collapse onto my futon.*

2269
03:23:53,000 --> 03:24:01,000
Stephania: "I am unsure whether we will see one another again, but I will never forget the time I spent with you."

2270
03:24:01,000 --> 03:24:05,000
Stephania: "You will always have a special place in my heart..."

2271
03:24:05,000 --> 03:24:10,000
Stephania: "And, for a week, at least, I think I really did love you."

2272
03:24:10,000 --> 03:24:18,000
*My goodbyes to Stephania and Elizabeth concluded, the pair of them transport me and my succubus harem to the airport.*

2273
03:24:18,000 --> 03:24:21,000
*From there, we check in, then board our flight.*

2274
03:24:21,000 --> 03:24:28,000
*The flight is tedious, grueling, and rather anti-climatic, but eventually, we touch down in Japan.*

2275
03:24:28,000 --> 03:24:35,000
*The flight is a long one, and when the plane touches down on Japanese soil it's already late at night.*

2276
03:24:35,000 --> 03:24:41,000
*I bid Marina, Hazel, and Hifumi goodbye at the airport, then beat my way over to my apartment.*

2277
03:24:41,000 --> 03:24:54,000
*It takes another hour of changing trains, all the while lugging my suitcase behind me, before I'm able to return home - but, the moment I do, I collapse in a relieved heap upon my futon.*

2278
03:24:54,000 --> 03:25:04,000
*My flight was a long one - made longer still by a three hour layover, stuck waiting in an airport - and I'm all gross and sweaty from the stress of it.*

2279
03:25:04,000 --> 03:25:10,000
*I've been sat in my pants for so long, it almost feels like I'll need to be cut out of them.*

2280
03:25:10,000 --> 03:25:13,000
*My head's pounding, and my whole body aches.*

2281
03:25:13,000 --> 03:25:29,000
*I'm pretty tall for a Japanese guy - unusually so, in fact - and my legs always get scrunched up when I fly. It's one of the main reasons why I hate air travel so much; that, and my uncanny ability to get stuck near screaming babies.*

2282
03:25:29,000 --> 03:25:31,000
*I must be a magnet for them.*

2283
03:25:31,000 --> 03:25:37,000
*At least that was a non-issue during my return, thanks to Marina buying us first class tickets.*

2284
03:25:37,000 --> 03:25:42,000
*You don't see too many babies in the first class cabins on airlines.*

2285
03:25:42,000 --> 03:25:48,000
*The lack of screaming has done little to ease the dull aching in my skull, however.*

2286
03:25:48,000 --> 03:25:55,000
*It's a good thing, I muse, lying bonelessly on my futon, that Cosmos and Ayu didn't stop by to see me.*

2287
03:25:55,000 --> 03:26:02,000
*Cosmos texted me when I was collecting my luggage, asking if she could welcome me back, but I fobbed her off.*

2288
03:26:02,000 --> 03:26:13,000
*I said that, while I'd missed her, I felt too tired to speak to anybody - even my beloved cat-eared girlfriend, and especially her grumpy, twin-tailed idol buddy.*

2289
03:26:13,000 --> 03:26:22,000
*Cosmos and Ayu are pretty close, despite Ayu's claims to the contrary, and I knew, if Cosmos had come to see me, Ayu would've followed suit.*

2290
03:26:22,000 --> 03:26:25,000
*I can't put up with her shrill shrieking; not now.*

2291
03:26:25,000 --> 03:26:26,000
Hiroki: "Haa..."

2292
03:26:26,000 --> 03:26:32,000
*I'm glad I can luxuriate in the quietude of my empty apartment, at the very least.*

2293
03:26:32,000 --> 03:26:40,000
*It's 21:00, and the sun has long since set. The sky beyond my windows is dark black, and flecked liberally with stars.*

2294
03:26:40,000 --> 03:26:44,000
*My mind screams at me to shower, but my body feels far too comfy.*

2295
03:26:44,000 --> 03:26:49,000
*There should be no harm in closing my eyes, if only for a few moments.*

2296
03:26:49,000 --> 03:26:52,000
*I'll relax for a bit, and then I'll shower.*

2297
03:26:52,000 --> 03:26:56,000
*I'll definitely do it. I just need a bit of time. I need...*

2298
03:26:56,000 --> 03:26:57,000
*Mm, nn...*

2299
03:26:57,000 --> 03:26:58,000
*Zzz...*

2300
03:26:58,000 --> 03:26:59,000
*...*

2301
03:26:59,000 --> 03:27:00,000
*...*

2302
03:27:00,000 --> 03:27:01,000
*Beep, beep!*

2303
03:27:01,000 --> 03:27:02,000
Hiroki: "Ah?!"

2304
03:27:02,000 --> 03:27:08,000
*I'm roused from my slumber by a sudden, high-pitched beeping, which emits from my pocket.*

2305
03:27:08,000 --> 03:27:17,000
*Sitting bolt upright, I check my cellphone. I note, as I do so, that it's only 21:05. I must've dozed off for all of five minutes.*

2306
03:27:17,000 --> 03:27:22,000
*I'm more focused, however, on the name which is flashing on my phone screen.*

2307
03:27:22,000 --> 03:27:24,000
*My mom is calling me - but why?*

2308
03:27:24,000 --> 03:27:26,000
*Isn't it kind of late?*

2309
03:27:26,000 --> 03:27:30,000
*Frowning, I pick up the call, then press my phone to my ear.*

2310
03:27:30,000 --> 03:27:32,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Mom. How're-"

2311
03:27:32,000 --> 03:27:43,000
*I begin, but I don't have a chance to finish my well-meaning, filial query. My mother practically jumps down my throat, her voice unusually pitchy with concern.*

2312
03:27:43,000 --> 03:27:52,000
Mom: "Hiroki? This is you, isn't it, Hiroki? Where in the world have you been?! I've been trying to call you for the last two weeks!"

2313
03:27:52,000 --> 03:27:54,000
Hiroki: "Oh, yeah, about that. Uh..."

2314
03:27:54,000 --> 03:27:55,000
*I wince.*

2315
03:27:55,000 --> 03:28:03,000
Hiroki: "Sorry, Mom. I've been in another country for a bit, and I wasn't checking my phone too much. I was kind of busy."

2316
03:28:03,000 --> 03:28:07,000
Mom: "Well, I can see that much! It's been all over the news!"

2317
03:28:07,000 --> 03:28:08,000
Hiroki: "What has...?"

2318
03:28:08,000 --> 03:28:10,000
*My expression blanches.*

2319
03:28:10,000 --> 03:28:14,000
Hiroki: "This isn't about the Hazel and Marina thing, is it?"

2320
03:28:14,000 --> 03:28:22,000
Mom: "Oh, yes, I've heard all about your relationship with Hazel Williams and Wakatsuki Marina, but that isn't the end of it!"

2321
03:28:22,000 --> 03:28:30,000
Mom: "You were photographed earlier in Astoria's airport, consorting with the princess of the country, Stephonia!"

2322
03:28:30,000 --> 03:28:31,000
Hiroki: "Stephonia?"

2323
03:28:31,000 --> 03:28:32,000
*I frown.*

2324
03:28:32,000 --> 03:28:34,000
Hiroki: "You mean Steffy?"

2325
03:28:34,000 --> 03:28:35,000
Mom: "Steffy"!"

2326
03:28:35,000 --> 03:28:38,000
*My mother exclaims, her voice disbelieving.*

2327
03:28:38,000 --> 03:28:51,000
*Though I can't see my mother's face, I can imagine it well enough. Her eyes must be popping out of her skull right now, at my casual way of referring to a genuine, blue-blooded princess.*

2328
03:28:51,000 --> 03:28:57,000
Mom: "So, are the stories true? Are you really in a relationship with all these women?!"

2329
03:28:57,000 --> 03:29:03,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, it's true. I tried to tell you that before, remember, when you laughed at me."

2330
03:29:03,000 --> 03:29:09,000
Hiroki: "I've known them for almost a year, and they're all dear to me, in their own ways."

2331
03:29:09,000 --> 03:29:11,000
Mom: "What...? Then, Hiroki, you..."

2332
03:29:11,000 --> 03:29:18,000
*I hear my mother's voice through the phone, albeit faintly; all fragmented through the sheer shock of it.*

2333
03:29:18,000 --> 03:29:28,000
*I guess I can't blame my mom for being so stunned. It's not every day you learn that your only son's a total stud, who's dating so many influential women.*

2334
03:29:28,000 --> 03:29:35,000
*It's a good thing my mom's only in her early fifties, or I'd worry about giving her a heart attack.*

2335
03:29:35,000 --> 03:29:39,000
Mom: "Were you really serious when you called me earlier?"

2336
03:29:39,000 --> 03:29:47,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, I was. I said as much. Everything I said was true, though I'll admit, it does sound unbelievable."

2337
03:29:47,000 --> 03:29:52,000
Hiroki: "If I weren't in this situation, I wouldn't believe it myself."

2338
03:29:52,000 --> 03:29:56,000
Hiroki: "The last few months have been all kinds of crazy, really."

2339
03:29:56,000 --> 03:30:03,000
Mom: "Oh, I can believe that! I never thought you'd be able to manage one relationship, much less six..."

2340
03:30:03,000 --> 03:30:09,000
*It's actually seven, if you add Yue into the mix, but I decide to keep silent about that.*

2341
03:30:09,000 --> 03:30:19,000
*I don't want to hit my mom with the bombshell that, yes, succubi do exist, and I'm dating their monarch. That'd be a bit too much for her to swallow.*

2342
03:30:19,000 --> 03:30:22,000
*I'm trying to be a considerate son, but...*

2343
03:30:22,000 --> 03:30:24,000
Haughty voice: "Hiroki!"

2344
03:30:24,000 --> 03:30:30,000
*A haughty voice suddenly interrupts my musings, coupled with the slamming of a door.*

2345
03:30:30,000 --> 03:30:35,000
*Instantly, I feel my heart sinking. This scene feels awfully familiar.*

2346
03:30:35,000 --> 03:30:40,000
*Didn't I get interrupted when I was last on the phone with my mom, too?*

2347
03:30:40,000 --> 03:30:45,000
*I turn about anxiously, my eyes wide, and soon come face to face with...*

2348
03:30:45,000 --> 03:30:46,000
Hiroki: "Yue?!"

2349
03:30:46,000 --> 03:30:51,000
*There, the princess of the succubus realm stands, in all her finery.*

2350
03:30:51,000 --> 03:31:01,000
*She's attired, not in her skintight succubus clothes, but the supposedly "casual" attire she dons in the human world - though her dress is anything but.*

2351
03:31:01,000 --> 03:31:09,000
*Yue's wearing a white gown so long it brushes the tatami floor, and her dark hair is decorated with ornate instruments.*

2352
03:31:09,000 --> 03:31:16,000
*Her eyes are lined with severe-looking mascara and cool blue eyeshadow, which make her eyes look icy.*

2353
03:31:16,000 --> 03:31:22,000
*This dress of Yue's is so exquisite, it wouldn't look at all out of place in a museum.*

2354
03:31:22,000 --> 03:31:30,000
*It doesn't fit in, alas, in my small, rundown apartment. She makes everything else look horribly shabby by contrast.*

2355
03:31:30,000 --> 03:31:41,000
*I'd ask how she got in here (I'm sure I locked the door), but that'd be a moot point. As a succubus, Yue is more than capable of using magic to jimmy locks.*

2356
03:31:41,000 --> 03:31:47,000
*Yue approaches me, her footsteps as quiet as a cat's, then says, in an impetuous tone...*

2357
03:31:47,000 --> 03:31:54,000
Yue: "I missed you a good deal these last two weeks. Why did you not tell me that you had come back to Japan?"

2358
03:31:54,000 --> 03:32:00,000
Yue: "I would have dropped everything to see you! That is how much I care for you!"

2359
03:32:00,000 --> 03:32:06,000
Hiroki: "I-I know that, Yue, and I'm sorry. I didn't mean to leave you in the dark. It's just-"

2360
03:32:06,000 --> 03:32:07,000
Yue: "Oh?"

2361
03:32:07,000 --> 03:32:12,000
*Yue's gaze sweeps across my face, until it zeroes in upon my phone.*

2362
03:32:12,000 --> 03:32:15,000
*Her lips purse, and archly, she says...*

2363
03:32:15,000 --> 03:32:21,000
Yue: "Is this why you did not think to contact me? Are you too busy speaking with another woman?"

2364
03:32:21,000 --> 03:32:23,000
Yue: "You truly are shameless!"

2365
03:32:23,000 --> 03:32:24,000
Mom: "Hiroki...?"

2366
03:32:24,000 --> 03:32:28,000
*I hear my mother's voice, bemused, buzzing in my ear, like a bee.*

2367
03:32:28,000 --> 03:32:32,000
Mom: "Hiroki, is everything alright? Is somebody there?"

2368
03:32:32,000 --> 03:32:33,000
Hiroki: "It's fine."

2369
03:32:33,000 --> 03:32:39,000
*I reassure my mom - though, in actuality, I'm starting to sweat something fierce.*

2370
03:32:39,000 --> 03:32:45,000
Hiroki: "A guest just came over, is all - and she seems to have the wrong idea about something."

2371
03:32:45,000 --> 03:32:46,000
Yue: "Oh, really?"

2372
03:32:46,000 --> 03:32:50,000
Hiroki: "Yes, really. I'm not doing anything to be ashamed of!"

2373
03:32:50,000 --> 03:32:51,000
Yue: "Ha!"

2374
03:32:51,000 --> 03:32:52,000
*Yue scoffs.*

2375
03:32:52,000 --> 03:32:54,000
Yue: "That would be a first!"

2376
03:32:54,000 --> 03:33:03,000
Yue: "Do you truly mean to say that you are not engaged in conversation with your darling Stephania, whom you left behind in Astoria?"

2377
03:33:03,000 --> 03:33:05,000
Hiroki: "No, I'm not...!"

2378
03:33:05,000 --> 03:33:06,000
Yue: "Huh?"

2379
03:33:06,000 --> 03:33:08,000
*Yue raises an eyebrow.*

2380
03:33:08,000 --> 03:33:13,000
Yue: "Then, do you mean to say you are not speaking to a woman at all?"

2381
03:33:13,000 --> 03:33:21,000
Hiroki: "I am, but I'm not speaking to one of my partners! I'm talking to my mother - and I've no interest in dating her!"

2382
03:33:21,000 --> 03:33:28,000
*Perish the thought. I might be depraved, but I'm not ready to add any of my own blood relations to my harem.*

2383
03:33:28,000 --> 03:33:40,000
*My web of interpersonal relationships is complex enough already, thank you very much - and, unlike the mothers you see in adult videos, my own mother is decidedly average looking.*

2384
03:33:40,000 --> 03:33:47,000
*She might wear her hair in a ponytail, and sometimes she wears an apron, but she's in her fifties!*

2385
03:33:47,000 --> 03:33:51,000
*She's a totally normal, slightly chubby middle-aged woman!*

2386
03:33:51,000 --> 03:33:53,000
Yue: "Your mother, is it...?"

2387
03:33:53,000 --> 03:34:00,000
*Yue's blue eyes light up at this - and I realize, instantly, that this was the wrong thing to say.*

2388
03:34:00,000 --> 03:34:07,000
*I can tell what's going to happen before it does, but Yue still manages to surprise me with her swiftness.*

2389
03:34:07,000 --> 03:34:10,000
*Quicker than blinking, she reaches out, and then-*

2390
03:34:10,000 --> 03:34:12,000
Hiroki: "Yue, no...!!!"

2391
03:34:12,000 --> 03:34:15,000
*She snatches my cell phone from my hand.*

2392
03:34:15,000 --> 03:34:22,000
*Holding it against her ear, while one hand rests upon her chest, she then declares, in a haughty tone...*

2393
03:34:22,000 --> 03:34:27,000
Yue: "Heed my words, Mrs. Ogasawara, progenitor of my darling Hiroki!"

2394
03:34:27,000 --> 03:34:31,000
Yue: "I am Yue, and I am the ruler of the succubus realm!"

2395
03:34:31,000 --> 03:34:37,000
Yue: "I am one of the most powerful succubi there is, and all tremble before my immense powers!"

2396
03:34:37,000 --> 03:34:42,000
Yue: "I, too, am in love with your son, and he has since pledged his heart to me!"

2397
03:34:42,000 --> 03:34:50,000
Yue: "He is mine, to do with as I please - and, as it has been so very long since last we spoke, I intend to do just that."

2398
03:34:50,000 --> 03:34:58,000
Yue: "I apologize for cutting this conversation short, but I am a busy woman, and I must be back in the succubus realm soon."

2399
03:34:58,000 --> 03:35:04,000
Yue: "Before then, however, I would like to spend some quality time with your son."

2400
03:35:04,000 --> 03:35:10,000
Yue: "I will indulge my passions to the fullest, and together, we shall become one!"

2401
03:35:10,000 --> 03:35:16,000
Yue: "I will inflict upon him all sorts of indignities, and I swear to you, he will enjoy them!"

2402
03:35:16,000 --> 03:35:21,000
Yue: "You mightn't know this, but your darling son is something of a masochist."

2403
03:35:21,000 --> 03:35:26,000
Yue: "He loves it when I torment him, and he always begs me for more!"

2404
03:35:26,000 --> 03:35:28,000
Yue: "He's quite pitiful, really..."

2405
03:35:28,000 --> 03:35:31,000
Yue: "But that is why I like him so much!"

2406
03:35:31,000 --> 03:35:37,000
*"Pitiful", am I? That's news to me. I didn't think Yue's opinion of me was so low!*

2407
03:35:37,000 --> 03:35:40,000
*I thought she was supposed to love me!*

2408
03:35:40,000 --> 03:35:45,000
*Maybe I got her all wrong, and she actually loves demeaning me...?*

2409
03:35:45,000 --> 03:35:49,000
*If that is the case, she's certainly doing a good job at it!*

2410
03:35:49,000 --> 03:35:56,000
Yue: "You may despair, if you like, in the face of Hiroki's defilement, but it is already too late!"

2411
03:35:56,000 --> 03:36:01,000
Yue: "He is all mine, and I shall not surrender him to any woman: not even you!"

2412
03:36:01,000 --> 03:36:06,000
Yue: "If you wish to speak to him, you ought to wait until I am finished!"

2413
03:36:06,000 --> 03:36:11,000
Yue: "Do not dream of interrupting us, else I shall make you very sorry indeed!"

2414
03:36:11,000 --> 03:36:12,000
Yue: "Ohohoho!"

2415
03:36:12,000 --> 03:36:19,000
*So saying, Yue ends the call with my no doubt bewildered mother, and tosses my phone back to me.*

2416
03:36:19,000 --> 03:36:20,000
Yue: "There, now."

2417
03:36:20,000 --> 03:36:27,000
*She smiles (it looks like she's calmed down, at least), and sitting down beside me on the futon, says...*

2418
03:36:27,000 --> 03:36:32,000
Yue: "Nobody shall interrupt us now. Shall we get down to business?"

2419
03:36:32,000 --> 03:36:36,000
Hiroki: "I'm not opposed to the idea, I guess, but..."

2420
03:36:36,000 --> 03:36:37,000
*I frown.*

2421
03:36:37,000 --> 03:36:46,000
Hiroki: "Did you really have to threaten my mother? You're not going to win any brownie points with her if you act antagonistic."

2422
03:36:46,000 --> 03:36:47,000
Yue: "Hmph!"

2423
03:36:47,000 --> 03:36:48,000
*Yue snorts.*

2424
03:36:48,000 --> 03:36:54,000
Yue: "As if I care what lowly humans think of me! You opinion is the only one that matters!"

2425
03:36:54,000 --> 03:36:59,000
Yue: "You are the only one I care about - and, indeed, the only one I love!"

2426
03:36:59,000 --> 03:37:04,000
Yue: "Now, won't you let me show you how very much I have missed you?"

2427
03:37:04,000 --> 03:37:09,000
Yue: "I've awaited our reunion for so very long, I feel half sick from it..."

2428
03:37:09,000 --> 03:37:14,000
*Yue loops her arm through mine, while pressing her chest against my side.*

2429
03:37:14,000 --> 03:37:18,000
Yue: "But, now we are together again, nothing can tear us apart."

2430
03:37:18,000 --> 03:37:21,000
Yue: "I will never, ever let you get away from me."

2431
03:37:21,000 --> 03:37:23,000
Yue: "Mm, nn... Aah..."

2432
03:37:23,000 --> 03:37:24,000
Yue: "Zzz..."

2433
03:37:24,000 --> 03:37:28,000
*Yue lies in my futon, her dark tresses splayed across my pillow.*

2434
03:37:28,000 --> 03:37:34,000
*Her dark eyelashes are matted together, and there's a small smile playing about her lips.*

2435
03:37:34,000 --> 03:37:43,000
*In sleep, Yue looks far more innocent than she really is; so soft and sweet, no longer looks like the proud, haughty queen of the succubi.*

2436
03:37:43,000 --> 03:37:54,000
*She reminds me, once more, of the girl she was (the girl I thought she was, rather) when I first met her: the aloof, slightly standoffish transfer student, Yukie.*

2437
03:37:54,000 --> 03:37:59,000
*She was my very first girlfriend, back in the day, and I really did love her.*

2438
03:37:59,000 --> 03:38:11,000
*I'd hoped we might stay together, but that didn't happen. I went to university, while Yue - not that I knew it at the time - returned to the succubus realm, to sit upon its throne.*

2439
03:38:11,000 --> 03:38:18,000
*Many years passed, during which I had a few other, assorted relationships, but these never lasted very long.*

2440
03:38:18,000 --> 03:38:21,000
*None of my other girlfriends were quite like Yue.*

2441
03:38:21,000 --> 03:38:30,000
*In the end, what with my busy work schedule, and my constant disappointments when it came to dating, I stopped looking for love altogether.*

2442
03:38:30,000 --> 03:38:39,000
*I'd not been in a proper relationship for several years (to my mother's consternation) when I met Ayu, then Marina, and then...*

2443
03:38:39,000 --> 03:38:41,000
*Well. The rest is history.*

2444
03:38:41,000 --> 03:38:46,000
*In the end, I was able to reunite with Yue, my high school sweetheart.*

2445
03:38:46,000 --> 03:38:55,000
*We didn't meet up in the way I imagined we would, and Yue wasn't quite as I remembered her, but I'm still happy I was able to see her again.*

2446
03:38:55,000 --> 03:39:05,000
*I can't spend too much time with her, despite our reunion, given she's so busy with her myriad duties in the succubus realm, but I cherish her regardless.*

2447
03:39:05,000 --> 03:39:07,000
*She really does mean a lot to me.*

2448
03:39:07,000 --> 03:39:08,000
Hiroki: "Yue..."

2449
03:39:08,000 --> 03:39:13,000
*I murmur Yue's name, while running my fingers through her dark tresses.*

2450
03:39:13,000 --> 03:39:14,000
Yue: "Nn..."

2451
03:39:14,000 --> 03:39:23,000
*Yue stirs in her sleep, but doesn't awake. She must have exhausted herself, after the time we spent together, because she's out cold.*

2452
03:39:23,000 --> 03:39:27,000
*I feel pretty tired myself, but I'm not ready to sleep just yet.*

2453
03:39:27,000 --> 03:39:29,000
*I'm feeling pretty sentimental.*

2454
03:39:29,000 --> 03:39:31,000
Hiroki: "Yue... Thank you."

2455
03:39:31,000 --> 03:39:34,000
*I say softly, now caressing her cheek.*

2456
03:39:34,000 --> 03:39:41,000
Hiroki: "You were my first girlfriend, and while you're not my one and only, you still mean a lot to me."

2457
03:39:41,000 --> 03:39:48,000
Hiroki: "Thank you for asking me out way back when. If you'd not done that, I wonder where I'd be right now."

2458
03:39:48,000 --> 03:39:51,000
Hiroki: "All my early experience, I owe to you."

2459
03:39:51,000 --> 03:39:58,000
Hiroki: "I doubt I'd able to satisfy so many women if you hadn't shown me how a good boyfriend should act."

2460
03:39:58,000 --> 03:40:01,000
Hiroki: "You've helped me more than you know."

2461
03:40:01,000 --> 03:40:02,000
Yue: "Nn... Mm, zz..."

2462
03:40:02,000 --> 03:40:08,000
*Yue turns over in her sleep, then says softly, her eyelids still squeezed shut...*

2463
03:40:08,000 --> 03:40:10,000
Yue: "D-Don't mention it..."

2464
03:40:10,000 --> 03:40:13,000
Yue: "You're, mm... special to me, too..."

2465
03:40:13,000 --> 03:40:14,000
Yue: "Zzzz..."

2466
03:40:14,000 --> 03:40:22,000
*My words of love must have roused her, but Yue soon falls asleep anew; her breathing evening out, and her lips pursing.*

2467
03:40:22,000 --> 03:40:25,000
*I smile to watch her, then lie down at her side.*

2468
03:40:25,000 --> 03:40:33,000
*I have to wonder, as we curl up together, whether my body will be able to handle all these demands put upon it.*

2469
03:40:33,000 --> 03:40:38,000
*I have my own limits, and I think I'm getting close to hitting them.*

2470
03:40:38,000 --> 03:40:45,000
*I'm not sure I can endure much more love from many more women, but all this attention really does feel good.*

2471
03:40:45,000 --> 03:40:47,000
*When I think about it like that...*

2472
03:40:47,000 --> 03:40:51,000
Hiroki: "I must be the luckiest guy in all of Japan."

2473
03:40:51,000 --> 03:40:57,000
*And so it is, with a contented smile, I cuddle up close to Yue... and fall fast asleep.*

2474
03:40:57,000 --> 03:41:03,000
*Time passes, and before I know it, a full month has elapsed since my trip to Astoria.*

2475
03:41:03,000 --> 03:41:09,000
*I return to work, as is to be expected, and once more, I immerse myself in the daily grind.*

2476
03:41:09,000 --> 03:41:21,000
*I'm even more of a social pariah in the office now than I was before, if such a thing is possible, thanks to the recent spate of media attention I've gotten myself embroiled in.*

2477
03:41:21,000 --> 03:41:30,000
*Thanks to Hifumi's on-air confession, the photos snapped of me with Hazel, Marina, and - now - Stephania, I've become somewhat famous...*

2478
03:41:30,000 --> 03:41:35,000
*Though, on second thought, "infamous" might be a more apt choice of words.*

2479
03:41:35,000 --> 03:41:48,000
*My relationships with Cosmos and Ayu are still unknown (it'd spell disaster for both their careers if their fans knew about us), but that does little to soften the general public's opinion of me.*

2480
03:41:48,000 --> 03:41:56,000
*I've seen a lot of unflattering comments written about me in threads online; so much so, I long since stopped checking.*

2481
03:41:56,000 --> 03:42:05,000
*I don't really care what random people across the world think about me and my philandering ways. It's not like I've done anything wrong.*

2482
03:42:05,000 --> 03:42:08,000
*All of my relationships are consensual.*

2483
03:42:08,000 --> 03:42:16,000
*It's harder, however, to ignore my co-workers' obvious enmity towards me: especially when I have to work with them every day.*

2484
03:42:16,000 --> 03:42:23,000
*The atmosphere in the office is unpleasant enough, I often have to pause to compose myself before entering.*

2485
03:42:23,000 --> 03:42:34,000
*It's gotten so bad, I've thought about handing in my notice - but, thanks to all the photos of me circulating on the net, I'd probably be ostracized wherever I go.*

2486
03:42:34,000 --> 03:42:37,000
*Being too popular really can be a problem.*

2487
03:42:37,000 --> 03:42:48,000
*After giving it some thought, I decide to tough my uncomfortable work environment. It's not like my co-workers are directly rude to me, in any case; they just ignore me.*

2488
03:42:48,000 --> 03:42:57,000
*I've not had anybody actively trying to sabotage my work area, or spill tea on me "accidentally on purpose" during lunch break...*

2489
03:42:57,000 --> 03:42:59,000
*Uh, more than once, I mean.*

2490
03:42:59,000 --> 03:43:00,000
*Sigh.*

2491
03:43:00,000 --> 03:43:08,000
*I'm at the office again today, and the air is full of the familiar sound of fingers clattering against keyboards.*

2492
03:43:08,000 --> 03:43:15,000
*Some of my co-workers are murmuring among themselves, but nobody tries to embroil me in conversation.*

2493
03:43:15,000 --> 03:43:24,000
*I swear, I can feel curious eyes burning holes into my back, but when I lift my head, everybody seems ensconced in their work.*

2494
03:43:24,000 --> 03:43:35,000
*I'm not naïve enough to write my discomfort off as my own imagination, but at least my co-workers are making an attempt to keep their disdain for me on the down-low.*

2495
03:43:35,000 --> 03:43:38,000
*I guess that's one thing to feel thankful for?*

2496
03:43:38,000 --> 03:43:46,000
*Another, more important, thing I have to feel thankful for is an upcoming date with Cosmos I have scheduled for this weekend.*

2497
03:43:46,000 --> 03:43:51,000
*That should take my mind off how unpleasant the atmosphere in the office is.*

2498
03:43:51,000 --> 03:44:01,000
*Really, I remind myself, while focusing on my work, I'm very lucky. I have a bunch of beautiful women who adore me, and I adore them in return.*

2499
03:44:01,000 --> 03:44:08,000
*They all have busy schedules, but I've so many partners, now, at least one of them is usually free when I am.*

2500
03:44:08,000 --> 03:44:17,000
*Only last week, I went out to a fancy restaurant with Marina, and the week before, I went on an (ill-advised) cycling trip with Hazel.*

2501
03:44:17,000 --> 03:44:24,000
*There's never a dull moment in my life: not with my succubus harem around, all vying for my attention.*

2502
03:44:24,000 --> 03:44:34,000
*There's Yue, too, who sometimes deigns to visit me, despite her duties in the succubus realm - and, more recently, I've been speaking to Stephania.*

2503
03:44:34,000 --> 03:44:43,000
*We can only communicate via emails and texts, given the vast gulf of distance between us, but messaging her has been a lot of fun.*

2504
03:44:43,000 --> 03:44:55,000
*She uses a surprising amount of cute emojis in her texts, and her writing is almost as full of slang as Cosmos's. She doesn't sound nearly as polite as she does while speaking.*

2505
03:44:55,000 --> 03:45:02,000
*The contrast between Stephania's status as a princess, and her manner of typing, is pretty cute.*

2506
03:45:02,000 --> 03:45:05,000
*Everything about Stephania is cute, really.*

2507
03:45:05,000 --> 03:45:08,000
???: "Hiroki! It's been so long! I missed you!"

2508
03:45:08,000 --> 03:45:09,000
Hiroki: "Huh?"

2509
03:45:09,000 --> 03:45:13,000
*A girlish voice, light and lisping, draws me out of my reverie.*

2510
03:45:13,000 --> 03:45:21,000
*I lift my head, my eyes wide behind the lenses of my glasses, in search of the commotion, which doesn't take very long.*

2511
03:45:21,000 --> 03:45:25,000
*There, standing in my office, as though she owns the place, is...*

2512
03:45:25,000 --> 03:45:26,000
Hiroki: "St-Steffy?!"

2513
03:45:26,000 --> 03:45:29,000
Stephania: "Hiroki! I'm so glad to see you again!"

2514
03:45:29,000 --> 03:45:35,000
Elizabeth: "As am I. It is good to see you again, Mr. Ogasawara. I hope you are faring well."

2515
03:45:35,000 --> 03:45:38,000
*...Ah. It looks like Elizabeth's here, too.*

2516
03:45:38,000 --> 03:45:46,000
*I guess that tracks. Elizabeth is Stephania's faithful maid. Wherever Stephania goes, Elizabeth follows, to keep her safe.*

2517
03:45:46,000 --> 03:45:53,000
*It makes logical sense, in the abstract, but this scenario is so unexpected, I can't help but gawp.*

2518
03:45:53,000 --> 03:45:54,000
Hiroki: "What...?"

2519
03:45:54,000 --> 03:46:00,000
*It's with blank, uncomprehending eyes that I glance between Stephania and Elizabeth.*

2520
03:46:00,000 --> 03:46:12,000
*They look solid enough, but my brain's having a hard time grasping their sudden appearances - in my workplace, no less! - as anything other than a couple of convincing mirages.*

2521
03:46:12,000 --> 03:46:13,000
*Have I gone insane?*

2522
03:46:13,000 --> 03:46:19,000
*It's either that, or I passed out at work, and this is some kind of hyper-detailed dream.*

2523
03:46:19,000 --> 03:46:27,000
*I remove my glasses, rub my eyes, then set my lenses back in place - but still, Stephania and Elizabeth don't waver.*

2524
03:46:27,000 --> 03:46:33,000
*They must be real, I guess. If they weren't, my co-workers wouldn't be mumbling so.*

2525
03:46:33,000 --> 03:46:36,000
Coworker: "Who are these two beauties?"

2526
03:46:36,000 --> 03:46:40,000
Coworker 2: "That blonde girl looks very familiar..."

2527
03:46:40,000 --> 03:46:45,000
Coworker 3: "Don't tell me...! That isn't the Astorian princess, is it?!"

2528
03:46:45,000 --> 03:46:48,000
Coworker: "The princess? You mean, Stephania?"

2529
03:46:48,000 --> 03:46:58,000
Coworker 3: "That's the one! I'd recognize her anywhere! She played against Yamamoto Hifumi in the finals of the national karuta championship!"

2530
03:46:58,000 --> 03:47:04,000
Coworker: "No way! I can't believe a European princess would like karuta that much!"

2531
03:47:04,000 --> 03:47:08,000
Coworker 3: "It's true, it's true! She's very passionate about it!"

2532
03:47:08,000 --> 03:47:11,000
Coworker 2: "She's incredibly cute, too..."

2533
03:47:11,000 --> 03:47:15,000
Coworker 4: "Did she say she was here to see Ogasawara?"

2534
03:47:15,000 --> 03:47:18,000
Coworker 2: "What in the world's going on?!"

2535
03:47:18,000 --> 03:47:21,000
*...Yeah, I'd like to know the answer to that, too.*

2536
03:47:21,000 --> 03:47:26,000
Hiroki: "What are you two doing here? You didn't arrange to meet me, did you?"

2537
03:47:26,000 --> 03:47:28,000
Stephania: "No, but... Um..."

2538
03:47:28,000 --> 03:47:32,000
*Smiling shyly, Stephania toys with a lock of her blonde hair.*

2539
03:47:32,000 --> 03:47:41,000
Stephania: "I hope you can forgive me for the intrusion, Hiroki, but I missed you so greatly, I could no longer control myself."

2540
03:47:41,000 --> 03:47:55,000
Stephania: "Full of yearning as I was, I asked my parents if I could pay a visit to Japan - under Elizabeth's supervision, of course - to thank you for keeping me company during your stay in the palace."

2541
03:47:55,000 --> 03:48:02,000
Stephania: "My parents weren't very keen on the idea, but after much persuasion, I was able to win them over."

2542
03:48:02,000 --> 03:48:11,000
Stephania: "As soon as I secured their permission, I packed my bags, and Elizabeth conveyed me to the airport as fast as possible."

2543
03:48:11,000 --> 03:48:19,000
Stephania: "I was so very excited, and it was such a rush, I hadn't the time to tell you of my plans beforehand!"

2544
03:48:19,000 --> 03:48:23,000
Stephania: "I hoped that you would be happy to see me again..."

2545
03:48:23,000 --> 03:48:26,000
Stephania: "B-But maybe I'm being a bother?"

2546
03:48:26,000 --> 03:48:28,000
*Stephania's face falls.*

2547
03:48:28,000 --> 03:48:31,000
Stephania: "D-Do you no longer like me...?"

2548
03:48:31,000 --> 03:48:40,000
*...Ah, geez. My co-workers' complaints are getting bitterer by the second - as are the glares they're shooting in my direction.*

2549
03:48:40,000 --> 03:48:46,000
Coworker: "Hey, Ogasawara! Where do you get off, making all these hotties fall for you?!"

2550
03:48:46,000 --> 03:48:49,000
Coworker 2: "Are you just trying to show off?!"

2551
03:48:49,000 --> 03:48:53,000
Coworker 3: "I'm starting to get real sick of hearing your name!"

2552
03:48:53,000 --> 03:49:03,000
